"list. Note, that the captcha point <em>default challenge</em> will be "
"used as the challenge type for the created CAPTCHA challenges."
msgstr ""
"Voeg CAPTCHA by alle Drupal-vorms, ongeag die lys van Captcha-punte. "
"Let daarop dat die captcha-punt <em>default challenge</em> gebruik sal "
