msgstr "Voeg ook administrasie-inligting op admin-bladsye by."

msgid ""
"Typically this isn't needed. In some situations, e.g. in the case of "
"demo sites, it can be useful to allow CAPTCHAs on administrative "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Gewoonlik is dit nie nodig nie. In sommige gevalle, bv. in die geval "
"van demonstrasieterreine, kan dit nuttig wees om CAPTCHAs op "
"administratiewe bladsye toe te laat."

msgid ""
"Select the file format for the image. JPEG usually results in smaller "
