msgstr "Die titel wat bo-aan die aksie-aftreklys vertoon word."

msgid ""
"The machine-readable name must be unique, and can only contain "
"lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores. Additionally, it can not "
"be the reserved word \"custom\"."
msgstr ""
"Die masjienleesbare naam moet uniek wees, en kan slegs kleinletters, "
"syfers en onderstrepings bevat. Daarbenewens mag dit nie die "
"gereserveerde woord “custom” wees nie."

