msgid ""
"<strong>Do not add any content to the new site</strong> before "
"upgrading. Any existing content is likely to be overwritten by the "
"upgrade process. See <a href=\":url\">the upgrade preparation "
"guide</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Moenie enige inhoud by die nuwe webwerf voeg nie</strong> "
"voordat dit opgegradeer word. Enige bestaande inhoud word waarskynlik "
"deur die opgraderingsproses oorskryf. Sien <a href=\":url\">die "
"opgraderingsvoorbereidingsgids</a>."

msgid ""
"The upgrade can take a long time. It is better to upgrade from a local "
"copy of your site instead of directly from your live site."
msgstr ""
"Die opgradering kan lank neem. Dit is beter om op te gradeer vanaf "
"’n plaaslike kopie van jou webwerf eerder as om direk vanaf jou "
"lewendige webwerf te werk."

