"%new_widthx%new_height pixels."
msgstr ""
"Die beeld is verander om binne die maksimum toegelate hoogte van "
"%height pixels te pas. Die nuwe afmetings van die veranderde beeld is "
"%new_widthx%new_height pixels."

msgid ""
"The image was resized to fit within the maximum allowed width of "
"%width pixels. The new dimensions of the resized image are "
"%new_widthx%new_height pixels."
msgstr ""
"Die prent is verander om binne die maksimum toegelate breedte van "
"%width pixels te pas. Die nuwe afmetings van die veranderde prent is "
"%new_widthx%new_height pixels."

msgid "One or more files could not be uploaded."
msgstr "Een of meer lêers kon nie opgelaai word nie."

