msgid ""
"Enter a different domain from which to serve oEmbed content, including "
"the <em>http://</em> or <em>https://</em> prefix. This domain needs to "
"point back to this site, or existing oEmbed content may not display "
"correctly, or at all."
msgstr ""
"Voer ’n ander domein in waarvandaan oEmbed-inhoud bedien moet word, "
"insluitend die <em>http://</em>- of <em>https://</em>-voorvoegsel. "
"Hierdie domein moet terugwys na hierdie webwerf, anders mag bestaande "
"oEmbed-inhoud nie korrek nie, of glad nie, vertoon nie."

