"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> of <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. Wanneer jy ’n oplossing vir "
"’n probleem soek, gaan na <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal "
"Support</a> of <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers op Stack "
"Exchange</a>."

