msgstr "URL-herleidinge"

msgid ""
"You are attempting to redirect the page to itself. This will result in "
"an infinite loop."
msgstr ""
"Jy probeer om die bladsy na homself te herlei. Dit sal tot ’n "
"oneindige lus lei."

