"be configured to allow users to view a submission using a secure "
"token."
msgstr ""
"Die URL wat gebruik kan word om die webvorm-insending te besigtig. Die "
"webvorm moet opgestel word om toe te laat dat gebruikers ’n "
"insending kan bekyk deur middel van ’n veilige token."

msgid "Update (token) URL"
msgstr "Dateer (token) URL op"

msgid ""
"Omit the '?' to output all values. Output all values as HTML using "
"[webform_submission:values:html]."
msgstr ""
"Laat die ? weg om alle waardes uit te voer. Voer alle waardes uit as "
"HTML met behulp van [webform_submission:values:html]."

msgid "Allow viewing a submission using token"
msgstr "Laat toe dat ’n indiening met ’n token bekyk word"

msgid "Allow updating a submission using token"
msgstr "Laat opdatering van ’n inskrywing toe deur middel van ’n token"

msgid "Limit per source entity"
msgstr "Beperk per bron-entiteit"

msgid "The Title of the source entity or webform."
msgstr "Die titel van die bron-entiteit of webvorm."

msgid "All users, custom email addresses, and administrators"
msgstr "Alle gebruikers, pasgemaakte e-posadresse en administrateurs"

msgid "Edit webform variants"
msgstr "Wysig webvorm-variantes"

msgid "Allows administrators to create variations of a webform."
msgstr "Laat administrateurs toe om variasies van ’n webvorm te skep."

msgid "Webforms: Variants configuration"
msgstr "Webvorms: Variantkonfigurasie"

msgid "Select a variant"
msgstr "Kies ’n variant"

msgid "Add webform variant"
msgstr "Voeg webvormvariant by"

msgid "Edit webform variant"
msgstr "Wysig webvormvariant"

msgid "Duplicate webform variant"
msgstr "Dupliseer webvormvariant"

msgid "Delete webform variant"
msgstr "Vee webvormvariant uit"

msgid "Apply webform variant"
msgstr "Pas webvormvariant toe"

msgid "View webform variants"
msgstr "Besigtig webvorm-variantes"

msgid "Test webform variants"
msgstr "Toets webvorm-variantes"

msgid "Webform plugins: Variants"
msgstr "Webvorm-invoegtoepassings: Variantes"

msgid "Webform variants"
msgstr "Webvorm-variante"

msgid "Variant plugin ID"
msgstr "Variant-inprop-ID"

msgid "Variant instance ID"
msgstr "Variant-instans-ID"

msgid "Variant element key"
msgstr "Variant element sleutel"

msgid "Variants settings"
msgstr "Variantinstellings"

msgid "Filter category"
msgstr "Filterkategorie"

msgid "Filter state"
msgstr "Filtertoestand"

msgid "Excluded webform variants"
msgstr "Uitgeslote webvormvariante"

msgid "Webform Variant Example"
msgstr "Webvorm-variantvoorbeeld"

msgid "Provides an example of webform variants."
msgstr "Verskaf ’n voorbeeld van webvormvariante."

msgid ""
"If checked, variant information will be displayed onscreen to all "
"users."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal variantinligting op die skerm aan alle gebruikers "
"vertoon word."

msgid "Example of a webform variant."
msgstr "Voorbeeld van ’n webvormvariant."

msgid "Webform [DEPRECATED]"
msgstr "Webvorm [VERAFTREDE/VERAFTREDE]"

msgid ""
"Enter webform information and then click submit, which will redirect "
"you to the appropriate create content form."
msgstr ""
"Voer die webvorminligting in en klik dan op stuur, wat jou na die "
"toepaslike skepinhoudvorm sal herlei."

msgid "Delete all related variants"
msgstr "Skrap alle verwante variante"

msgid "View variants"
msgstr "Bekyk variante"

msgid "Test variants"
msgstr "Toetsvariante"

msgid "Apply variants"
msgstr "Pas variasies toe"

msgid "There are currently no variants setup for this webform."
msgstr "Daar is tans geen variante vir hierdie webvorm opgestel nie."

msgid ""
"This screencast provides an overview of how to use webform variants to "
"create A/B tests, audience segmentation, and personalization."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie skermopname bied ’n oorsig van hoe om webvorm-variantes te "
"gebruik om A/B-toetse, doelgroep-segmenteer en personalisering te "
"skep."

msgid ""
"Webform module now supports variants, which can be used for A/B tests, "
"segmentation, and personalization"
msgstr ""
"Die Webform-module ondersteun nou variasies, wat gebruik kan word vir "
"A/B-toetse, segmentering en verpersoonliking."

msgid "Configuration: Variants"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Variasies"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Variants configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable variants."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy vir die <strong>Variante-konfigurasie</strong> stel "
"administrateurs in staat om variante in of uit te skakel."

msgid ""
"<strong>Variants</strong> are used for A/B testing, segmentation, and "
"personalization."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Variantes</strong> word gebruik vir A/B-toetsing, segmentering "
"en personalisering."

msgid "Plugins: Variants"
msgstr "Invoegtoepassings: Variants"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Variants</strong> page allows variations of a webform to "
"be created and managed for A/B testing, segmentation, and "
"personalization."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Variante</strong> stel jou in staat om variasies "
"van ’n webvorm te skep en te bestuur vir A/B-toetsing, segmentering "
"en personalisering."

msgid "@total variants"
msgstr "@totale variante"

msgid "variants"
msgstr "variante"

msgid "No variant available."
msgstr "Geen variant beskikbaar nie."

msgid "Enter @none to hide this message."
msgstr "Voer @none in om hierdie boodskap weg te steek."

msgid "Apply variants?"
msgstr "Pas variante toe?"

msgid "Delete the selected variants"
msgstr "Vee die geselekteerde variante uit"

msgid "Delete all variants"
msgstr "Vee alle variante uit"

msgid "Do not delete any variants"
msgstr "Moenie enige variante uitvee nie."

msgid "Please select variants to be applied to the webform."
msgstr "Kies asseblief die variante wat op die webvorm toegepas moet word."

msgid "The selected webform variants have been applied and deleted."
msgstr "Die geselekteerde webvormvariante is toegepas en uitgevee."

msgid "The webform variant %title has been applied and deleted."
msgstr "Die webvormvariant %title is toegepas en verwyder."

msgid ""
"The selected webform variants have been applied and all variants have "
"been deleted."
msgstr ""
"Die geselekteerde webvorm-variant(e) is toegepas en alle variante is "
"uitgevee."

msgid ""
"The webform variant %title has been applied and all variants have been "
"deleted."
msgstr "Die webvormvariant %title is toegepas en alle variante is uitgevee."

msgid "The selected webform variants have been applied."
msgstr "Die geselekteerde webvorm-variant(e) is toegepas."

msgid "The webform variant %title has been applied."
msgstr "Die webvormvariant %title is toegepas."

msgid "The webform variant %name has been deleted."
msgstr "Die webvormvariant %name is uitgevee."

msgid "Edit @label variant"
msgstr "Wysig @label-variant"

msgid "The webform variant was successfully added."
msgstr "Die webvormvariant is suksesvol bygevoeg."

msgid "The webform variant was successfully updated."
msgstr "Die webvorm-variant is suksesvol opgedateer."

msgid ""
"Select variants and then click submit, which will redirect you to the "
"@operation form."
msgstr ""
"Kies variante en klik dan op stuur, wat jou na die @operation-vorm sal "
"herlei."

msgid "Filter webforms default category"
msgstr "Filter webvorms verstekkategorie"

msgid ""
"Select the filter webforms default category selected on the <a "
"href=\":href\">webform overview page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kies die filter vir die verstek-kategorie wat op die <a "
"href=\":href\">webvorm-oorwegingsbladsy</a> gekies is."

msgid "Filter webforms default state"
msgstr "Filter webvorms se verstekstatus"

msgid ""
"Select the filter webforms default state selected on the <a "
"href=\":href\">webform overview page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kies die filter se verstekstatus wat op die <a "
"href=\":href\">webvorm-oweroorsigbladsy</a> gekies is."

msgid "Form URL path settings"
msgstr "Vorm-URL-padinstellings"

msgid "Select available variants"
msgstr "Kies beskikbare variante"

msgid "All excluded variants must be manually removed from existing webforms."
msgstr ""
"Alle uitgeslote variante moet handmatig uit bestaande webvorms "
"verwyder word."

msgid "Allow element to be populated using query string parameters."
msgstr ""
"Laat toe dat die element gevul word met behulp van "
"navraagreeksparameters."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module disables page caching of pages that "
"include a CAPTCHA challenge."
msgstr ""
"Neem kennis dat die CAPTCHA-module bladsykasdeberging deaktiveer vir "
"bladsye wat ’n CAPTCHA-uitdaging insluit."

msgid ""
"This is used after a submission has been saved and finalized to the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Dit word gebruik nadat ’n indiening gestoor en in die databasis "
"gefinaliseer is."

msgid "Provides a form element for enabling and tracking webform variants."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n vormelement om webvormvariante in te skakel en op te "
"spoor."

msgid ""
"<strong>ATTENTION DEVELOPERS!!!</strong> Please make sure to download "
"and update the <a href=\":href\">Input Mask</a> library to version "
"5.0.x"
msgstr ""
"<strong>AANDAG ONTWIKKELAARS!!!</strong> Maak asseblief seker dat jy "
"die <a href=\":href\">Input Mask</a>-biblioteek aflaai en opdateer na "
"weergawe 5.0.x."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":href\">Learn more about updating the Webform module's "
"external libraries</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href\">Lees meer oor die opdatering van die Webform-module "
"se eksterne biblioteke</a>"

msgid ""
"Learn more about <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/api/form-api\">Form API in Drupal "
"8</a>."
msgstr ""
"Lees meer oor <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/docs/8/api/form-api\">Form API in Drupal "
"8</a>."

msgid "Do not schedule email if the action should be triggered in the past"
msgstr ""
"Moenie e-pos stuur indien die aksie in die verlede geaktiveer behoort "
"te word nie"

