msgid "Type of downloadable archive"
msgstr "Tipe af aanlyn laaibare argief"

msgid "Customize my table"
msgstr "Pas my tabel aan"

msgid "Allow users to customize the results"
msgstr "Laat gebruikers toe om die resultate aan te pas"

msgid "Cast remote post data"
msgstr "Stel afgeleë posdata saam"

msgid "Allow users to customize the results table"
msgstr "Laat gebruikers toe om die resultate-tabel aan te pas"

msgid ""
"Anonymous user limits are only tracked by the user's browser session. "
"It is recommended that limits per user only be used on forms "
"restricted to authenticated users."
msgstr ""
"Anonieme gebruikerbeperkings word slegs deur die gebruiker se "
"blaaier-sessie dopgehou. Dit word aanbeveel dat beperkings per "
"gebruiker slegs gebruik word op vorms wat beperk is tot geverifieerde "
"(geauthentiseerde) gebruikers."

msgid "Option/checkbox settings"
msgstr "Opsie-/merkblokkie-instellings"

msgid "Disable the option/checkbox"
msgstr "Skakel die opsie/merkblokkie af"

msgid "Remove the option/checkbox"
msgstr "Verwyder die opsie/merkblokkie"

msgid ""
"This message is displayed when the remaining submission is greater "
"than one."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boodskap word vertoon wanneer die oorblywende indiening meer "
"as een is."

msgid "One remaining message"
msgstr "Nog een oorblywende boodskap"

msgid ""
"This message is displayed when there is only one remaining submission "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boodskap word vertoon wanneer daar slegs een oorblywende "
"indiening beskikbaar is."

msgid "None remaining message"
msgstr "Geen oorblywende boodskap nie."

msgid "This message is displayed when there are remaining submissions allows."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boodskap word vertoon wanneer daar nog indienings beskikbaar "
"is."

msgid "This message is displayed when there are not submissions limits."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boodskap word vertoon wanneer daar geen indieningslimiete is "
"nie."

msgid ""
"The message is displayed when an element has validation error is "
"submitted."
msgstr ""
"Die boodskap word vertoon wanneer ’n element met ’n "
"geldigheidsfout ingedien word."

msgid "Define options or checkbox submission limits."
msgstr "Definieer opsies of merkblokkies indieningsperke."

msgid "Examples for Developers | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Voorbeelde vir Ontwikkelaars | Drupal.org"

msgid "more @options"
msgstr "meer @opsies"

msgid "Users can customize the submission results table for all webforms"
msgstr "Gebruikers kan die indieningsresultate-tabel vir alle webvorms aanpas."

msgid "Customize default table"
msgstr "Pas verstek-tabel aan"

msgid ""
"Below you can customize your dedicated results table, which is "
"displayed only to you."
msgstr ""
"Hieronder kan jy jou toegewysde resultate-tabel aanpas, wat slegs vir "
"jou vertoon word."

msgid ""
"Below you can customize the default results table, which is displayed "
"to all users."
msgstr ""
"Hieronder kan jy die verstek-resultatetabel aanpas, wat aan alle "
"gebruikers gewys word."

msgid "Your customized table has been saved."
msgstr "Jou aangepaste tabel is gestoor."

msgid "The default customized table has been saved."
msgstr "Die verstek-aangepaste tabel is gestoor."

msgid "Your customized table has been reset."
msgstr "Jou aangepaste tabel is teruggestel."

msgid "The default customized table has been reset."
msgstr "Die verstek-aangepaste tabel is teruggestel."

msgid "lowercase letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes"
msgstr "kleinkapitaalletters, syfers, onderstrepings en koppeltekens"

msgid "No orphaned submission found."
msgstr "Geen weeskind-verbruikinlewering gevind nie."

msgid "Are you sure you want remove @total orphaned webform submissions?"
msgstr ""
"Is jy seker jy wil die @total weesgemaakte webvorm-inskrywings "
"verwyder?"

msgid "Deleting @total orphaned webform submissions…"
msgstr "Besig om @total weeskind-webvorm-inskrywings uit te vee…"

msgid ""
"Lowercase letters, numbers, underscores, and dashes. (i.e. "
"element-key)"
msgstr ""
"Kleinletters, syfers, onderstrepings en koppeltekens. (dit wil sê "
"element-key)"

msgid "Minimum value can not exceed the maximum value."
msgstr "Minimumwaarde kan nie die maksimumwaarde oorskry nie."

msgid "Label for the minimum value in the scale."
msgstr "Etiket vir die minimum waarde op die skaal."

msgid "Automatically prefix and increment the table's rows and elements"
msgstr ""
"Voeg outomaties ’n voorvoegsel by en verhoog die ry- en "
"elementnommers in die tabel"

msgid "Table row settings"
msgstr "Tabelry-instellings"

msgid "Invalid signature file detected and deleted. (@see @url)"
msgstr "Ongeldige handtekeningslêer opgespoor en uitgevee. (@see @url)"

msgid ""
"Invalid signature file detected and deleted. (@see <a "
"href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"
msgstr ""
"Ongeldige handtekenlêer opgespoor en uitgevee. (@sien <a "
"href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"

msgid "Enable form sharing"
msgstr "Skakel vormdeling aan"

msgid "Enable form sharing for webform nodes"
msgstr "Skakel vormdeling vir webform-nodes aan"

msgid "Shared form theme"
msgstr "Gedeelde vorm-tema"

msgid "Display shared form title"
msgstr "Wys gedeelde vormtitel"

msgid "Shared form page attributes"
msgstr "Gedeelde vormbladsy-eienskappe"

msgid "Default shared form theme"
msgstr "Standaard gedeelde vorm-tema"

msgid "Allows webforms to be shared on other websites using an iframe."
msgstr ""
"Laat webvorms toe om op ander webwerwe gedeel te word deur ’n "
"iframe."

msgid "Code copied to clipboard…"
msgstr "Kopieer na knipbord…"

msgid ""
"To test anonymous user access to the below embedded webform, please "
"log out or open the below link in a new private or incognito window."
msgstr ""
"Om anonieme gebruikers-toegang tot die onderstaande ingebedde webvorm "
"te toets, meld asseblief af of open die onderstaande skakel in ’n "
"nuwe privaat- of inkognitovenster."

msgid ""
"Choose how you want to embed the webform and then copy-n-paste the "
"below code snippet directly into the HTML source of any webpage."
msgstr ""
"Kies hoe jy die webvorm wil insluit en kopieer dan die onderstaande "
"kode-uittreksel direk in die HTML-bron van enige webblad."

msgid ""
"Resizing iframe -- The embedded webform will be responsive and "
"adjusted to fit within the page using an iframe and JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Verander grootte van iframe — Die ingebedde webvorm sal responsief "
"wees en aangepas word om binne die bladsy te pas deur ’n iframe en "
"JavaScript te gebruik."

msgid ""
"Fixed iframe -- The embedded webform will be a fixed size on the page "
"using an iframe with a scrollbar."
msgstr ""
"Vaste iframe — Die ingebedde webvorm sal ’n vaste grootte op die "
"bladsy hê deur ’n iframe met ’n rolbalk te gebruik."

msgid "Resizing iframe code"
msgstr "Verander grootte van iframe-kode"

msgid "Form sharing enabled"
msgstr "Vormdeling geaktiveer"

msgid "Form sharing is enabled for all webforms."
msgstr "Vormdeling is vir alle webvorms geaktiveer."

msgid "If checked, form sharing will be enabled for this webform."
msgstr "As dit gemerk is, sal vormdeling vir hierdie webvorm geaktiveer word."

msgid "If checking, form sharing will be enabled for all webform nodes."
msgstr ""
"As dit nagegaan word, sal vormdeling vir alle webvormnodusse "
"geaktiveer word."

msgid "Select the theme that will be used to render all shared webforms."
msgstr ""
"Kies die tema wat gebruik sal word om al die gedeelde webvorms weer te "
"gee."

msgid "Sort the options by their (translated) labels."
msgstr "Sorteer die opsies volgens hul (vertaalde) etikette."

msgid "Share webform variants"
msgstr "Deel webvorm-variante"

msgid ""
"Provides an element that generates or loads a file that can be "
"attached to a submission or email."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n element wat ’n lêer genereer of laai wat aan ’n "
"indiening of e-pos aangeheg kan word."

msgid "Share variants"
msgstr "Deel variante"

