msgstr "Skakel die opsporing van gebruikers se IP-adresse vir alle webvorms af"

msgid "If checked, a user's IP address will not be recorded for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal ’n gebruiker se IP-adres nie vir alle webvorms "
"aangeteken word nie."

msgid "Webforms for Everyone"
msgstr "Webvorms vir almal"

msgid ""
"This presentation explores how site owners, site builders, and "
"developers can leverage the Webform module for Drupal 8 to build "
"complex and robust forms for their end-users."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie aanbieding ondersoek hoe werfeienaars, werfbouer en "
"ontwikkelaars die Webform-module vir Drupal 8 kan gebruik om komplekse "
"en robuuste vorms vir hul eindgebruikers te bou."

msgid "Broken/missing webform variant plugin."
msgstr "Gebreekte/ontbrekende webvorm-variant-inprop."

msgid "<code>:htmldecode</code> decodes HTML entities in returned value."
msgstr ""
"<code>:htmldecode</code> dekodeer HTML-entiteite in die teruggegewe "
"waarde."

msgid "Hide the next button when auto-forwarding"
msgstr "Versteek die volgende-knoppie wanneer outo-voorwaarts gestuur word"

msgid "Default delete button label"
msgstr "Standaardverwyder-knoppielabel"

msgid ""
"Check if Webform Clientside Validation module is installed when using "
"the Clientside Validation module"
msgstr ""
"Gaan na of die Webform Clientside Validation-module geïnstalleer is "
"wanneer die Clientside Validation-module gebruik word."

msgid "Webform: Clientside validation"
msgstr "Webvorm: Kliëntkant-validasie"

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module installed."
msgstr ""
"Webvorm-klientsideoordrag (Clientside Validation)-module "
"geïnstalleer."

msgid "Webform Clientside Validation module not installed."
msgstr "Die Webform Clientside Validation-module is nie geïnstalleer nie."

msgid ""
"The Webform Clientside Validation module helps support Webform "
"Clientside Validation integration. <a href=\":href\">Disable Webform "
"Clientside Validation warning</a>"
msgstr ""
"Die Webform Clientside Validation-module help om ondersteuning te bied "
"vir die Webform Clientside Validation-integrasie. <a "
"href=\":href\">Skakel Webform Clientside Validation-waarskuwing af</a>"

msgid "Helps support Webform Clientside Validation integration."
msgstr "Help om die Webform-kliëntkantsvalideringsintegrasie te ondersteun."

msgid "Show add element button"
msgstr "Wys “voeg by”-knoppie"

msgid "If unchecked, the add button will be removed from each table row."
msgstr ""
"As dit nie gemerk is nie, sal die byvoegknoppie uit elke tabelry "
"verwyder word."

msgid "If left blank all webforms will be listed in the select menu."
msgstr ""
"Indien dit leeg gelaat word, sal alle webvorms in die kieslys gelys "
"word."

msgid ""
"This is displayed after a draft or submission has been saved to the "
"database. The delete button is also included within the submission "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Dit word vertoon nadat ’n konsep of indiening na die databasis "
"gestoor is. Die verwyder-knoppie is ook ingesluit binne die "
"indieningsinligting."

msgid "Open delete confirmation form in a modal dialog."
msgstr "Open die verwyderbevestigingsvorm in ’n modale dialoog."

msgid "<code>:clear</code> removes the token when it is not replaced."
msgstr ""
"<code>:clear</code> verwyder die token wanneer dit nie vervang word "
"nie."

msgid "Navigate between cards when the left or right arrow is pressed"
msgstr ""
"Navigeer tussen kaarte wanneer die linkerste of regterste pyl gedruk "
"word."

msgid "Include submission data"
msgstr "Sluit indieningsdata in"

msgid "Display webforms as a top-level item in toolbar"
msgstr "Wys webvorms as ’n topvlak-item in die nutsbalk"

msgid "Navigate between cards using left or right arrow keys"
msgstr "Beweeg tussen kaarte met die linker- of regspyltjies"

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be able to move between cards using the left or "
"right arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal gebruikers tussen kaarte kan beweeg met die "
"linkerkant- of regterkantpyltjies."

msgid ""
"Display Webforms as a top-level administration menu item in the "
"toolbar"
msgstr ""
"Wys Webvorms as ’n boonstevlak-administrasiemenu-item in die "
"nutsbalk"

msgid ""
"If checked, the Webforms section will be displayed as a top-level "
"administration menu item in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die Webvorms-afdeling as ’n "
"boonstevlak-administrasie-kieslysitem in die nutsbalk vertoon word."

msgid ""
"Computing complex or multiple values with or without Ajax can be "
"resource intensive and may have performance implications. When "
"possible try limiting or combining computations or consider using "
"custom Twig functions, JavaScript, or PHP."
msgstr ""
"Om komplekse of veelvuldige waardes te bereken, met of sonder Ajax, "
"kan hulpbronintensief wees en moontlike prestasie-impsakte hê. "
"Probeer waar moontlik berekeninge te beperk of te kombineer, of "
"oorweeg dit om pasgemaakte Twig-funksies, JavaScript of PHP te "
"gebruik."

msgid "Include submission properties"
msgstr "Sluit indienings-eienskappe in"

