msgstr "Maksimum diepte van vertoonde geneste spyskaartitems."

msgid "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":hoverintent_src_url\" target=\"_blank\">hoverIntent</a>"

msgid ""
"The features of the <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> module "
"are included in Drupal core since version 10.3 and therefore "
"<strong>it should be uninstalled</strong>.<br>Since the module is no "
"longer needed, it <em>will</em> be removed in future releases of "
"<em>Admin Toolbar</em> when support for versions lower than 10.3 is "
"dropped.<br>\n"
"See issues: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> and <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die funksionaliteit van die <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access "
"Filter</em>-module is sedert weergawe 10.3 in Drupal-kern ingesluit en "
"daarom <strong>behoort dit nie meer geïnstalleer te wees "
"nie</strong>. <br>Aangesien die module nie meer nodig is nie, "
"<em>sal</em> dit in toekomstige weergawes van <em>Admin Toolbar</em> "
"verwyder word wanneer ondersteuning vir weergawes laer as 10.3 laat "
"vaar word.<br>\n"
"Sien kwessies: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> "
"en <a href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."

msgid ""
"If set, the search input will be focused when the user presses the "
"keys: \"Alt + a\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with any "
"existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"As dit ingestel is, sal die soekinvoer gefokus wees wanneer die "
"gebruiker die sleutels druk: “Alt + a”.<br>Deaktiveer hierdie "
"instelling as dit met enige bestaande sleutelbordkonfigurasie in "
"konflik is."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module provides a better user experience for the "
"default Drupal Toolbar.<br>It is a drop-down menu that allows quicker "
"access to all the administration pages in a more efficient way, with "
"fewer clicks and less scrolling.<br><br>The following settings mostly "
"provide advanced configuration of the JavaScript behavior of the "
"Toolbar sticky and hoverIntent."
msgstr ""
"Die Admin Toolbar-module bied ’n beter gebruikerservaring vir die "
"standaard Drupal-Toolbar.<br>Dit is ’n aftreklys wat vinniger "
"toegang tot al die administrasiebladsye moontlik maak op ’n meer "
"doeltreffende manier—met minder kliks en minder blaai.<br><br>Die "
"volgende instellings voorsien meestal gevorderde konfigurasie van die "
"JavaScript-gedrag van die Toolbar se kleef- (sticky) en "
"hoverIntent-funksie."

msgid ""
"By default, the Admin Toolbar sticky behavior is <em>enabled</em> so "
"it stays at the top of the browser window when scrolling up or "
"down.<br>Select <em>Disabled</em> to disable Admin Toolbar's sticky "
"behavior so it stays at the top of the page when scrolling up/down and "
"does not follow the browser window."
msgstr ""
"By verstek is die vaspen-gedrag van die Admin-nutsbalk "
"<em>geaktiveer</em>, sodat dit bo-aan die blaaiervenster bly wanneer "
"jy op of af blaai.<br>Kies <em>Gedeaktiveer</em> om die vaspen-gedrag "
"van die Admin-nutsbalk te deaktiveer sodat dit bo-aan die bladsy bly "
"wanneer jy op/af blaai en nie die blaaiervenster volg nie."

msgid ""
"If set, the toolbar will be hidden or visible when the user presses "
"the keys: \"Alt + p\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with "
"any existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Indien gestel, sal die nutsbalk versteek of sigbaar wees wanneer die "
"gebruiker die sleutels druk: „Alt + p“.<br>Skakel hierdie "
"instelling af as dit met enige bestaande sleutelbordkonfigurasie bots."

msgid ""
"Provides a smoother user experience, where only menu items which are "
"paused over are expanded, to avoid accidental activations.<br>Disable "
"@hoverintent_source_link to use module's default basic JavaScript "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Bied ’n gladder gebruikerservaring, waar slegs kieslysitems wat "
"oorbeweeg word, uitgebrei word om toevallige aktiverings te "
"vermy.<br>Deaktiveer @hoverintent_source_link om die module se verstek "
"basiese JavaScript-gedrag te gebruik."

msgid ""
"Sets the hoverIntent trigger timeout (steps of 250).<br>The higher the "
"value, the longer the menu dropdown stays visible, after the mouse "
"moves out (default: 500ms)."
msgstr ""
"Stel die hoverIntent-sneller se time-out in (stappe van 250).<br>Hoe "
"hoër die waarde, hoe langer bly die menukieslys sigbaar nadat die "
"muis beweeg het (verstek: 500 ms)."

msgid "CKEditor Anchor Link"
msgstr "CKEditor-ankerlenk"

msgid "CKEditor Web link"
msgstr "CKEditor-webskakel"

msgid ""
"This plugin module adds the better link dialog and anchor related "
"features to CKEditor in Drupal 9"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie inpropmodule voeg die beter skakel-dialoog- en ankerverwante "
"kenmerke by tot CKEditor in Drupal 9."

msgid "#@anchor_link"
msgstr "#@anchor_link"

msgid "Anchor links (within the same page)"
msgstr "Anker-skakels (binne dieselfde bladsy)"

msgid "CKEditor Anchor link"
msgstr "CKEditor Anker-skakel"

msgid "Add a note to the backup"
msgstr "Voeg ’n nota by die rugsteun"

msgid "was due @time ago"
msgstr "was toe @time gelede"

msgid "Created the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Het die %label-instellingsprofiel geskep."

msgid "Saved the %label Settings Profile."
msgstr "Het die gestoorde %label-Instellingsprofiel."

msgid "Label for the Backup Source."
msgstr "Etiket vir die rugsteunbron."

msgid ""
"%title must contain only letters, numbers, dashes (-) and underscores "
"(_). And Site Tokens."
msgstr ""
"%title moet slegs letters, syfers, koppelteken-drywe (-) en "
"onderstrepe (_) bevat. En Site Tokens."

msgid "Use <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP Date formatting</a>."
msgstr "Gebruik <a href=\"http://php.net/date\">PHP-datumformatering</a>."

msgid "Label for the Backup Destination."
msgstr "Etiket vir die rugsteunbestemming."

msgid ""
"The number of backups to retain. Once this number is reached, the "
"oldest backup will be deleted to make room for the most recent backup. "
"Leave blank to keep all backups."
msgstr ""
"Die aantal rugsteune wat behou moet word. Sodra hierdie getal bereik "
"word, sal die oudste rugsteun uitgevee word om plek te maak vir die "
"mees onlangse rugsteun. Laat leeg om alle rugsteune te behou."

msgid ""
"In order to encrypt backup files, please install the Defuse "
"PHP-encryption library via Composer with the following command: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. See the <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption Documentation Page</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ten einde rugsteunlêers te enkripteer, installeer die Defuse "
"PHP-encryption-biblioteek via Composer met die volgende opdrag: "
"<code>composer require defuse/php-encryption</code>. Sien die <a "
"href=\"@docs\">Defuse PHP Encryption Dokumentasieblad</a> vir meer "
"inligting."

msgid "All backups"
msgstr "Alle rugsteunkopieë"

msgid "Restore completed at @time"
msgstr "Herstel voltooi om @time"

msgid "Schedules Tab"
msgstr "Skedules-oortjie"

msgid "Download Backup"
msgstr "Laai rugsteun af"

msgid "Choose the backup source."
msgstr "Kies die rugsteunbron."

msgid "Choose the backup settings profile."
msgstr "Kies die rugsteuninstellingsprofiel."

msgid "Choose the destination."
msgstr "Kies die bestemming."

msgid "Choose the schedule backup you want to run."
msgstr "Kies die skedule-rugsteun wat jy wil uitvoer."

msgid "Backup finished with failure"
msgstr "Rugsteun het met ’n mislukking geëindig"

msgid "Exception Message: "
msgstr "Uitsonderingsboodskap:"

msgid ""
"The Backup Destination \"Download\" does not support taking the site "
"offline during backup."
msgstr ""
"Die Rugsteunbestemming “Aflaai” ondersteun nie dat die webwerf "
"tydens die rugsteunlyn vanlyn geneem word nie."

msgid ""
"Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status "
"report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as "
"updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr ""
"Hou CAPTCHA-verwante tellers in die <a "
"href=\":statusreport\">statusverslag</a>. Let daarop dat dit ’n "
"prestasie-penalisasie meebring, aangesien die opdatering van die "
"tellers veroorsaak dat die veranderlike-kas uitgevee word."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module interacts with page caching (see <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">performance settings</a>). Because the "
"challenge should be unique for each generated form, the caching of the "
"page it appears on is prevented. Make sure that these forms do not "
"appear on too many pages or you will lose much caching efficiency. For "
"example, if you put a CAPTCHA on the user login block, which typically "
"appears on each page for anonymous visitors, caching will practically "
"be disabled. The comment submission forms are another example. In this "
"case you should set the <em>Location of comment submission form</em> "
"to <em>Display on separate page</em> in the comment settings of the "
"relevant <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> for better "
"caching efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Neem kennis dat die CAPTCHA-module met bladsye-kasberging (page "
"caching) omgaan (sien <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">prestasie-instellings</a>). Omdat die "
"uitdaging vir elke gegenereerde vorm uniek behoort te wees, word die "
"kasberging van die bladsy waarop dit verskyn, voorkom. Maak seker dat "
"hierdie vorms nie op te veel bladsye verskyn nie, anders verloor jy "
"baie kasdoeltreffendheid. As jy byvoorbeeld ’n CAPTCHA op die "
"gebruikersaanmeldblok plaas, wat tipies op elke bladsy verskyn vir "
"anonieme besoekers, sal kasberging byna prakties gedeaktiveer word. "
"Die kommentaarindieningsvorms is nog ’n voorbeeld. In hierdie geval "
"behoort jy die <em>Ligging van kommentaarindieningsvorm</em> in die "
"kommentaarinstellings van die betrokke <a "
"href=\":contenttypes\">inhoudtipes</a> op <em>Vertoon op aparte "
"bladsy</em> te stel vir beter kasdoeltreffendheid."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">permission</a> "
"won't be offered a challenge. Be sure to grant this permission to the "
"trusted users (e.g. site administrators). If you want to test a "
"protected form, be sure to do it as a user without the <em>Skip "
"CAPTCHA</em> permission (e.g. as anonymous user)."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikers met die <em>Slaan CAPTCHA oor</em> <a "
"href=\":perm\">toestemming</a> sal nie met ’n uitdaging "
"gekonfronteer word nie. Maak seker dat jy hierdie toestemming aan "
"vertroude gebruikers (bv. werfadministrateurs) toestaan. As jy ’n "
"beskermde vorm wil toets, maak seker dat jy dit doen as ’n gebruiker "
"sonder die <em>Slaan CAPTCHA oor</em>-toestemming (bv. as ’n "
"anonieme gebruiker)."

msgid ""
"CAPTCHA session reuse attack detected on @form_id <br/>Posted CAPTCHA "
"token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Expected captcha token: "
"@expected_captcha_token"
msgstr ""
"Opsporing van CAPTCHA-sessiehergebruikaanval op @form_id "
"<br/>Geplaasde CAPTCHA-token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Verwagte "
"CAPTCHA-token: @expected_captcha_token"

msgid ""
"%form_id post blocked by CAPTCHA module: challenge %challenge (by "
"module %module)."
msgstr ""
"%form_id is deur die CAPTCHA-module geblokkeer: uitdaging %challenge "
"(deur module %module)."

msgid ""
"Configurable error message that the user gets when it enters an "
"incorrect CAPTCHA answer."
msgstr ""
"Konfigureerbare foutboodskap wat die gebruiker kry wanneer hy ’n "
"verkeerde CAPTCHA-antwoord invoer."

msgid ""
"Lower and upper IP addresses should be different. Please correct range "
"%ip_range."
msgstr ""
"Laer- en hoër-IP-adresse moet verskil. Maak asseblief die reeks "
"%ip_range reg."

msgid ""
"A CAPTCHA can be added to virtually any Drupal form, through adding an "
"affiliated <em>CAPTCHA Point</em>. Some default <em>CAPTCHA "
"Points</em> are already provided in the <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> "
"section, but arbitrary forms can be easily added and managed."
msgstr ""
"’ n CAPTCHA kan by byna enige Drupal-vorm gevoeg word deur ’ n "
"geaffilieerde <em>CAPTCHA Point</em> by te voeg. Sommige verstek "
"<em>CAPTCHA Points</em> word reeds in die <em>CAPTCHA "
"Point</em>-afdeling voorsien, maar willekeurige vorms kan maklik "
"bygevoeg en bestuur word."

msgid ""
"Enter one IP-address per row in the format XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. "
"Alternatively you can also define IP-address ranges per row in the "
"format XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. No spaces allowed. Your "
"current IP address is %ip_address."
msgstr ""
"Voer een IP-adres per ry in in die formaat XXX.XXX.XXX.XXX. "
"Alternatiewelik kan jy ook IP-adresreekse per ry definieer in die "
"formaat XXX.XXX.XXX.YYY-XXX.XXX.XXX.ZZZ. Geen spasies word toegelaat "
"nie. Jou huidige IP-adres is %ip_address."

msgid "Reload Captcha"
msgstr "Herlaai Captcha"

msgid "Overlay close"
msgstr "Oorleg toemaak"

msgid "Custom (with tokens)"
msgstr "Pasgemaak (met tokens)"

msgid ""
"For token support the <a href=\"@token_url\">token module</a> must be "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Vir token-ondersteuning moet die <a "
"href=\"@token_url\">token-module</a> geïnstalleer wees."

msgid "Plain (mainly for images)"
msgstr "Blote (hoofsaaklik vir beelde)"

