msgid "DOMPurify Library"
msgstr "DOMPurify-biblioteek"

msgid "DOMPurify library"
msgstr "DOMPurify-biblioteek"

msgid "DOMPurify is already present at @path. No download required."
msgstr "DOMPurify is reeds by @path teenwoordig. Geen aflaai is nodig nie."

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the DOMPurify library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush kon nie die DOMPurify-biblioteek vanaf @remote aflaai nie. "
"@exception"

msgid "Error: unable to unzip DOMPurify file."
msgstr "Fout: kon nie die DOMPurify-lêer uitpak nie."

msgid "The DOMPurify library has been successfully downloaded to @path."
msgstr "Die DOMPurify-biblioteek is suksesvol afgelaai na @path."

msgid "Drush was unable to load the DOMPurify library"
msgstr "Drush kon nie die DOMPurify-biblioteek laai nie."

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is not installed. The Colorbox module uses this "
"library to sanitize HTML captions. Without this library, all captions "
"will be treated as plain text. If you intend to have HTML captions in "
"Colorbox content, download the <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify library</a>, "
"extract it, and copy the dist directory into the /libraries/DOMPurify "
"folder in your Drupal installation directory. Specifically, the system "
"looks for /libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> To "
"avoid potential security issues, please only install the dist "
"directory, and not any other files from the archive.<br /><br /> If "
"you do not intend to use HTML captions, you can suppress this warning "
"on the <a href=\"@config\">Colorbox configuration page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Die DOMPurify-biblioteek is nie geïnstalleer nie. Die Colorbox-module "
"gebruik hierdie biblioteek om HTML-onderskrifte skoon te maak. Sonder "
"hierdie biblioteek sal alle onderskrifte as gewone teks behandel word. "
"As jy van plan is om HTML-onderskrifte in Colorbox-inhoud te hê, laai "
"die <a href=\"@url\">DOMPurify-biblioteek</a> af, pak dit uit, en "
"kopieer die dist-gids na die /libraries/DOMPurify-lêergids in jou "
"Drupal-installasiegids. Spesifiek soek die stelsel na "
"/libraries/DOMPurify/dist/purify.min.js. <br /><br /> Om moontlike "
"sekuriteitsprobleme te vermy, installeer asseblief net die dist-gids, "
"en nie enige ander lêers uit die argief nie.<br /><br /> As jy nie "
"van plan is om HTML-onderskrifte te gebruik nie, kan jy hierdie "
"waarskuwing onderdruk op die <a "
"href=\"@config\">Colorbox-konfigurasiebladsy</a>."

msgid ""
"The DOMPurify library is installed. This library will sanitize HTML in "
"Colorbox captions."
msgstr ""
"Die DOMPurify-biblioteek is geïnstalleer. Hierdie biblioteek sal HTML "
"in Colorbox-onderskrifte skoonmaak."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a> library is not "
"installed. This library is necessary if you want to use HTML in "
"Colorbox captions. Without it, all captions will be treated as plain "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Die <a href=\"@dompurify_link\">DOMPurify</a>-biblioteek is nie "
"geïnstalleer nie. Hierdie biblioteek is nodig as jy HTML in "
"Colorbox-onderskrifte wil gebruik. Sonder dit sal alle onderskrifte as "
"gewone teks hanteer word."

msgid ""
"By default, a warning appears on Drupal's status report if this "
"library is missing. Check this box to suppress the warning."
msgstr ""
"By verstek word ’n waarskuwing op Drupal se statusverslag vertoon as "
"hierdie biblioteek ontbreek. Merk hierdie boks om die waarskuwing te "
"onderdruk."

msgid "Node responsive image style"
msgstr "Node-responsiewe beeldstyl"

msgid "Responsive image style for content"
msgstr "Responsiewe beelduitleg vir inhoud"

msgid "Responsive image style for Colorbox"
msgstr "Responssiewe beeldstyl vir Colorbox"

msgid "Responsive content image style: @style"
msgstr "Reageerbare inhoudsbeeldstyl: @style"

msgid "Responsive content image style: Original image"
msgstr "Responsiewe inhoudbeeldstyl: Oorspronklike beeld"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: @style"
msgstr "Colorbox-responsiewe beeldstyl: @style"

msgid "Colorbox responsive image style: Original image"
msgstr "Colorbox-responsiewe beeldstyl: Oorspronklike beeld"

msgid "Colorbox Responsive"
msgstr "Colorbox-responsief"

msgid ""
"If On (default), Colorbox will add a unique per-request token to the "
"gallery id to avoid images being added manually to galleries. The "
"token was added as a security fix but some see the old behavior as an "
"feature and this settings makes it possible to remove the token."
msgstr ""
"As On (by verstek), sal Colorbox ’n unieke, per-versoek-kenmerk by "
"die gallery-ID voeg om te verhoed dat beelde handmatig by galerye "
"gevoeg word. Die kenmerk is bygevoeg as ’n sekuriteitsregstelling, "
"maar sommige beskou die ou gedrag as ’n kenmerk en hierdie "
"instellings maak dit moontlik om die kenmerk te verwyder."

msgid "Colorbox (view modes)"
msgstr "Colorbox (kykmodusse)"

msgid "Config Ignore"
msgstr "Konfigurasie ignoreer"

msgid "Config Ignore Settings"
msgstr "Konfigurasie-ignoreerinstellings"

msgid "List of ignored configurations"
msgstr "Lys van geïgnoreerde konfigurasies"

msgid "Configuration entity names to ignore"
msgstr "Konfigurasie-entiteitsname om te ignoreer"

msgid "Mode of operation"
msgstr "Bedryfsmodus"

msgid "Configuration Ignore settings"
msgstr "Konfigurasie-ignoreerinstellings"

msgid "Ignore certain configuration during imports and exports"
msgstr "Ignoreer sekere konfigurasie tydens invoer en uitvoer"

msgid "Operational mode"
msgstr "Bedryfsmodus"

msgid "lists for import and export ignoring"
msgstr "lyste vir invoer en uitvoer sonder om in ag te neem"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on import"
msgstr "Lys van geïgnoreerde konfigurasies tydens invoer"

msgid "List of ignored configurations on export"
msgstr "Lys van geïgnoreerde konfigurasies tydens uitvoer"

msgid "Settings for advanced ignoring"
msgstr "Instellings vir gevorderde geïgnoreerhouding"

msgid "List of created ignored configurations"
msgstr "Lys van geskepte geïgnoreerde konfigurasies"

msgid "List of updated ignored configurations"
msgstr "Lys van opgedateerde geïgnoreerde konfigurasies"

msgid "List of deleted ignored configurations"
msgstr "Lys van geskrapte geïgnoreerde konfigurasies"

msgid ""
"This setting controls how complicated the configuration is. If you do "
"not have a use-case for a more advanced set-up the recommendation is "
"to keep it simple."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie instelling bepaal hoe ingewikkeld die konfigurasie is. As jy "
"nie ’n gebruiksgeval vir ’n meer gevorderde opstelling het nie, is "
"die aanbeveling om dit eenvoudig te hou."

msgid "The configuration ignored in all cases"
msgstr "Die konfigurasie is in alle gevalle geïgnoreer."

msgid ""
"One configuration name per line.<br />\n"
"Examples: "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>webform.webform</em>)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* "
"(will ignore all config entities that starts with "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> like fields attached to "
"a custom contact form)</li>\n"
"<li>* (will ignore "
"everything)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (will force import for "
"this configuration, even if ignored by a "
"wildcard)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(will ignore the body of the no approval required email setting, but "
"will not ignore other user.mail "
"configuration.)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (will ignore all language "
"collections)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* (will ignore all fr language "
"collection)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* (will ignore all fr "
"field "
"translations)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(will force import for certain field "
"translation)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (will ignore just "
"the site name but in all translations)</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"Een konfigurasienaam per reël.<br />\n"
"Voorbeelde: "
"<ul>\n"
"<li>user.settings</li>\n"
"<li>views.settings</li>\n"
"<li>contact.settings</li>\n"
"<li>webform.webform.* "
"(sal alle konfigurasie-entiteite ignoreer wat begin met "
"<em>webform.webform</em>)</li>\n"
"<li>*.contact_message.custom_contact_form.* "
"(sal alle konfigurasie-entiteite ignoreer wat begin met "
"<em>.contact_message.custom_contact_form.</em> soos velde wat aan ’n "
"pasgemaakte kontakkvorm gekoppel is)</li>\n"
"<li>* (sal alles "
"ignoreer)</li>\n"
"<li>~webform.webform.contact (sal invoer vir hierdie "
"konfigurasie afdwing, selfs al word dit deur ’n wildcard "
"geïgnoreer)</li>\n"
"<li>user.mail:register_no_approval_required.body "
"(sal die liggaam van die e-posinstelling vir geen goedkeuring vereis "
"ignoreer nie, maar sal ander user.mail-konfigurasies nie ignoreer "
"nie.)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|* (sal alle taalversamelings "
"ignoreer)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|* (sal alle fr-taalversamelings "
"ignoreer)</li>\n"
"<li>language.fr|field.field.* (sal alle "
"fr-veldvertalings "
"ignoreer)</li>\n"
"<li>~language.fr|field.field.media.file.field_media_file "
"(sal invoer afdwing vir sekere "
"veldvertalings)</li>\n"
"<li>language.*|system.site:name (sal slegs die "
"webwerfnaam ignoreer, maar in alle vertalings)</li>\n"
"</ul>"

