msgid "Chaos Tools Views"
msgstr "Chaos Tools Views"

msgid ""
"This suite is primarily a set of APIs and tools to improve the "
"developer experience. It also contains a module called the Page "
"Manager whose job is to manage pages. In particular it manages panel "
"pages, but as it grows it will be able to manage far more than just "
"Panels."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie suite is hoofsaaklik ’n stel API’s en nutsprogramme om die "
"ontwikkelaar-ervaring te verbeter. Dit bevat ook ’n module genaamd "
"**Page Manager** waarvan die taak is om bladsye te bestuur. In die "
"besonder bestuur dit paneelbladsye, maar namate dit uitbrei, sal dit "
"veel meer kan bestuur as net Panele."

msgid ""
"Plugins -- tools to make it easy for modules to let other modules "
"implement plugins from .inc files."
msgstr ""
"Inproppe — hulpmiddels om dit maklik te maak vir modules om ander "
"modules toe te laat om inproppe te implementeer vanuit .inc-lêers."

msgid ""
"Exportables -- tools to make it easier for modules to have objects "
"that live in database or live in code, such as \"default views\"."
msgstr ""
"Uitvoerbares — hulpmiddels om dit makliker te maak vir modules om "
"objekte te hê wat óf in die databasis leef óf in kode leef, soos "
"“verstekaansigte”."

msgid ""
"AJAX responder -- tools to make it easier for the server to handle "
"AJAX requests and tell the client what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"AJAX-responsverskaffer – hulpmiddels om dit vir die bediener "
"makliker te maak om AJAX-versoeke te hanteer en om aan die kliënt te "
"sê wat daarmee gedoen moet word."

msgid "Form tools -- tools to make it easier for forms to deal with AJAX."
msgstr ""
"Vormnutsgoed — nutsgoed om dit makliker te maak vir vorms om met "
"AJAX te werk."

msgid ""
"Object caching -- tool to make it easier to edit an object across "
"multiple page requests and cache the editing work."
msgstr ""
"Objekkasberging — ’n hulpmiddel om dit makliker te maak om ’n "
"objek oor verskeie bladsyversoeke heen te wysig en die wysigingswerk "
"te kas."

msgid ""
"Contexts -- the notion of wrapping objects in a unified wrapper and "
"providing an API to create and accept these contexts as input."
msgstr ""
"Kontekste – die idee om voorwerpe in ’n verenigde omhulsel toe te "
"draai en ’n API te verskaf om hierdie kontekste te skep en as "
"insette te aanvaar."

msgid ""
"Modal dialog -- tool to make it simple to put a form in a modal "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Modale dialoog—hulpmiddel om dit maklik te maak om ’n vorm in ’n "
"modale dialoog te plaas."

msgid ""
"Dependent -- a simple form widget to make form items appear and "
"disappear based upon the selections in another item."
msgstr ""
"Afhanklik — ’n eenvoudige vormkenmerk waarmee vormitems kan "
"verskyn of verdwyn op grond van die keuses in ’n ander item."

msgid ""
"Content -- pluggable content types used as panes in Panels and other "
"modules like Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Inhoud – plooibare inhoudstipes wat as panele in Panels en ander "
"modules soos Dashboard gebruik word."

msgid "Form wizard -- an API to make multi-step forms much easier."
msgstr "Vorm-towenaar — ’n API om meerstapvorms baie makliker te maak."

msgid ""
"CSS tools -- tools to cache and sanitize CSS easily to make user-input "
"CSS safe."
msgstr ""
"CSS-instrumente — instrumente om CSS maklik te kas en te ontsmet "
"sodat gebruikersingevoerde CSS veilig is."

