msgid ""
"The Drupal application's codebase must be writable in order to use "
"Automatic Updates. This includes Drupal core, modules, themes and the "
"Composer dependencies in the <code>vendor</code> directory. This makes "
"Automatic Updates incompatible with some hosting platforms."
msgstr ""
"Die Drupal-toepassing se kodebasis moet skryfbaar wees om van "
"Outomatiese Opdaterings gebruik te kan maak. Dit sluit Drupal-kern, "
"modules, temas en die Composer-afhanklikhede in die "
"<code>vendor</code>-gids in. Dit maak Outomatiese Opdaterings "
"onversoenbaar met sommige gasheerplatforms."

msgid ""
"Staged changes failed to apply, and the site is in an indeterminate "
"state. It is strongly recommended to restore the code and database "
"from a backup."
msgstr ""
"Gefaseerde wysigings kon nie toegepas word nie, en die webwerf is in "
"’n onbepaalde toestand. Dit word sterk aanbeveel om die kode en "
"databasis vanaf ’n rugsteun te herstel."

msgid ""
"Post-apply tasks are running in the same request during which staged "
"changes were applied to the active code base. This can result in "
"unpredictable behavior."
msgstr ""
"Ná-toepassingstake word uitgevoer in dieselfde versoek waarin die "
"verhoogde wysigings op die aktiewe kodebasis toegepas is. Dit kan tot "
"onvoorspelbare gedrag lei."

msgid ""
"API module providing functionality to stage package installs and "
"updates with Composer."
msgstr ""
"API-module wat funksionaliteit verskaf om pakketinstallasies en "
"opdaterings met Composer te beplan."

msgid "There is not enough disk space to create a stage directory."
msgstr "Daar is nie genoeg skyfspasie om ’n stadiumgids te skep nie."

msgid ""
"The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file as "
"compared to @active_count in the active directory. This likely "
"indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"Die stage-gids bevat @stage_count eksemplare van @stage_info_file in "
"vergelyking met @active_count in die aktiewe gids. Dit dui waarskynlik "
"daarop dat ’n duplikaat-uitbreiding geïnstalleer is."

msgid ""
"The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file. "
"This likely indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"Die opstelmap bevat @stage_count eksemplare van @stage_info_file. Dit "
"dui waarskynlik daarop dat ’n duplikaat-uitbreiding geïnstalleer "
"is."

msgid "The stage root directory will not able to be created at \"@dir\"."
msgstr ""
"Die wortelmap van die opvoerfase sal nie by “@dir” geskep kan word "
"nie."

msgid "The stage root directory \"@dir\" is not writable."
msgstr "Die stadium se hoofgids “@dir” is nie skryfbaar nie."

msgid ""
"It only allows supported Composer plugins. If you have any, see <a "
"href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">What if it "
"says I have unsupported Composer plugins in my codebase?</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dit laat slegs ondersteunde Composer-inproppe toe. As jy enige het, "
"sien <a href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">Wat "
"as dit sê ek het onondersteunde Composer-inproppe in my "
"kodebasis?</a>."

msgid ""
"If <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> is installed, it must be "
"defined as a dependency of the main project (i.e., it must be listed "
"in the <code>require</code> or <code>require-dev</code> section of "
"<code>composer.json</code>). You can run the following command in your "
"site root to add it as a dependency of the main project:"
msgstr ""
"As <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> geïnstalleer is, moet dit "
"as ’n afhanklikheid van die hoofprojek gedefinieer word (dit wil sê "
"dit moet in die <code>require</code>- of "
"<code>require-dev</code>-gedeelte van <code>composer.json</code> gelys "
"word). Jy kan die volgende opdrag in jou webwerf se wortelgids uitvoer "
"om dit as ’n afhanklikheid van die hoofprojek by te voeg:"

msgid "Cannot claim the stage because no stage has been created."
msgstr "Kan nie die verhoog(een) eis nie, omdat geen verhoog geskep is nie."

msgid ""
"All composer plugins are allowed because "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> is configured to <code>true</code>. "
"This is an unacceptable security risk."
msgstr ""
"Alle composer-inproppe word toegelaat omdat "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> op <code>true</code> ingestel is. "
"Dit is ’n onaanvaarbare sekuriteitsrisiko."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Extension exists"
msgstr "Uitbreiding bestaan reeds"

msgid ""
"The breakpoint group typically only needs a single breakpoint with an "
"empty media query in order to do <em>viewport sizing.</em> Multiple "
"breakpoints are used for changing the crop or aspect ratio of images "
"at different viewport sizes, which is often referred to as <em>art "
"direction.</em> A new breakpoint group should be created for each "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shift. Once you select a breakpoint "
"group, you can choose which breakpoints to use for the responsive "
"image style. By default, the option <em>do not use this "
"breakpoint</em> is selected for each breakpoint. See the <a "
"href=\":breakpoint_help\">help page of the Breakpoint module</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Die breekpuntgroep het gewoonlik net een enkele breekpunt nodig met "
"’n leë media-navraag om <em>viewport-sizing</em> te doen. Meerdere "
"breekpunte word gebruik om die uitsny- of aspekverhouding van beelde "
"te verander by verskillende skermgroottes, wat dikwels na verwys word "
"as <em>kunsrigting</em> (<em>art direction</em>). ’n Nuwe "
"breekpuntgroep moet vir elke aspekverhouding geskep word om "
"inhoudverskuiwing te vermy. Sodra jy ’n breekpuntgroep gekies het, "
"kan jy kies watter breekpunte gebruik moet word vir die responsiewe "
"beeldstyl. Standaard is die opsie <em>moenie hierdie breekpunt gebruik "
"nie</em> vir elke breekpunt gekies. Sien die <a "
"href=\":breakpoint_help\">hulppagina van die Breakpoint-module</a> vir "
"meer inligting."

msgid ""
"Composer must be configured for secure downloads. This means that <a "
"href=\":disable-tls\">the <code>disable-tls</code> option</a> must be "
"<code>false</code>, and <a href=\":secure-http\">the "
"<code>secure-http</code> option</a> must be <code>true</code> in the "
"<code>config</code> section of your <code>composer.json</code> file. "
"If these options are not set in your <code>composer.json</code>, "
"Composer will behave securely by default. To set these values at the "
"command line, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Composer moet vir veilige aflaaie gekonfigureer word. Dit beteken dat "
"<a href=\":disable-tls\">die <code>disable-tls</code>-opsie</a> "
"<code>false</code> moet wees, en <a href=\":secure-http\">die "
"<code>secure-http</code>-opsie</a> <code>true</code> moet wees in die "
"<code>config</code>-afdeling van jou <code>composer.json</code>-lêer. "
"As hierdie opsies nie in jou <code>composer.json</code> gestel is nie, "
"sal Composer by verstek veilig optree. Om hierdie waardes vanaf die "
"opdraglyn te stel, voer die volgende opdragte uit:"

msgid "Problem detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgid_plural "Problems detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgstr[0] ""
"Probleem wat tydens stadium-operasies in die sluitlêer opgespoor is. "
"Probleme wat tydens stadium-operasies in die sluitlêer opgespoor is."

msgid ""
"The stage directory is not protected by PHP-TUF, which is required to "
