msgstr ""
"Die stage-gids word nie deur PHP-TUF beskerm nie, wat vereis word om "
"die Pakketbestuurder veilig te gebruik."

msgid ""
"There appear to be no pending Composer operations because the active "
"lock file (@active_file) and the staged lock file (@staged_file) are "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"Daar blyk geen hangende Composer-operasies te wees nie, omdat die "
"aktiewe slotlêer (@active_file) en die voorbereide (gestageerde) "
"slotlêer (@staged_file) identies is."

msgid "The field %field has been deleted from the %type %source_label."
msgstr "Die veld %field is uit die %type %source_label verwyder."

msgid "Stage directory cleaner"
msgstr "Stadiumgids-skoonmaker"

msgid ""
"Include unrecognized files and directories in the project root in "
"staging operations"
msgstr ""
"Sluit nie-erkende lêers en gidse in die projekwortel in tydens "
"staging-bedrywighede in"

msgid "Rebuild content access permissions"
msgstr "Herbou inhoudtoegangstoestemmings"

msgid ""
"The @name config object does not contain any translatable values, so "
"it should not specify a language code."
msgstr ""
"Die @name-konfigurasieobjek bevat geen vertaalbare waardes nie, daarom "
"behoort dit nie ’n taalkode te spesifiseer nie."

msgid ""
"Path of a file to which Composer Stager process output should be "
"logged"
msgstr ""
"Pad van ’n lêer waarheen die uitset van die Composer Stager-proses "
"aangeteken moet word"

msgid "TUF is not enabled for the <code>@url</code> repository."
msgstr "TUF is nie geaktiveer vir die <code>@url</code>-bewaarplek nie."

msgid ""
"The Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module is a Feature Flag "
"module which exposes all fields on all bundles as field blocks for use "
"in Layout Builder."
msgstr ""
"Die **Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks**-module is ’n "
"**Feature Flag**-module wat alle velde op alle bundels as veldblokke "
"beskikbaar stel vir gebruik in **Layout Builder**."

msgid ""
"For example, if Layout Builder is enabled on a Node bundle (Content "
"type), and that bundle's display is using field blocks from the User "
"entity (e.g. the Author's name), but Layout Builder is not enabled for "
"the User bundle, then that field block would no longer exist after "
"uninstalling this module."
msgstr ""
"Byvoorbeeld, as Layout Builder op ’n Nod-bundel (Inhoudstipe) "
"geaktiveer is, en daardie bundel se vertoning veldblokke van die "
"Gebruiker-entiteit gebruik (bv. die skrywer se naam), maar Layout "
"Builder nie op die Gebruiker-bundel geaktiveer is nie, dan sal daardie "
"veldblok nie meer bestaan nadat hierdie module gedeïnstalleer is nie."

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the <a "
"href=\":moderation\">Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan <em>slegs</em> werkswyses byvoeg op die <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Werkswyses-bladsy</a>, nadat jy ’n module "
"geïnstalleer het wat die API benut, soos die <a "
"href=\":moderation\">Inhoudmoderering-module</a>."

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the Content Moderation module."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan <em>slegs</em> werksvloei’s by die <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Werksvloei’s-bladsy</a> byvoeg nadat jy ’n "
"module geïnstalleer het wat die API benut, soos die Content "
"Moderation-module."

msgid ""
"A workflow requires at least two states. States can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"’n Werksvloei vereis ten minste twee toestande. Toestande kan "
"bygevoeg word wanneer jy ’n werksvloei byvoeg of wysig op die <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Werkvloei-bladsy</a>."

msgid ""
"A transition defines in which state an item can be save as next. It "
"has one destination state, but can have several states <em>from</em> "
"which the transition can be applied. Transitions can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"’n Oorgang bepaal in watter toestand ’n item as die volgende "
"gestoorde kan word. Dit het een bestemmingsstaat, maar kan verskeie "
"state hê <em>waarvandaan</em> die oorgang toegepas kan word. Oorgange "
"kan bygevoeg word wanneer jy ’n werkvloei byvoeg of wysig op die <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Werkvloei-bladsy</a>."

msgid ""
"The UploadProgress PHP extension must be enabled to configure the "
"progress indicator. Check the <a href=\":status\">status report</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Die UploadProgress PHP-uitbreiding moet geaktiveer word om die "
"vorderingsaanwyser op te stel. Gaan die <a "
"href=\":status\">statusverslag</a> na vir meer inligting."

msgid "Whether or not to enable TLS opportunistically (defaults to true)."
msgstr ""
"Of TLS moontlik (opportunisties) geaktiveer moet word al dan nie "
"(standaard is waar)."

msgid "Whether or not to enforce TLS (defaults to false)."
msgstr "Of TLS afgedwing moet word (standaard is onwaar)."

msgid "Bind to a specific IPv4 or IPv6 address (no default)."
msgstr "Bind aan ’n spesifieke IPv4- of IPv6-adres (geen verstek)."

