msgstr "Inline speel: %playsinline"

msgid ""
"The core Language module lets you add new languages to your site, "
"provides the <em>Language switcher</em> block, and provides the "
"ability to configure block visibility by language; the block and block "
"visibility settings are only available if you have multiple languages "
"configured. The core Content Translation, Configuration Translation, "
"and Interface Translation modules let you translate content, "
"configuration, and the built-in user interface, respectively. The core "
"Locale module manages automatic downloads of community-provided "
"translations of default configuration and user-interface text if the "
"core Update Status module is installed. See the related topics listed "
"below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"Die kern-Languagemodule stel jou in staat om nuwe tale by jou werf te "
"voeg, verskaf die <em>Taalwisselaar</em>-blok, en bied die vermoë om "
"bloksigbaarheid volgens taal op te stel; die blok- en "
"bloksigbaarheidsinstellings is slegs beskikbaar as jy meer as een taal "
"gekonfigureer het. Die kernmodules vir Inhoudvertaling, "
"Konfigurasievertaling en Koppelvlakvertaling stel jou onderskeidelik "
"in staat om inhoud, konfigurasie en die ingeboude gebruikerskoppelvlak "
"te vertaal. Die kern-Locale-module bestuur outomatiese aflaaie van "
"gemeenskapsvoorsiene vertalings van verstekkonfigurasie en teks vir "
"die gebruikerskoppelvlak indien die kernmodule Update Status "
"geïnstalleer is. Sien die verwante onderwerpe wat hieronder gelys is "
"vir spesifieke take."

msgid ""
"Wait for the translation system to be updated. Also, if you have the "
"core Update Status module installed and translations are available for "
"your language, wait for translations to be downloaded. You should be "
"returned to the <em>Languages</em> page when this completes."
msgstr ""
"Wag totdat die vertalingstelsel opgedateer is. As jy ook die "
"kernmodule **Update Status** geïnstalleer het en vertalings vir jou "
"taal beskikbaar is, wag dan totdat die vertalings afgelaai is. Jy "
"behoort teruggeneem te word na die bladsy **<em>Tale</em>** wanneer "
"dit voltooi is."

msgid "Ignoring already imported translation for %project."
msgstr "Ignoreer reeds ingevoerde vertaling vir %project."

msgid ""
"Obsolete. All the functionality has been moved to the navigation "
"module."
msgstr "Afgelist. Al die funksionaliteit is na die navigasiemodule geskuif."

msgid ""
"Forms and links inside the content of the layout builder tool are "
"disabled in Edit mode."
msgstr ""
"Vorms en skakels binne die inhoud van die uitlegbouer-nutsmiddel is "
"gedeaktiveer in Wysig-modus."

msgid "@state_label (@active_state_label available)"
msgstr "@state_label (@active_state_label beskikbaar)"

msgid "Page Context"
msgstr "Bladsy-konteks"

msgid "Administrative top bar"
msgstr "Administratiewe topbalk"

msgid "This filter has no effect because the %module module controls access."
msgid_plural ""
"This filter has no effect because these modules control access: "
"%modules."
msgstr[0] ""
"Hierdie filter het geen effek nie, omdat die %module-module toegang "
"beheer. Hierdie filter het geen effek nie, omdat hierdie modules "
"toegang beheer: %modules."

msgid "Content status filter"
msgstr "Inhoudstatusfilter"

msgid "Redundant filters detected"
msgstr "Oortollige filters opgespoor"

msgid ""
"The %view view uses the %status_filter filter but it has no effect "
"because the following module(s) control access: %modules. Review and "
"consider removing the filter."
msgid_plural ""
"The following views use the %status_filter filter but it has no effect "
"because the following module(s) control access: %modules. Review and "
"consider removing the filter from these views: @views"
msgstr[0] ""
"Die %view-aansig gebruik die %status_filter-filter, maar dit het geen "
"effek nie omdat die volgende module(s) toegang beheer: %modules. Gaan "
"die filter na en oorweeg dit om dit te verwyder."
msgstr[1] ""
"Die volgende aansigte gebruik die %status_filter-filter, maar dit het "
"geen effek nie omdat die volgende module(s) toegang beheer: %modules. "
"Gaan die filter na en oorweeg dit om dit uit hierdie aansigte te "
"verwyder: @views"

msgid "Direct-write is enabled. Skipping sandboxing."
msgstr "Direk-skryf is geaktiveer. Word oorgeslaan om te sandbox."

msgid ""
"Direct-write is enabled. Changes have been made to the running code "
"base."
msgstr ""
"Direkte skryfte is geaktiveer. Daar is veranderinge aan die lopende "
"kodebasis aangebring."

msgid ""
"Direct-write mode is enabled, which means that changes will be made "
"without sandboxing them first. This can be risky and is not "
"recommended for production environments. For safety, your site will be "
"put into maintenance mode while dependencies are updated."
msgstr ""
"Direkteskryfmodus is geaktiveer, wat beteken dat veranderinge "
"aangebring sal word sonder om dit eers te hersien in ’n "
"sandbox-omgewing. Dit kan riskant wees en word nie aanbeveel vir "
"produksie-omgewings nie. Ter wille van veiligheid sal jou webwerf in "
"onderhoudmodus geplaas word terwyl afhanklikhede opgedateer word."

msgid "The sandbox directory is a subdirectory of the active directory."
msgstr "Die sandbox-gids is ’n subgids van die aktiewe gids."

msgid "The pg_trgm PostgreSQL extension is present."
msgstr "Die pg_trgm PostgreSQL-uitbreiding is teenwoordig."

msgid "%profile_name (%profile%version)"
msgstr "%profile_name (%profile%weergawe)"

msgid ""
"Drupal is unable to generate highly randomized numbers, which means "
"certain security features like password reset URLs are not as secure "
"as they should be. Instead, only a slow, less-secure fallback "
"generator is available. The most likely cause is that open_basedir "
"restrictions are in effect and /dev/urandom is not on the allowed "
"list. See the <a href=\":drupal-php\">system requirements</a> page for "
"more information. %exception_message"
msgstr ""
"Drupal kan nie hoogs ewekansige getalle genereer nie, wat beteken dat "
"sekere sekuriteitskenmerke soos wagwoordterugstel-URL’s nie so "
"veilig is soos wat dit behoort te wees nie. In plaas daarvan is slegs "
"’n stadige, minder-sekuriteitsvervangingsgenerator beskikbaar. Die "
"mees waarskynlike oorsaak is dat open_basedir-beperkings van krag is "
"en dat /dev/urandom nie op die toegelate lys is nie. Sien die <a "
"href=\":drupal-php\">stelselvereistes</a>-bladsy vir meer inligting. "
"%exception_message"

msgid ""
"Update notifications are not enabled. It is <strong>highly "
"recommended</strong> that you install the Update Status module from "
"the <a href=\":module\">module administration page</a> in order to "
"stay up-to-date on new releases. For more information, <a "
"href=\":update\">Update status handbook page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Opdateringskennisgewings is nie geaktiveer nie. Dit is <strong>sterk "
"aan te beveel</strong> dat jy die Update Status-module vanaf die <a "
"href=\":module\">module-administrasieblad</a> installeer om op hoogte "
"te bly van nuwe vrystellings. Vir meer inligting, <a "
"href=\":update\">Update status handboekblad</a>."

msgid ""
"If you have the core Update Status module installed, in the "
"<em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>Available updates</em> to see a report of the updates that are "
"available for your site software. If <em>Last checked</em> is far in "
"the past, click <em>Check manually</em> to update the report. Scan the "
"report; if the core software or any modules or themes have security "
"updates available, you should update them as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"As jy die kern-Module vir Opdateringsstatus geïnstalleer het, gaan in "
"die <em>Beheer</em>-administrasiemenu na <em>Verslae</em> &gt; "
"<em>Beskikbare opdaterings</em> om ’n verslag te sien van die "
"opdaterings wat beskikbaar is vir jou werf se sagteware. As <em>Laatst "
"nagegaan</em> ver terug in die verlede is, klik <em>Gaan handmatig "
"na</em> om die verslag op te dateer. Blaai deur die verslag; as daar "
"sekuriteitsopdaterings vir die kernsagteware of vir enige modules of "
"temas beskikbaar is, moet jy dit so gou moontlik opdateer."

msgid ""
"Regularly review available updates and update as required to maintain "
"a secure and current site. Always run the <a "
"href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time a module is updated. "
"Install the <a href=\":update-status\">Update Status module</a> to see "
"a report of available releases for Drupal Core and contributed modules "
"and themes."
msgstr ""
"Gereeld hersien die beskikbare opdaterings en werk dit op soos nodig "
"om ’n veilige en bygewerkte webwerf te handhaaf. Laat altyd die <a "
"href=\":update-php\">opdateringskripsie</a> loop elke keer wanneer "
"’n module opgedateer word. Installeer die <a "
"href=\":update-status\">Update Status-module</a> om ’n verslag te "
"sien van beskikbare vrystellings vir Drupal Core en bygedra modules en "
"temas."

msgid "Update Status settings"
msgstr "Werk statusinstellings op"

msgid ""
"The Update Status module periodically checks for new versions of your "
"site's software (including contributed modules and themes), and alerts "
"administrators to available updates. The Update Status system is also "
"used by some other modules to manage updates and downloads; for "
"example, the Interface Translation module uses the Update Status to "
"download translations from the localization server. Note that whenever "
"the Update Status system is used, anonymous usage statistics are sent "
"to Drupal.org. If desired, you may uninstall the Update Status module "
"from the <a href=\":modules\">Extend page</a>; if you do so, "
"functionality that depends on the Update Status system will not work. "
"For more information, see the <a href=\":update\">online documentation "
"for the Update Status module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die Update Status-module kontroleer periodiek vir nuwe weergawes van "
"jou webwerf se sagteware (insluitend bygedra-modules en temas), en "
"stel administrateurs in kennis van beskikbare opdaterings. Die Update "
"Status-stelsel word ook deur sommige ander modules gebruik om "
"opdaterings en aflaaie te bestuur; byvoorbeeld gebruik die Interface "
"Translation-module Update Status om vertalings van die "
"lokaliseringbediener af te laai. Let daarop dat, wanneer die Update "
"Status-stelsel ook al gebruik word, anonieme gebruikstatistieke na "
"Drupal.org gestuur word. Indien verkies, kan jy die Update "
"Status-module van die <a href=\":modules\">Uitbrei-blad</a> "
"deïnstalleer; as jy dit doen, sal funksionaliteit wat van die Update "
"Status-stelsel afhang, nie werk nie. Vir meer inligting, sien die <a "
"href=\":update\">aanlyn dokumentasie vir die Update Status-module</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":update-report\">Available updates report</a> displays "
"core, contributed modules, and themes for which there are new releases "
"available for download. On the report page, you can also check "
"manually for updates. You can configure the frequency of update "
"checks, which are performed during cron runs, and whether "
"notifications are sent on the <a href=\":update-settings\">Update "
"Status settings page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die <a href=\":update-report\">Beskikbare opdateringsverslag</a> wys "
"kern-, bygedra-modules en temas waarvoor daar nuwe vrystellings "
"beskikbaar is om af te laai. Op die verslagbladsy kan jy ook handmatig "
"vir opdaterings kyk. Jy kan die frekwensie van opdateringsondersoeke "
"instel, wat tydens cron-uitvoerings plaasvind, en of kennisgewings "
"gestuur word op die <a "
"href=\":update-settings\">Opdateringsstatus-instellingsbladsy</a>."

msgid ""
"The core User module allows users to register, log in, and log out, "
"and administrators to manage user roles and permissions. Depending on "
"which modules you have installed on your site, the related topics "
"below will help you with tasks related to managing user accounts and "
"visitors."
msgstr ""
"Die kern-User-module laat gebruikers toe om te registreer, aan te meld "
"en af te meld, en administrateurs om gebruikersrolle en -toestemmings "
"te bestuur. Afhangend van watter modules jy op jou werf geïnstalleer "
"het, sal die verwante onderwerpe hieronder jou help met take wat "
"verband hou met die bestuur van gebruikersrekeninge en besoekers."

msgid "Table class"
msgstr "Tabelklas"

msgid "@label view mode"
msgstr "@label aansigmodus"

msgid "How should each row in this view be output"
msgstr "Hoe moet elke ry in hierdie aansig uitgestuur word?"

msgid ""
"If neither the row nor the style plugin supports fields, this field "
"allows to enable them, so you can for example use group by."
msgstr ""
"As nie die ry of die styl-inprop velde ondersteun nie, laat hierdie "
"veld jou toe om dit te aktiveer sodat jy byvoorbeeld groepering "
"volgens kan gebruik."

msgid "Table CSS classes"
msgstr "Tabel CSS-klasifikasies"

msgid ""
"Classes to provide on the table. Separate multiple classes with a "
"space. Example: classA classB"
msgstr ""
"Klasse om op die tabel te verskaf. Skei veelvuldige klasse met ’n "
"spasie. Voorbeeld: classA classB"

msgid "output as"
msgstr "uitvoer as"

msgid "This site is intended for demonstration purposes."
msgstr "Hierdie webwerf is bedoel vir demonstrasiedoeleindes."

msgid "Add component(s) to layout"
msgstr "Voeg komponent(e) by tot die uitleg"

msgid ""
"The %field date is invalid. Date should be in the %min-%max year "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Die %field-datum is ongeldig. Die datum moet binne die "
"%min-%max-jaarreeks wees."

msgid "Composer was found at %path, but could not be made read-only."
msgstr "Composer is gevind by %path, maar kon nie leesalleen gemaak word nie."

msgid ""
"If the <code>composer</code> executable's path cannot be automatically "
"determined, you will need to add Composer to your project by running "
"the following command: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>:"
msgstr ""
"As die pad na die <code>composer</code>-uitvoerbare nie outomaties "
"bepaal kan word nie, moet jy Composer by jou projek voeg deur die "
"volgende opdrag uit te voer: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>:"

msgid ""
"The version of the <code>composer</code> executable must satisfy "
"<code>@version</code>. See the <a href=\":url\">the Composer "
"documentation</a> for more information, or use this command to add "
"Composer to your project: <code>composer require "
"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"Die weergawe van die <code>composer</code>-uitvoerbare lêer moet "
"voldoen aan <code>@version</code>. Sien die <a "
"href=\":url\">Composer-dokumentasie</a> vir meer inligting, of gebruik "
"hierdie opdrag om Composer by jou projek te voeg: <code>composer "
"require \"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"

msgid ""
"The path to Composer is set in configuration, which is no longer "
"supported. To fix this, add <code>composer/composer</code> to your "
"project's dependencies by running <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code>, <em>or</em> add the following "
"line to <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Die pad na Composer is in konfigurasie gestel, wat nie meer ondersteun "
"word nie. Om dit reg te stel, voeg <code>composer/composer</code> by "
"jou projek se afhanklikhede deur <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code> uit te voer, <em>of</em> voeg die "
"volgende reël by <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. Sien <a href=\":url\">hierdie "
"wysigingsrekord</a> vir meer inligting."

msgid "Path to <code>rsync</code> is configured"
msgstr "Pad na <code>rsync</code> is gekonfigureer"

msgid ""
"The path to <code>rsync</code> is set in configuration, which is no "
"longer supported. To fix this, add the following line to "
"<code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Die pad na <code>rsync</code> word in konfigurasie ingestel, wat nie "
"meer ondersteun word nie. Om dit reg te stel, voeg die volgende lyn by "
"<code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"Sien <a href=\":url\">hierdie wysigingsrekord</a> vir meer inligting."

msgid ""
"A unique machine-readable name. Can only contain lowercase letters, "
"numbers, and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"’n Unieke masjienleesbare naam. Kan slegs kleinletters, syfers en "
"koppelteken bevat."

msgid "One entity was exported to @dir."
msgid_plural "@count entities were exported to @dir."
msgstr[0] ""
"Een entiteit is na @dir uitgevoer.  \n"
"@count entiteite is na @dir "
"uitgevoer."

msgid ""
"Failed to export reference to @target_type %missing_id referenced by "
"%field on @entity_type %label because the referenced @target_type does "
"not exist."
msgstr ""
"Kon nie verwysing na @target_type uitvoer nie %missing_id waarna "
"verwys word deur %field op @entity_type %label nie, omdat die verwysde "
"@target_type nie bestaan nie."

msgid "View @entity_label"
msgstr "Beskou @entity_label"

msgid "View @entity_bundle @entity_id"
msgstr "Bekyk @entity_bundle @entity_id"

msgid "Maintenance mode enabled."
msgstr "Onderhoudsmodus geaktiveer."

msgid "Maintenance mode disabled."
msgstr "Onderhoudsmodus gedeaktiveer."

