"intended."
msgstr ""
"’n Klas entiteit, gedefinieer in terme van vordering deur ’n "
"opvoedkundige of opleidingskonteks, waarvoor die beskryfde hulpbron "
"bedoel is."

msgid "Has Format"
msgstr "Het Formaat"

msgid ""
"A related resource that is substantially the same as the pre-existing "
"described resource, but in another format."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat aansienlik dieselfde is as die "
"voorafbestaande beskryfde hulpbron, maar in ’n ander formaat."

msgid "Has Part"
msgstr "Het Deel"

msgid ""
"A related resource that is included either physically or logically in "
"the described resource."
msgstr ""
"’N Verwante hulpbron wat fisies of logies ingesluit is in die "
"beskryfde hulpbron."

msgid "Has Version"
msgstr "Het weergawe"

msgid ""
"A related resource that is a version, edition, or adaptation of the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"’N Verwante hulpbron wat ’n weergawe, uitgawe of aanpassing van "
"die beskryfde hulpbron is."

msgid "Instructional Method"
msgstr "Instruksionele metode"

msgid ""
"A related resource that is substantially the same as the described "
"resource, but in another format."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat wesenlik dieselfde is as die beskryfde "
"hulpbron, maar in ’n ander formaat."

msgid ""
"A related resource in which the described resource is physically or "
"logically included."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron waarin die beskryfde hulpbron fisies of logies "
"ingesluit is."

msgid ""
"A related resource that references, cites, or otherwise points to the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat na die beskryfde hulpbron verwys, dit "
"aanhaal, of op enige ander wyse daarna verwys."

msgid ""
"A related resource that supplants, displaces, or supersedes the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat die beskryfde hulpbron vervang, verplaas of "
"oortref."

msgid ""
"A related resource that requires the described resource to support its "
"function, delivery, or coherence."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat vereis dat die beskryfde hulpbron sy "
"funksie, aflewering of samehang moet ondersteun."

msgid "Date of formal issuance (e.g., publication) of the resource."
msgstr "Datum van formele uitreiking (bv. publikasie) van die hulpbron."

msgid "Mediator"
msgstr "Bemiddelaar"

msgid "The material or physical carrier of the resource."
msgstr "Die materiaal of fisiese draer van die hulpbron."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is referenced, cited, or otherwise pointed to "
"by the described resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat deur die beskryfde hulpbron verwys word, "
"aangehaal word, of andersins na toe gewys word."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is supplanted, displaced, or superseded by the "
"described resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat deur die beskryfde hulpbron vervang, "
"verplaas of oortref is."

msgid ""
"A related resource that is required by the described resource to "
"support its function, delivery, or coherence."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron wat deur die beskryfde hulpbron benodig word om "
"sy funksie, aflewering of samehang te ondersteun."

msgid "Rights Holder"
msgstr "Regtehouer"

msgid "A person or organization owning or managing rights over the resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Persoon of organisasie wat regte oor die hulpbron besit of "
"bestuur."

msgid "Spatial characteristics of the resource."
msgstr "Ruimtelike eienskappe van die hulpbron."

msgid "A list of subunits of the resource."
msgstr "’n Lys van subeenhede van die hulpbron."

msgid "Temporal characteristics of the resource."
msgstr "Tydelike eienskappe van die hulpbron."

