msgstr "Favicon’s en aanraking-ikone"

msgid "Handheld-Friendly"
msgstr "Handgemonteerde-vriendelik"

msgid "Cleartype"
msgstr "Cleartype"

msgid ""
"Provides support for meta tags used to control the mobile browser "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Bied ondersteuning vir meta-merkers wat gebruik word om die mobiele "
"blaaier-ervaring te beheer."

msgid "Open Graph - Products"
msgstr "Open Graph – Produkte"

msgid ""
"A PNG image that is 76px wide by 76px high. Used with the iPad mini "
"and the second-generation iPad (@1x display) on iOS >= 7."
msgstr ""
"’n PNG-beeld wat 76px breed en 76px hoog is. Word saam met die iPad "
"mini en die tweede generasie iPad (@1x-skermvertoning) op iOS >= 7 "
"gebruik."

msgid ""
"A PNG image that is 57px wide by 57px high. Used with the non-Retina "
"iPhone, iPod Touch, and Android 2.1+ devices."
msgstr ""
"’n PNG-beeld wat 57 px breed en 57 px hoog is. Word gebruik met die "
"nie-Retina iPhone, iPod Touch en Android 2.1+-toestelle."

msgid "Mobile & UI Adjustments"
msgstr "Mobiele en UI-aanpassings"

msgid ""
"Meta tags used to control the mobile browser experience. Some of these "
"meta tags have been replaced by newer mobile browsers. These meta tags "
"usually only need to be set globally, rather than per-page."
msgstr ""
"Meta-etikette wat gebruik word om die mobiele blaaier-ervaring te "
"beheer. Van hierdie meta-etikette is deur nuwer mobiele blaaiers "
"vervang. Hierdie meta-etikette hoef gewoonlik net wêreldwyd gestel te "
"word, eerder as per bladsy."

msgid "Metatag: Mobile & UI Adjustments"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Mobiele- en UI-aanpassings"

msgid ""
"Provides additional Open Graph Protocol meta tags for describing "
"products."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf bykomende Open Graph Protocol-meta-tags om produkte te "
"beskryf."

msgid "Undefined group '%group' on tag '%tag'"
msgstr "Onbekende groep ‘%group’ op merker ‘%tag’"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags specially for controlling the summaries displayed "
"when content is shared on <a href='https://twitter.com/'>Twitter</a>."
msgstr ""
"’n Stel meta-tags wat spesifiek ontwerp is om die opsommings wat "
"vertoon word wanneer inhoud gedeel word op <a "
"href='https://twitter.com/'>Twitter</a>, te beheer."

msgid "Custom Tag"
msgstr "Pasgemaakte merker"

msgid "Custom tag"
msgstr "Pasgemaakte merker"

msgid "Alternative language links (hreflang)"
msgstr "Alternatiewe taal-skakels (hreflang)"

msgid "Default locale (x-default)"
msgstr "Standaardtaalomgewing (x-default)"

msgid ""
"This should point to the version of the page that is for the main or "
"primary locale, e.g. the original version of an article that is "
"translated into other languages."
msgstr ""
"Dit behoort te wys na die weergawe van die bladsy wat vir die hoof- of "
"primêre landinstelling bedoel is, bv. die oorspronklike weergawe van "
"’n artikel wat in ander tale vertaal word."

msgid ""
"Provides support for the hreflang meta tag with some extra logic to "
"simplify it."
msgstr ""
"Bied ondersteuning vir die hreflang-meta-tag met ’n bietjie ekstra "
"logika om dit makliker te maak."

msgid "Apple & iOS"
msgstr "Apple en iOS"

msgid "Custom meta tags used by Apple's software, iOS, Safari, etc."
msgstr ""
"Pasgemaakte meta-tags wat deur Apple se sagteware, iOS, Safari, ens. "
"gebruik word."

msgid "Custom meta tags used by the Android OS, browser, etc."
msgstr ""
"Pasgemaakte meta-tags wat deur die Android-bedryfstelsel, blaaier, "
"ens. gebruik word."

msgid "Windows & Windows Mobile"
msgstr "Windows en Windows Mobile"

msgid ""
"Custom meta tags used by the Windows and Windows Mobile OSes, IE "
"browser, etc."
msgstr ""
"Pasgemaakte meta-tag’s wat deur die Windows- en Windows "
"Mobile-bedryfstelsels, die IE-blaaier, ens. gebruik word."

msgid "Web app capable?"
msgstr "Is dit ’n webtoepassing wat kan werk?"

msgid "iOS app link alternative"
msgstr "iOS-toepassingskedakel-alternatief"

msgid "Android app link alternative"
msgstr "Android-toepassingskakel-alternatief"

msgid "X-UA-Compatible"
msgstr "X-UA-Compatible"

msgid ""
"The default name displayed with the pinned sites tile (or icon). Set "
"the content attribute to the desired name."
msgstr ""
"Die versteknaam wat met die vasgemaakte werwe-teël (of ikoon) vertoon "
"word. Stel die inhoud-attribuut op die verlangde naam."

msgid "MSApplication - Allow domain API calls"
msgstr "MSApplication - Sta toe dat domein-API-oproepe gemaak word"

msgid "MSApplication - Allow domain meta tags"
msgstr "MSApplication – Laat domein-metakentekens toe"

msgid "MSApplication - Badge"
msgstr "MSApplication - Badge"

msgid "MSApplication - Nav button color"
msgstr "MSApplication - Kleur vir navigasieknoppie"

msgid ""
"Controls the color of the Back and Forward buttons in the pinned site "
"browser window."
msgstr ""
"Beheer die kleur van die Terug- en Vorentoe-knoppies in die "
"vasgemaakte webwerfblaaiervenster."

msgid "MSApplication - Notification"
msgstr "**MSApplication – Kennisgewing**"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 150px x 150px"
msgstr "MSApplication – Vierkantige logo, 150px x 150px"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 310px x 310px"
msgstr "MSApplication - Vierkantige logo, 310 px x 310 px"

msgid "MSApplication - Square logo, 70px x 70px"
msgstr "MSApplication – Vierkantige logo, 70px x 70px"

msgid "MSApplication - Wide logo, 310px x 150px"
msgstr "MSApplication – Breë logo, 310px x 150px"

msgid "MSApplication - Start URL"
msgstr "MSApplication – Begin-URL"

msgid "MSApplication - Task separator"
msgstr "MSApplication - Taak-skeier"

msgid "MSApplication - Tile color"
msgstr "MSApplication – Teëlkleur"

msgid "The HTML color to use as the background color for the live tile."
msgstr ""
"Die HTML-kleur om as die agtergrondkleur vir die lewendige teël te "
"gebruik."

msgid "MSApplication - Tile image"
msgstr "MSApplication - teëlprent"

msgid "The URL to an image to use as the background for the live tile."
msgstr ""
"Die URL van ’n prent om as die agtergrond vir die lewendige teël te "
"gebruik."

msgid "MSApplication - Tooltip"
msgstr "MSApplication – Wenkboksie"

msgid "Controls the text shown in the tooltip for the pinned site's shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Beheer die teks wat in die nutswenk vir die vasgespelde webwerf se "
"kortpad gewys word."

msgid "MSApplication - Window"
msgstr "MSApplication - Venster"

msgid "Open Graph: Image secure URL"
msgstr "Open Graph: Beveilige URL vir prent"

msgid ""
"The type of image referenced above. Should be either 'image/gif' for a "
"GIF image, 'image/jpeg' for a JPG/JPEG image, or 'image/png' for a PNG "
"image. Note: there should be one value for each image, and having more "
"than there are images may cause problems."
msgstr ""
"Die tipe beeld waarna hierbo verwys word. Moet óf wees «image/gif» "
"vir ’n GIF-beeld, «image/jpeg» vir ’n JPG/JPEG-beeld, of "
"«image/png» vir ’n PNG-beeld. Let wel: daar moet een waarde vir "
"elke beeld wees, en om meer waardes as wat daar beelde is te hê, kan "
"probleme veroorsaak."

msgid ""
"The locale these tags are marked up in, must be in the format "
"language_TERRITORY. Default is 'en_US'."
msgstr ""
"Die lokasie waarin hierdie merkers gemerk is, moet in die formaat "
"taal_TERRITORIUM wees. Die verstekwaarde is ’en_US’."

msgid ""
"Other locales this content is available in, must be in the format "
"language_TERRITORY, e.g. 'fr_FR'."
msgstr ""
"Ander talegebiede waarin hierdie inhoud beskikbaar is, moet in die "
"formaat taal_LAND wees, bv. „fr_FR“."

msgid ""
"The page's title, which should be concise; it will be truncated at 70 "
"characters by Twitter. This field is required unless this the 'type' "
"field is set to 'photo'."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy se titel, wat bondig moet wees; dit sal deur Twitter tot 70 "
"karakters afgekort word. Hierdie veld is verpligtend, tensy die "
"“type”-veld op “photo” gestel is."

msgid "Open Graph: Determiner"
msgstr "Oopgrafiek: Bepaler"

msgid "Open Graph: Alternative locale"
msgstr "Open Graph: Alternatiewe taalomgewing"

msgid "Twitter Cards: App store country"
msgstr "Twitter-kaarte: Appwinkel-land"

msgid "Verifies ownership of a site for search engines and other services."
msgstr ""
"Verifieer die eienaarskap van ’n werf vir soekenjins en ander "
"dienste."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are used to confirm site ownership for search engines "
"and other services."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie meta-etikette word gebruik om webwerf-eienaarskap vir "
"soekenjins en ander dienste te bevestig."

msgid "Norton Safe Web"
msgstr "Norton Veilige Web"

msgid "Facebook Instant Articles claim URL token."
msgstr "Facebook Instant Articles beweer URL-token."

msgid "Overrides the long site title when using the Apple Add to Home Screen."
msgstr ""
"Oorskryf die lang werf-titel wanneer jy Apple se Voeg by tuisskerm "
"gebruik."

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags specially for controlling advanced functionality "
"with Facebook."
msgstr ""
"’n Stel meta-tags wat spesifiek ontwerp is om gevorderde "
"funksionaliteit op Facebook te beheer."

msgid "Open Graph: Video Secure URL"
msgstr "Open Graph: Video Veilige URL"

msgid ""
"The height of the above video(s). Note: if both the unsecured and "
"secured videos are provided, they should both be the same size."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogte van die bogenoemde video(’s). Let wel: as beide die "
"onversekerde en die versekerde video’s verskaf is, moet hulle albei "
"dieselfde grootte hê."

msgid "Video Secure URL"
msgstr "Veilige video-URL"

msgid "Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"
msgstr "Google Aangepaste Soek-enjin (CSE)"

msgid "Department tag."
msgstr "Departementetiket."

msgid "Content audience"
msgstr "Inhoudteikengehoor"

msgid "Provides support for meta tags used for Google Custom Search Engine."
msgstr ""
"Bied ondersteuning vir meta-tags wat vir Google Custom Search Engine "
"gebruik word."

msgid "Handheld URL"
msgstr "Handhouer-URL"

msgid "Provides support for many different favicons."
msgstr "Bied ondersteuning vir baie verskillende favicons."

msgid "Metatag: Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)"

msgid "google_rating"
msgstr "Google-gradering"

msgid "Android Mobile: Android App Link Alternative"
msgstr "Android-mobiel: Android-toepassingskakel-alternatief"

msgid "Android Mobile: Manifest"
msgstr "Android-mobiel: Manifest"

msgid "Apple Mobile: iTunes App"
msgstr "Apple Mobiel: iTunes-toepassing"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Capable"
msgstr "Apple Mobiel: Webtoepassing-beskikbaar"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Status bar color"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Webtoepassing se statusbalkkleur"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Web App Title"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Webtoepassing-titel"

msgid "Mobile: Cleartype"
msgstr "Mobiel: duidelike tipe"

msgid "Apple Mobile: Format Detection"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: Formaatopsporing"

msgid "Mobile: Handheld-Friendly"
msgstr "Mobiel: Geskik vir handtoestelle"

msgid "Apple Mobile: iOS App Link Alternative"
msgstr "Apple Mobile: iOS-toepassingsskakel-alternatief"

msgid "Mobile: Mobile Optimized"
msgstr "Mobiel: Vir selfoon geoptimaliseer"

msgid "Mobile: Theme Color"
msgstr "Mobiel: Temakleur"

msgid "Mobile: Viewport"
msgstr "Mobiel: Vertoningvenster"

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an Android mobile app. Should be in "
"the format 'package_name/host_path', e.g. "
"'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'. The 'android-app://' "
"prefix will be included automatically."
msgstr ""
"’n Pasgemaakte string vir deeplink na ’n Android-mobiele "
"toepassing. Dit behoort in die formaat ’package_name/host_path’ te "
"wees, bv. ’com.example.android/example/hello-screen’. Die "
"’android-app://’-voorvoegsel sal outomaties ingesluit word."

msgid ""
"This informs iOS devices to display a banner to a specific app. If "
"used, it must provide the 'app-id' value, the 'affiliate-data' and "
"'app-argument' values are optional."
msgstr ""
"Dit lig iOS-toestelle in om ’n banier aan ’n spesifieke toepassing "
"te vertoon. Indien dit gebruik word, moet dit die waarde van die "
"‘app-id’ verskaf; die waardes van ‘affiliate-data’ en "
"‘app-argument’ is opsioneel."

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes', the application will run in full-screen mode; the "
"default behavior is to use Safari to display web content."
msgstr ""
"As dit op ‘ja’ gestel is, sal die toepassing in volskermmodus "
"loop; die verstekgedrag is om Safari te gebruik om webinhoud te "
"vertoon."

msgid ""
"Requires the 'Web app capable' meta tag to be set to 'yes'. May be set "
"to 'default', 'black', or 'black-translucent'."
msgstr ""
"Vereis dat die meta-tag „Web app capable“ op „yes“ gestel "
"word. Kan op „default“, „black“ of „black-translucent“ "
"gestel word."

msgid ""
"A legacy meta tag for older versions of Internet Explorer on Windows, "
"use the value 'on' to enable it; this tag is ignored by all other "
"browsers."
msgstr ""
"’n Verouderde meta-tag vir ouer weergawes van Internet Explorer op "
"Windows; gebruik die waarde ’on’ om dit te aktiveer. Hierdie tag "
"word deur alle ander blaaiers geïgnoreer."

msgid ""
"If set to 'telephone=no' the page will not be checked for phone "
"numbers, which would be presented."
msgstr ""
"As dit op `'telephone=no'` gestel is, sal die bladsy nie nagegaan word "
"vir telefoonnommers wat aangebied sou word nie."

msgid ""
"Some older mobile browsers will expect this meta tag to be set to "
"'true' to indicate that the site has been designed with mobile "
"browsers in mind."
msgstr ""
"Sommige ouer mobiele blaaiers sal verwag dat hierdie meta-tag op "
"‘true’ gestel word om aan te dui dat die webwerf met mobiele "
"blaaiers in gedagte ontwerp is."

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an iOS mobile app. Should be in the "
"format 'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', e.g. "
"123456/example/hello-screen'. The 'ios-app://' prefix will be included "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"’N Pasgemaakte string vir deeplink na ’n iOS-mobiele toepassing. "
"Moet in die formaat ’itunes_id/scheme/host_path‘ wees, bv. "
"123456/example/hello-screen. Die ’ios-app://’-voorvoegsel sal "
"outomaties ingesluit word."

msgid ""
"Using the value 'width' tells certain mobile Internet Explorer "
"browsers to display as-is, without being resized. Alternatively a "
"numerical width may be used to indicate the desired page width the "
"page should be rendered in: '240' is the suggested default, '176' for "
"older browsers or '480' for newer devices with high DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"Deur die waarde ‘width’ te gebruik, laat jy sekere mobiele "
"Internet Explorer-blaaiers toe om ongewysig weer te gee, sonder om "
"aangepas te word. Alternatiewelik kan ’n numeriese breedte gebruik "
"word om aan te dui watter bladsybreedte die bladsy in moet word "
"weergegee: ‘240’ is die voorgestelde verstekwaarde, ‘176’ vir "
"ouer blaaiers of ‘480’ vir nuwer toestelle met hoë DPI-skerms."

msgid ""
"Allows tasks to be defined on child domains of the fully qualified "
"domain name associated with the pinned site. Should be either 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Laat toe dat take gedefinieer word op kinddomeine van die volledig "
"gekwalifiseerde domeinnaam wat met die vasgespelde webwerf geassosieer "
"word. Moet óf “waar” óf “onwaar” wees."

msgid ""
"Should contain the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a> file that further controls tile "
"customizations."
msgstr ""
"Bevat die volledige URL na ’n <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a>-lêer wat verdere tile-aanpassings beheer."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string containing 'polling-uri=' (required), "
"'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' and 'polling-uri5=' "
"to indicate the URLs for notifications. May also contain a "
"'frequency=' value to specify how often (in minutes) the URLs will be "
"polled; limited to 30, 60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default). May also "
"contain the value 'cycle=' to control the notifications cycle."
msgstr ""
"’n Komma-adresvorm-geskeide (semi-colon) string wat ’n "
"`polling-uri=` (vereis), `polling-uri2=`, `polling-uri3=`, "
"`polling-uri4=` en `polling-uri5=` bevat om die URL’s vir "
"kennisgewings aan te dui. Kan ook ’n `frequency=`-waarde bevat om te "
"spesifiseer hoe gereeld (in minute) die URL’s gepols sal word; "
"beperk tot 30, 60, 360, 720 of 1440 (verstek). Kan ook die waarde "
"`cycle=` bevat om die kennisgewingsiklus te beheer."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string defining the 'jump' list task. Should "
"contain the 'name=' value to specify the task's name, the "
"'action-uri=' value to set the URL to load when the jump list is "
"clicked, the 'icon-uri=' value to set the URL to an icon file to be "
"displayed, and 'window-type=' set to either 'tab' (default), 'self' or "
"'window' to control how the link opens in the browser."
msgstr ""
"’n String wat met ’n kommapunt (;) geskei is en die "
"“jump”-lys-taak definieer. Dit moet die “name=”-waarde bevat "
"om die taak se naam te spesifiseer, die “action-uri=”-waarde om "
"die URL in te stel wat gelaai moet word wanneer die jump-lys geklik "
"word, die “icon-uri=”-waarde om die URL in te stel van ’n "
"ikoonlêer wat vertoon moet word, en “window-type=” wat op óf "
"“tab” (verstek), “self” of “window” gestel is om te beheer "
"hoe die skakel in die blaaier oopmaak."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated value that controls the dimensions of the "
"initial window. Should contain the values 'width=' and 'height=' to "
"control the width and height respectively."
msgstr ""
"’n Waarde wat deur skuiweryke (puntkomma) geskei word en wat die "
"afmetings van die aanvanklike venster beheer. Moet die waardes "
"“width=” en “height=” bevat om onderskeidelik die breedte en "
"hoogte te beheer."

msgid "Metatag: Open Graph Products"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Open Graph-Produkte"

msgid ""
"In the context of search engine optimization, providing an extensive "
"set of meta tags may help improve the site's and pages' rankings, thus "
"may aid with achieving a more prominent display of the content within "
"search engine results. They can also be used to tailor how content is "
"displayed when shared on social networks. For additional information, "
"see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Metatag</a>."
msgstr ""
"In die konteks van soekenjinoptimalisering kan die verskaffing van "
"’n omvattende stel meta-merkers help om die terrein en bladsye se "
"ranglys te verbeter, en sodoende kan dit daartoe bydra dat die inhoud "
"meer prominent vertoon word binne soekenjinresultate. Dit kan ook "
"gebruik word om te bepaal hoe inhoud vertoon word wanneer dit op "
"sosiale netwerke gedeel word. Vir bykomende inligting, sien die <a "
"href=\":online\">aanlyn dokumentasie vir Metatag</a>."

msgid ""
"Override each of the <a href=\":defaults\">other defaults</a>, fill in "
"specific values and tokens that each item should have by default. This "
"allows e.g. for all nodes to have different values than taxonomy "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Oorskryf elk van die <a href=\":defaults\">ander verstekwaardes</a>, "
"vul spesifieke waardes en tokens in wat elke item by verstek moet hê. "
"Dit stel jou bv. in staat dat alle nodusse verskillende waardes as "
"taksonomie-terme het."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are designed to point visitors to versions of the "
"current page in other languages."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie meta-etikette is ontwerp om besoekers te wys na weergawes van "
"die huidige bladsy in ander tale."

msgid "Sitename"
msgstr "Werfsitenaam"

msgid ""
"Meta tag patterns are passed down from one level to the next unless "
"they are overridden. To view a summary of the individual meta tags and "
"the pattern for a specific configuration, click on its name below."
msgstr ""
"Meta-tagpatrone word van een vlak na die volgende oorgedra, tensy dit "
"oorskryf word. Om ’n opsomming van die individuele meta-tags en die "
"patroon vir ’n spesifieke konfigurasie te sien, klik op die naam "
"daarvan hieronder."

msgid ""
"The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best "
"results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but "
"at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types "
"supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and "
"video.tv_show."
msgstr ""
"Die URL van ’n video wat die inhoud moet verteenwoordig. Vir die "
"beste resultate gebruik ’n bron wat ten minste 1200 x 630 pixels "
"groot is, maar ’n minimum van ten minste 600 x 316 pixels word "
"aanbeveel. Ondersteunde objeksoorte sluit in video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, en video.tv_show."

msgid ""
"The type of video referenced above. Should be either  video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show. Note: there should be one "
"value for each video, and having more than there are videos may cause "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"Die tipe video waarna hierbo verwys word. Dit moet óf video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, of video.tv_show wees. Let wel: daar behoort "
"een waarde vir elke video te wees, en om meer waardes as die aantal "
"videos te hê, kan probleme veroorsaak."

msgid "Provides views integration for metatags."
msgstr "Bied integrasie vir uitsigte vir metatags."

msgid "Metatags for @view : @display have been saved."
msgstr "Meta-tags vir @view: @display is gestoor."

msgid "Edit @language translation for %view: %display metatags"
msgstr "Wysig @language-vertaling vir %view: %display-metatag’s"

msgid "Metatag display extender"
msgstr "Meta-tag vertoonuitbreider"

msgid "Metatag settings for this view."
msgstr "Metatag-opstellings vir hierdie aansig."

msgid ""
"A link to the preferred page location or URL of the content of this "
"page, to help eliminate duplicate content penalties from search "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"’n Skakel na die voorkeurbladsy-ligging of URL van die inhoud van "
"hierdie bladsy om duplikaatinhoud-penalsering deur soekenjins te help "
"vermy."

msgid ""
"The text to display in the title bar of a visitor's web browser when "
"they view this page. This meta tag may also be used as the title of "
"the page when a visitor bookmarks or favorites this page, or as the "
"page title in a search engine result. It is common to append "
"'[site:name]' to the end of this, so the site's name is automatically "
"added. It is recommended that the title is no greater than 55 - 65 "
"characters long, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"Die teks wat in die titelbalk van ’n besoeker se webblaaier vertoon "
"moet word wanneer hulle hierdie bladsy bekyk. Hierdie meta-tag kan ook "
"gebruik word as die bladsy se titel wanneer ’n besoeker die bladsy "
"boekmerk of as gunsteling stoor, of as die bladsy se titel in ’n "
"soekenjinresultaat. Dit is algemeen om “[site:name]” aan die einde "
"toe te voeg, sodat die werf se naam outomaties bygevoeg word. Dit word "
"aanbeveel dat die titel nie langer as 55–65 karakters is nie, "
"insluitend spasies."

msgid "URL for a version of this page in %langcode"
msgstr "URL vir ’n weergawe van hierdie bladsy in %langcode"

msgid "Hreflang per language"
msgstr "Hreflang per taal"

msgid ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Sets a "
"cookie</a> on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE "
"format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration "
"date; see the link for full details on the syntax."
msgstr ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Stel "
"’n koekie in</a> op die besoeker se blaaier. Dit kan óf in die "
"formaat NAME=VALUE wees, óf in ’n meer omvattende formaat wat die "
"pad en vervaldatum insluit; sien die skakel vir volledige besonderhede "
"oor die sintaksis."

msgid "Enables metatags for custom routes"
msgstr "Skakel metatags vir pasgemaakte roetes in"

msgid "Add meta tag for custom route"
msgstr "Voeg meta-tag by vir pasgemaakte roete"

msgid "Add custom metatag"
msgstr "Voeg pasgemaakte meta-tag by"

msgid "The path must begin with /"
msgstr "Die pad moet met ’n `/` begin."

msgid "The admin routes should not have metatags."
msgstr "Die administrasieroutes moet nie metatags hê nie."

msgid "There are already metatags created for this route."
msgstr "Daar is reeds metatags vir hierdie roete geskep."

msgid "The path does not exist as an internal Drupal route."
msgstr "Die pad bestaan nie as ’n interne Drupal-roete nie."

msgid "Created metatags for the path: @url. Internal route: @route."
msgstr "Meta-tags geskep vir die pad: @url. Interne roete: @route."

msgid "The metatags could not be created for the path: @url."
msgstr "Die metamerkers kon nie vir die pad: @url geskep word nie."

msgid "Dublin Core: Instructional Method"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Instruksionele Metode"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Format Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Is Formaat Van"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Part Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Maak Deel Uit Van"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Referenced By"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Word Verwys Deur"

msgid ""
"Information about who can access the resource or an indication of its "
"security status. Access Rights may include information regarding "
"access or restrictions based on privacy, security, or other policies."
msgstr ""
"Inligting oor wie toegang tot die hulpbron kan kry, of ’n aanduiding "
"van die hulpbron se sekuriteitsstatus. Toegangsregte kan inligting "
"insluit oor toegang of beperkings wat gebaseer is op privaatheid, "
"sekuriteit of ander beleide."

msgid ""
"A bibliographic reference for the resource. Recommended practice is to "
"include sufficient bibliographic detail to identify the resource as "
"unambiguously as possible."
msgstr ""
"’n Bibliografiese verwysing vir die hulpbron. Aanbevole praktyk is "
"om voldoende bibliografiese besonderhede in te sluit om die hulpbron "
"so ondubbelsinnig as moontlik te identifiseer."

msgid ""
"Date of acceptance of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Accepted may be relevant are a thesis (accepted by a university "
"department) or an article (accepted by a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Datum van aanvaarding van die hulpbron. Voorbeelde van hulpbronne "
"waarvoor ’n Datum van Aanvaarding relevant kan wees, is ’n "
"proefskrif (deur ’n universiteitsdepartement aanvaar) of ’n "
"artikel (deur ’n joernaal aanvaar)."

msgid ""
"Date of submission of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Submitted may be relevant are a thesis (submitted to a university "
"department) or an article (submitted to a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Datum van indiening van die hulpbron. Voorbeelde van hulpbronne "
"waarvoor “Datum van indiening” relevant kan wees, is ’n "
"proefskrif (wat by ’n universiteitsdepartement ingedien word) of "
"’n artikel (wat by ’n tydskrif ingedien word)."

msgid ""
"A process, used to engender knowledge, attitudes and skills, that the "
"described resource is designed to support. Instructional Method will "
"typically include ways of presenting instructional materials or "
"conducting instructional activities, patterns of learner-to-learner "
"and learner-to-instructor interactions, and mechanisms by which group "
"and individual levels of learning are measured. Instructional methods "
"include all aspects of the instruction and learning processes from "
"planning and implementation through evaluation and feedback."
msgstr ""
"’n Proses wat gebruik word om kennis, houdings en vaardighede te "
"bevorder, waarvoor die beskryfde hulpbron ontwerp is om ondersteuning "
"te bied. Die Instruksionele Metode sal tipies maniere insluit om "
"onderrigmateriaal aan te bied of om instruksionele aktiwiteite uit te "
"voer, patrone van leerder-tot-leerder- en "
"leerder-tot-instrukteur-interaksies, en meganismes waarvolgens groeps- "
"en individuele vlakke van leer gemeet word. Instruksionele metodes "
"sluit alle aspekte van die onderrig- en leerprosesse in, van "
"beplanning en implementering tot evaluering en terugvoer."

msgid ""
"A related resource of which the described resource is a version, "
"edition, or adaptation. Changes in version imply substantive changes "
"in content rather than differences in format."
msgstr ""
"’n Verwante hulpbron waarvan die beskryfde hulpbron ’n weergawe, "
"uitgawe of aanpassing is. Veranderings in ’n weergawe dui op "
"wesenlike veranderinge in inhoud eerder as verskille in formaat."

msgid ""
"An entity that mediates access to the resource and for whom the "
"resource is intended or useful. In an educational context, a mediator "
"might be a parent, teacher, teaching assistant, or care-giver."
msgstr ""
"’n Entiteit wat toegang tot die hulpbron bemiddel, en waarvoor die "
"hulpbron bedoel is of nuttig is. In ’n opvoedkundige konteks kan "
"’n bemiddelaar ’n ouer, onderwyser, onderrigassistent of versorger "
"wees."

msgid ""
"A statement of any changes in ownership and custody of the resource "
"since its creation that are significant for its authenticity, "
"integrity, and interpretation. The statement may include a description "
"of any changes successive custodians made to the resource."
msgstr ""
"’n Verklaring van enige veranderinge in eienaarskap en bewaring van "
"die hulpbron sedert dit geskep is wat beduidend is vir die egtheid, "
"integriteit en interpretasie daarvan. Die verklaring kan ’n "
"beskrywing insluit van enige veranderinge wat opeenvolgende bewaarders "
"aan die hulpbron aangebring het."

msgid "Spatial Coverage"
msgstr "Ruimtelike dekking"

msgid ""
"Links a book to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to "
"the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr ""
"Skakel ’n boek aan ’n skrywer se Facebook-profiel, en dit moet óf "
"URL’s wees na die skrywer se profielbladsy óf hul "
"Facebook-profiel-ID’s."

msgid ""
"The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must "
"be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a "
"recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 "
"x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not "
"be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added "
"many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not "
"specifically the first one."
msgstr ""
"Die URL van ’n beeld wat die inhoud behoort voor te stel. Die beeld "
"moet minstens 200 x 200 pixels groot wees; 600 x 316 pixels is ’n "
"aanbevole minimum grootte, en vir die beste resultate gebruik ’n "
"beeld van minstens 1200 x 630 pixels. Ondersteun PNG-, JPEG- en "
"GIF-formate. Moet nie gebruik word as og:image:url gebruik word nie. "
"Let wel: as veelvuldige beelde bygevoeg word, sal baie dienste (bv. "
"Facebook) verstek om die grootste beeld te gebruik, nie spesifiek die "
"eerste een nie."

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price amount"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Prysbedrag"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price currency"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Prysvaluta"

msgid "Metatag: Pinterest"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Pinterest"

msgid "Provides support for Pinterest's custom meta tags."
msgstr "Bied ondersteuning vir Pinterest se pasgemaakte meta-etikette."

msgid "Pinterest: Description"
msgstr "Pinterest: Beskrywing"

msgid "Pinterest: ID"
msgstr "Pinterest: ID"

msgid "Pinterest: Media"
msgstr "Pinterest: Media"

msgid "Pinterest: No hover"
msgstr "Pinterest: Geen sweefeffek nie"

msgid "Pinterest: No pin"
msgstr "Pinterest: Geen pen nie"

msgid "Pinterest: URL"
msgstr "Pinterest: URL"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags used to control how the site's content is consumed "
"by <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."
msgstr ""
"’n Stel meta-tags wat gebruik word om te beheer hoe die webwerf se "
"inhoud deur <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a> verbruik "
"word."

msgid "The Canonical Pinterest object to pin."
msgstr "Die kanonieke Pinterest-objek om op te plak."

msgid "The URL of media which should represent the content."
msgstr "Die URL van media wat die inhoud moet verteenwoordig."

msgid ""
"Do not show hovering Save or Search buttons, generated by the "
"Pinterest browser extensions."
msgstr ""
"Moenie die swewende Stoor- of Soek-knoppies vertoon nie, gegenereer "
"deur die Pinterest-blaaieruitbreidings."

msgid "No pin"
msgstr "Geen pen nie"

msgid ""
"Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will "
"take precedence over all options below."
msgstr ""
"Moenie enigiets op hierdie bladsy vaspen nie. Wanneer dit gekies is, "
"sal hierdie opsie alle opsies hieronder oorskryf."

msgid "Do not allow Pinterest visual search to happen from this page."
msgstr ""
"Moet nie toelaat dat Pinterest-visuele soektog vanaf hierdie bladsy "
"plaasvind nie."

msgid "The URL which should represent the content."
msgstr "Die URL wat die inhoud moet verteenwoordig."

msgid ""
"The custom admin pages for managing Views meta tags at "
"/admin/config/search/metatag/views have been disabled for now, "
"hopefully they'll be back in a future release. Until then, the meta "
"tags can be managed directly on each individual view via the \"Meta "
"tags\" section."
msgstr ""
"Die pasgemaakte administrasiebladsye vir die bestuur van "
"Views-meta-merkers by /admin/config/search/metatag/views is tans "
"gedeaktiveer. Hopelik sal dit in ’n toekomstige vrystelling terug "
"wees. Tot dan af kan die meta-merkers direk op elke individuele aansig "
"bestuur word via die afdeling “Meta tags”."

msgid ""
"To view a list of displays with meta tags set up, click on a view "
"name. To view a summary of meta tags configuration for a particular "
"display, click on the display name. If you need to set meta tags for a "
"specific view, choose Add views meta tags. Reverting the meta tags "
"removes the specific configuration and falls back to defaults."
msgstr ""
"Om ’n lys van vertonings met meta-tags wat opgestel is, te sien, "
"klik op ’n vertoningsnaam. Om ’n opsomming van die "
"meta-tags-konfigurasie vir ’n spesifieke vertoning te sien, klik op "
"die vertoningsnaam. As jy meta-tags vir ’n spesifieke vertoning moet "
"opstel, kies Voeg vertoning-meta-tags by. Om die meta-tags terug te "
"stel, verwyder die spesifieke konfigurasie en keer terug na die "
"verstekwaardes."

msgid "Do you want to revert meta tags for @view_name : @display_name?"
msgstr "Wil jy die meta-tags terugstel vir @view_name : @display_name?"

msgid ""
"You are about to revert the custom meta tags for the %display_name "
"display on the %view_name view. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Jy staan op die punt om die pasgemaakte meta-merkers vir die "
"%display_name-inskrywing op die %view_name-aansig terug te plaas. "
"Hierdie aksie kan nie ongedaan gemaak word nie."

msgid "Reverted meta tags for @view_name : @display_name"
msgstr "Teruggesette meta-etikette vir @view_name : @display_name"

msgid "Mobile: Web Manifest"
msgstr "Mobiel: Web-manifest"

msgid "Web Manifest"
msgstr "Web-manifest"

msgid "Image 'alt'"
msgstr "Beeld “alt”"

msgid ""
"A description of what is in the image, not a caption. If the page "
"specifies an og:image it should specify og:image:alt."
msgstr ""
"’n Beskrywing van wat in die prent is, nie ’n onderskrif nie. As "
"die bladsy ’n og:image spesifiseer, moet dit ook og:image:alt "
"spesifiseer."

msgid "Provides metatag support for Page Manager variants."
msgstr "Bied metatag-ondersteuning vir Page Manager-variantes."

msgid ""
"Identify which metatag groups should be available on which entity type "
"/ bundle combination. Unselected groups will not appear on the "
"configuration form for that entity type, reducing the size of the form "
"and increasing performance. If no groups are selected for a type, all "
"groups will appear."
msgstr ""
"Identifiseer watter metatag-groepe beskikbaar behoort te wees vir "
"watter entiteitstipe / bundel-kombinasie. Ongekose groepe sal nie op "
"die konfigurasievorm vir daardie entiteitstipe verskyn nie, wat die "
"grootte van die vorm verminder en werkverrigting verbeter. As geen "
"groepe vir ’n tipe gekies is nie, sal alle groepe verskyn."

msgid ""
"This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two "
"directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the "
"sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a "
"translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them "
"with a comma. See <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie meta-tag kommunikeer met Google. Tans word daar twee "
"richtlijnen ondersteun: **'nositelinkssearchbox'** om nie die soekboks "
"vir sitelinks te wys nie, en **'notranslate'** om Google te vra om nie "
"’n vertaling van die bladsy aan te bied nie. Albei opsies kan "
"bygevoeg word—skei dit net met ’n komma. Sien **<a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags wat Google verstaan</a>** vir verdere besonderhede."

msgid "SVG icon"
msgstr "SVG-ikoon"

msgid "Pocket"
msgstr "Sak"

msgid ""
"Warning: disabling the Global default metatag will prevent any "
"metatags from being used."
msgstr ""
"Waarskuwing: deur die Globale verstek-meta-tag uit te skakel, sal "
"enige meta-tags nie gebruik kan word nie."

msgid ""
"Set the maximum size of an image preview for this page in a search "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Stel die maksimum grootte van ’n beeldvoorskou vir hierdie bladsy in "
"’n soekresultaat in."

msgid "Standard - a default image preview may be shown."
msgstr "Standaard – ’n verstek-beeldvoorskou kan vertoon word."

msgid ""
"Large - a larger image preview, up to the width of the viewport, may "
"be shown."
msgstr ""
"Groot — ’n groter beeldvoorskou, tot by die breedte van die "
"aansigvenster, kan vertoon word."

msgid "Metatag: Favicons"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Favicons"

msgid ""
"Provides an absolute URL to a specially formatted version of the "
"current page designed for 'feature phones', mobile phones that do not "
"support modern browser standards. See the <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>official "
"Google Mobile SEO Guide</a> for details on how the page should be "
"formatted."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n absolute URL na ’n spesifiek-geformateerde weergawe van "
"die huidige bladsy wat ontwerp is vir “feature phones”, mobiele "
"fone wat nie moderne blaaierstandaarde ondersteun nie. Sien die <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>amptelike "
"Google Mobile SEO-gids</a> vir besonderhede oor hoe die bladsy "
"geformateer moet word."

msgid "Open Graph: Video duration"
msgstr "Open Graph: Video-duur"

msgid ""
"The date this content will expire, with an optional time value. Needs "
"to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Die datum waarop hierdie inhoud sal verval, met ’n opsionele "
"tydwaarde. Moet in die <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>-formaat "
"wees."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Die datum waarop hierdie inhoud laas gewysig is, met ’n opsionele "
"tydwaarde. Moet in <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>-formaat "
"wees."

msgid ""
"The date this content was published on, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Die datum waarop hierdie inhoud gepubliseer is, met ’n opsionele "
"tydwaarde. Moet in die <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>-formaat "
"wees."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format. Can be the same as the 'Article modification date' "
"tag."
msgstr ""
"Die datum waarop hierdie inhoud laas gewysig is, met ’n opsionele "
"tyelwaarde. Moet in die <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a>-formaat "
"wees. Kan dieselfde wees as die ‘Artikel-wysigingsdatum’-tag."

msgid ""
"Preferred page location or URL to help eliminate duplicate content for "
"search engines, e.g., <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."
msgstr ""
"Voorkeurbladsy-ligging of URL om duplikaatinhoud vir soekenjins uit te "
"skakel, bv. <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."

msgid "All meta tags in the \"@group\" group."
msgstr "Alle meta-tags in die “@group”-groep."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Pragma meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Word gebruik om te beheer of ’n blaaier ’n spesifieke bladsy "
"plaaslik in kas stoor. Word nie algemeen gebruik nie. Behoort saam met "
"die Pragma-meta-tag gebruik te word."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='next' link."
msgstr ""
"Word gebruik vir gepagineerde inhoud deur ’n URL met die "
"rel='next’-skakel te verskaf."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Cache-Control "
"meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Word gebruik om te beheer of ’n blaaier ’n spesifieke bladsy "
"plaaslik kas. Dit word nie algemeen gebruik nie. Behoort saam met die "
"Cache-Control-meta-tag gebruik te word."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='prev' link."
msgstr ""
"Word gebruik vir gepagineerde inhoud deur ’n URL te verskaf met die "
"rel='prev'-skakel."

msgid ""
"Provides the fifteen <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf die vyftien <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta-etikette vanaf die <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid ""
"Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf veertig bykomende meta-tags van die <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."

msgid "Metatag: Hreflang"
msgstr "Metatag: Hreflang"

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string that must contain the 'polling-uri=' "
"value with the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML file</a>. May also contain 'frequency=' value set to either 30, "
"60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default) which specifies (in minutes) how often "
"the URL should be polled."
msgstr ""
"’n Saamgestelde string wat deur kommas met ’n puntkomma (;) geskei "
"word en wat die waarde van **’polling-uri=’** moet bevat met die "
"volle URL na ’n <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML-lêer</a>. Mag ook die **’frequency=’**-waarde bevat wat "
"ingestel is op óf 30, 60, 360, 720 of 1440 (verstek) en wat "
"spesifiseer (in minute) hoe gereeld die URL gepols moet word."

msgid "Metatag: Page Manager"
msgstr "Meta-tag: Page Manager"

msgid "If checked, the field will be placed in the sidebar on entity forms."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die veld in die sybalk op entiteitsvorms geplaas "
"word."

msgid "Use sidebar: Yes"
msgstr "Gebruik sybalk: Ja"

msgid ""
"Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should "
"expire. The date must to be an <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-compliant "
"date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. "
"'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being "
"cached entirely."
msgstr ""
"Beheer wanneer die blaaier se interne kas van die huidige bladsy moet "
"verval. Die datum moet ’n <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-ooreenstemmende "
"datumstring wees wat in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT) voorgestel word, bv. "
"'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Stel dit op '0' om te keer dat die "
"bladsy glad nie gekas word nie."

msgid ""
"The number of seconds to wait before refreshing the page. May also "
"force redirect to another page using the format '5; "
"url=https://example.com/', which would be triggered after five "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Die aantal sekondes om te wag voordat die bladsy verfris. Kan ook ’n "
"herleiding na ’n ander bladsy dwing deur die formaat `5; "
"url=https://example.com/` te gebruik, wat na vyf sekondes geaktiveer "
"sal word."

msgid ""
"The secure URL to an audio file that complements this object. All "
"'http://' URLs will automatically be converted to 'https://'."
msgstr ""
"Die veilige URL na ’n oudiolêer wat met hierdie objek saamhang. "
"Alle ’http://’-URL’s sal outomaties na ’https://’ omgeskakel "
"word."

msgid "Metatag Extended Permissions"
msgstr "Metatag-uitgebreide toestemmings"

msgid "Access %tag in %group"
msgstr "Toegang tot %tag in %group"

msgid ""
"A color in hexadecimal format, e.g. '#0000ff' for blue; must include "
"the '#' symbol. Used by some browsers to control the background color "
"of the toolbar, the color used with an icon, etc."
msgstr ""
"’ n Kleur in heksadesimale formaat, bv. ’#0000ff’ vir blou; moet "
"die ’#’-simbool insluit. Word deur sommige blaaiers gebruik om die "
"agtergrondkleur van die nutsbalk te beheer, die kleur wat met ’n "
"ikoon gebruik word, ens."

msgid ""
"The <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are used to "
"control how Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn and other social networking "
"sites interpret the site's content.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Die <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph-meta-tags</a> word gebruik om "
"te beheer hoe Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn en ander sosiale "
"netwerkwebwerwe die inhoud van die webwerf interpreteer.<br><br>Die "
"Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> laat jou voorskou hoe jou inhoud sal lyk wanneer dit op "
"Facebook gedeel word, en help jou om enige probleme met jou Open "
"Graph-tags op te spoor."

msgid ""
"These <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are for "
"describing products.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph-meta-tags</a> is bedoel "
"om produkte te beskryf.<br><br>Die Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> laat jou vooraf sien hoe jou inhoud sal lyk wanneer dit "
"na Facebook gedeel word, en help jou om enige probleme met jou Open "
"Graph-tags op te spoor."

msgid ""
"The URL to a unique image representing the content of the page. Do not "
"use a generic image such as your website logo, author photo, or other "
"image that spans multiple pages. Images larger than 120x120px will be "
"resized and cropped square based on longest dimension. Images smaller "
"than 60x60px will not be shown. If the 'type' is set to Photo then the "
"image must be at least 280x150px."
msgstr ""
"Die URL na ’n unieke prent wat die inhoud van die bladsy "
"verteenwoordig. Moenie ’n algemene prent gebruik soos jou "
"webwerf-logo, outeursfoto, of ander beelde wat oor verskeie bladsye "
"strek nie. Prente groter as 120x120 px sal na ’n vierkantige vorm "
"verander word en geknip word op grond van die langste dimensie. Prente "
"kleiner as 60x60 px sal nie gewys word nie. As die ’type’ op Foto "
"gestel is, moet die prent minstens 280x150 px wees."

msgid ""
"The full URL for an MP4 video (h.264) or audio (AAC) stream, takes "
"precedence over the other media player field."
msgstr ""
"Die volledige URL vir ’n MP4-video (h.264) of oudio (AAC)-stroom "
"geniet voorrang bo die ander mediasspeler-veld."

msgid ""
"To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle "
"(content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings "
"enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to "
"output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It "
"is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the "
"image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag "
"descriptions for size recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Om tokens te gebruik om beelde te beeld, moet die beeldveld op daardie "
"entiteitbundel (inhoudstipe, term, ens.) die "
"“Token”-vertooninstellings geaktiveer hê, die beeldveld mag nie "
"versteek wees nie, en dit moet ingestel wees om as ’n beeld uit te "
"voer, bv. deur die “Thumbnail”-veldformatter te gebruik. Dit word "
"ook aanbeveel om ’n toepaslike beeldstyl te gebruik wat die prent "
"her-skaal eerder as om die oorspronklike prent uit te voer; sien die "
"individuele beskrywings van die meta-etikette vir "
"grootte-aanbevelings."

msgid ""
"This will be able to extract the URL from an image field if the field "
"is configured properly."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal die URL uit ’n beeldveld kan onttrek as die veld behoorlik "
"gekonfigureer is."

msgid ""
"Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little "
"known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by "
"browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>most common "
"options</a> are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. "
"If you follow the <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA "
"Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"
msgstr ""
"Word gebruik om inhoud te beoordeel volgens die geskiktheid vir die "
"gehoor. Hierdie merker het min bekende invloed op soekenjinranglys, "
"maar kan gebruik word deur blaaierte, blaaieruitbreidings en "
"programme. Die <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>mees algemene "
"opsies</a> is algemeen, volwasse, beperk, 14 jaar, veilig vir kinders. "
"As jy die <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA-dokumentasie</a> "
"volg, behoort jy RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA in te voer."

msgid "@label of @type"
msgstr "@label van @type"

msgid "@label of @type @entity-type-label"
msgstr "@label van @type @entity-type-label"

msgid "This plugin will be cloned from these settings for each custom tag."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie inprop sal uit hierdie instellings gekloon word vir elke "
"pasgemaakte merker."

msgid "Place field in collapsed details container"
msgstr "Plaas die veld in ’n ingeklapte besonderhede-kontener"

msgid "Trim method for trimmable tags."
msgstr "Snymetode vir knipbare etikette."

msgid "Tag-specific maximum length"
msgstr "Spesifieke maksimum lengte per tag"

msgid "Tag maximum length in characters"
msgstr "Maksimum lengte van die merker in karakters"

msgid ""
"Adds individual permissions for each meta tag, allowing for "
"fine-grained access to the meta tags. Note: this may lead to "
"performance issues on the permissions admin page, please see the "
"included README.txt file for details."
msgstr ""
"Voeg individuele toestemmings vir elke meta-tag by, sodat daar "
"fynkorrelige toegang tot die meta-tags is. Let wel: dit kan tot "
"prestasieprobleme op die toestemmingsadministrasieblad lei; sien "
"asseblief die ingeslote README.txt-lêer vir besonderhede."

msgid "Mask icon color"
msgstr "Wys-ikoonkleur"

msgid ""
"Color attribute for SVG (mask) icon in hexadecimal format, e.g. "
"'#0000ff'. Setting it will break HTML validation. If not set macOS "
"Safari ignores the Mask Icon entirely, making the Icon: SVG completely "
"useless."
msgstr ""
"Kleurkenmerk vir die SVG (masker)-ikoon in hexadesimale formaat, bv. "
"`'#0000ff'`. As jy dit instel, sal dit HTML-validering breek. As dit "
"nie gestel is nie, ignoreer macOS Safari die Mask-ikoon heeltemal, wat "
"die Ikoon: SVG heeltemal nutteloos maak."

msgid "Mask icon (SVG)"
msgstr "Wys ikoon (SVG)"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price availability"
msgstr "Open Graph-produkkop: Prysbeskikbaarheid"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Product condition"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Produktoestand"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "Open Graph Produk: Kleinhandelaar-item-ID"

msgid "Product condition"
msgstr "Produktoestand"

msgid "The condition of the product."
msgstr "Die toestand van die produk."

msgid "Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "Vervaardiger-item-ID"

msgid "The ID of the product as provided by the retailer."
msgstr "Die ID van die produk soos deur die kleinhandelaar verskaf."

msgid ""
"Empty update script to clear the site's caches so the new token "
"replacement functionality will work."
msgstr ""
"Leë opdateringsskrip om die werf se kas skoon te maak sodat die nuwe "
"tokenvervangingsfunksionaliteit sal werk."

msgid "Metatag Trimming Options"
msgstr "Metatag-snoeiopsies"

msgid ""
"Many Meta-Tags can be trimmed on a specific length for search engine "
"optimization.<br/>If the value is set to '0' or left empty, the whole "
"Metatag will be untrimmed."
msgstr ""
"Baie meta-merkers kan tot ’n spesifieke lengte ingekort word vir "
"soekenjinoptimalisering.<br/>As die waarde op ’n “0” gestel is "
"of leeg gelaat word, sal die hele metamerker nie ingekort word nie."

msgid "Meta Tags:"
msgstr "Meta-etikette:"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag after the word on the given value"
msgstr "Knip die meta-tag af na die woord op die gegewe waarde"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag on the given value"
msgstr "Snoei die meta-tag op die gegewe waarde af"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag before the word on the given value"
msgstr "Snoei die meta-tag voor die woord op die gegewe waarde af"

msgid "Wrap the meta tags in a collapsed details container."
msgstr "Wikkel die meta-tags in ’n saamgevoude “details”-houer."

msgid ""
"If checked, the contents of the field will be placed inside a "
"collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal die inhoud van die veld in ’n ingevoude "
"besonderhedehouer geplaas word."

msgid "Use details container: Yes"
msgstr "Gebruik besonderhede-kontainer: Ja"

msgid "Use details container: No"
msgstr "Gebruik besonderhedehouer: Nee"

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958; -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Georuimtelike inligting in die formaat `'latitude; longitude'`, "
"byvoorbeeld `'50.167958; -97.133185'`; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>sien Wikipedia vir besonderhede</a>."

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude, longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>see Wikipedia for "
"details</a>."
msgstr ""
"Geo-spasiale inligting in die formaat “latitude, longitude”, bv. "
"“50.167958, -97.133185”; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>kyk gerus na Wikipedia vir "
"besonderhede</a>."

msgid "Token Or"
msgstr "Token Of"

msgid "Add max height value"
msgstr "Voeg ’n maksimumhoogte-waarde by"

msgid "Metatag Custom Routes (Paths)"
msgstr "Metaetiket Pasgemaakte Roetes (Paaie)"

msgid "Route / Path"
msgstr "Roete / Pad"

msgid ""
"Enter the route (path) for this new configuration, starting with a "
"leading slash.<br />Note: this must already exist as a path in Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Voer die roete (pad) in vir hierdie nuwe konfigurasie, en begin met "
"’n voorste skuinsstreep (/).<br />Let wel: hierdie moet reeds as "
"’n pad in Drupal bestaan."

msgid "Site validation: SIWECOS"
msgstr "Werfvalidering: SIWECOS"

msgid "Google Site Verification"
msgstr "Google-werfverifikasie"

msgid "SIWECOS"
msgstr "SIWECOS"

msgid "Metatag widget options"
msgstr "Metatag-widgetopsies"

msgid ""
"Various options for the field widget used on entity forms, e.g. on "
"content type forms."
msgstr ""
"Verskeie opsies vir die veld-widget wat op entiteitsvorms gebruik "
"word, bv. op inhoudtipe-vorms."

msgid "Scroll maximum height"
msgstr "Blaai na maksimum hoogte"

msgid "eg 500px or 8rem"
msgstr "bv. 500px of 8rem"

msgid ""
"To enable scrolling please enter a value and its units, e.g. 500px, "
"8rem, etc. Removing this value will remove the scroll."
msgstr ""
"Om blaaiwerking (scrolling) te aktiveer, voer ’n waarde en die "
"eenheid daarvan in, bv. 500px, 8rem, ens. As jy hierdie waarde "
"verwyder, sal die scroll verwyder word."

msgid "Define the author of a page."
msgstr "Definieer die outeur van ’n bladsy."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> is suggested for when the "
"basic content tokens are not flexible enough, e.g. to make a meta tag "
"show the contents of one field if it is filled in or another if the "
"first one is empty."
msgstr ""
"Die <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> word voorgestel wanneer "
"die basiese inhoudtokens nie buigsaam genoeg is nie, byvoorbeeld om "
"’n meta-etiket die inhoud van een veld te laat wys as dit ingevul "
"is, of ’n ander een as die eerste leeg is."

msgid "Href per language"
msgstr "Href per taal"

msgid ""
"This was expected to be an array but it is not: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Dit is verwag om ’n skikking (array) te wees, maar dit is nie:  "
"\n"
"%value"

msgid ""
"This could not be unserialized: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie kon nie gedeserialiseer word nie:  \n"
"%value"

msgid "Metatag Field Diff"
msgstr "Meta-etiketveldverskil"

msgid "Use Maxlength module to force these limits?"
msgstr "Gebruik die Maxlength-module om hierdie perke af te dwing?"

msgid "Install the Maxlength module to enable this option."
msgstr "Installeer die Maxlength-modul om hierdie opsie te aktiveer."

msgid "Intended workflow"
msgstr "Bedoelde werksvloei"

msgid ""
"Allows assigning meta tags to be used on custom routes, equivalent to "
"custom paths."
msgstr ""
"Laat toe om meta-merkers toe te wys vir gebruik op pasgemaakte roetes, "
"gelykstaande aan pasgemaakte paaie."

msgid ""
"Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not "
"links should be followed. See <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>the W3C "
"specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same "
"purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr ""
"Dui aan soekmasjiene en ander bladsy-ontleders (scrapers) of skakels "
"gevolg moet word al dan nie. Sien <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>die "
"W3C-spesifikasies</a> vir meer besonderhede. Let wel: dit dien "
"dieselfde doel as die HTTP-opskrif met dieselfde naam."

msgid "Max Snippet"
msgstr "Maksimum-uitsnystuk"

msgid ""
"Use a number character as a textual snippet for this search result. "
"\"0\" equals \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" will let the search engine decide "
"the most effective length."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik ’n getalskarakter as ’n teks-snippet vir hierdie "
"soekresultaat. “0” beteken “geen snippet”. “-1” sal die "
"soekenjin toelaat om die mees effektiewe lengte te kies."

msgid ""
"Use a maximum of number seconds as a video snippet for videos on this "
"page in search results. \"0\" will use a static a image. \"-1\" means "
"there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik ’n maksimum aantal sekondes as ’n videoknip vir video’s "
"op hierdie bladsy in soekresultate. “0” sal ’n statiese beeld "
"gebruik. “-1” beteken daar is geen beperking nie."

msgid "Max Image Preview"
msgstr "Maksimum beeldvoorskou"

msgid "Unavailable after date"
msgstr "Nie beskikbaar na datum nie"

msgid "Do not show this page in search results after the specified date"
msgstr ""
"Moenie hierdie bladsy in soekresultate wys na die gespesifiseerde "
"datum nie"

msgid ""
"There were no overridden Metatag records that needed to be updated to "
"store the data using JSON."
msgstr ""
"Daar was geen oorskrywe Metatag-inskrywings wat bygewerk moes word om "
"die data met behulp van JSON te stoor nie."

msgid ""
"Processed @processed of @total updating Metatag records with the "
"Publisher or Name meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Verwerk @processed van @total opdatering van Metatag-inskrywings met "
"die Publisher- of Name-metaetikette."

msgid "There were no Metatag records to update."
msgstr "Daar was geen Metatag-inskrywings om op te dateer nie."

msgid "Removed meta tags from the @config Metatag configuration."
msgstr "Meta-etikette uit die @config Metatag-konfigurasie verwyder."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus is not enabled, nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"Meta-tag: Google Plus is nie geaktiveer nie—daar is niks om te doen "
"nie."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus has been uninstalled."
msgstr "Meta-tag: Google Plus is verwyder."

msgid ""
"Corrected the Twitter Card \"type\" value in the @config Metatag "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Die Twitter Card “type”-waarde is reggestel in die @config "
"Metatag-konfigurasie."

msgid "The computed meta tags for the entity."
msgstr "Die berekende meta-merkers vir die entiteit."

msgid "Deprecated module, do not use. Will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr "Afdankbare module, moenie gebruik nie. Gaan verwyder word in 3.0.0."

msgid ""
"Notes:<ul><li>no other fields are required for a Summary "
"card</li><li>Media player card requires the 'title', 'description', "
"'media player URL', 'media player width', 'media player height' and "
"'image' fields,</li><li>Summary Card with Large Image card requires "
"the 'Summary' field and the 'image' field,</li><li>App Card requires "
"the 'iPhone app ID' field, the 'iPad app ID' field and the 'Google "
"Play app ID' field,</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Notas:<ul><li>geen ander velde word vir ’n Opsommingkaart vereis "
"nie</li><li>’n Mediaspelerkaart vereis die velde: “titel”, "
"“beskrywing”, “mediaspeler-URL”, “mediaspelerwydte”, "
"“mediaspelerhoogte” en “beeld”,</li><li>’n Opsommingkaart "
"met Groot Beeld vereis die “Opsomming”-veld en die "
"“beeld”-veld,</li><li>’n Toepassingskaart vereis die "
"“iPhone-toepassing-ID”-veld, die “iPad-toepassing-ID”-veld en "
"die “Google Play-toepassing-ID”-veld,</li></ul>"

msgid "Separator used with multiple values"
msgstr "Skeier wat gebruik word met veelvuldige waardes"

msgid ""
"Controls the separator used when a meta tag allows multiple values. "
"Multiple characters can be used together, it does not have to be one "
"single character long. Defaults to \":default\"."
msgstr ""
"Beheer die skeier wat gebruik word wanneer ’n meta-tag veelvuldige "
"waardes toelaat. Meerdere karakters kan saam gebruik word; dit hoef "
"nie net een enkel karakter lank te wees nie. Stel standaard in op "
"\":default\"."

msgid ""
"Multiple values may be used, separated by `:delimiter`. Note: Tokens "
"that return multiple values will be handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Daar kan verskeie waardes gebruik word, geskei deur `:delimiter`. Let "
"wel: Tokens wat veelvuldige waardes terugstuur, sal outomaties hanteer "
"word."

msgid ""
"The full URL for loading a media player, specifically an iframe for an "
"embedded video rather than the URL to a page that contains a player. "
"Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Die volledige URL om ’n mediaspeler te laai—spesifiek ’n iframe "
"vir ’n ingebedde video eerder as die URL na ’n bladsy wat ’n "
"speler bevat. Vereis wanneer die Player Card-tipe gebruik word."

msgid ""
"The height of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogte van die media-speler-iframe, in pixels. Vereis wanneer die "
"Spelerkaart-tipe gebruik word."

msgid ""
"The width of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Die breedte van die media-speler iframe, in pixels. Vereis wanneer die "
"Player Card-tipe gebruik word."

msgid ""
"This will be truncated to a maximum of %max characters after any "
"tokens are processed."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal na verwerking van enige tokens tot ’n maksimum van %max "
"karakters ingekort word."

msgid ""
"Because of how tokens are processed in meta tags, use of the Maxlength "
"module may not provide an accurate representation of the actual "
"current length of each meta tag, so it may cause more problem than it "
"is worth."
msgstr ""
"As gevolg van hoe tokens in meta-tags verwerk word, mag die gebruik "
"van die Maxlength-module moontlik nie ’n akkurate voorstelling gee "
"van die werklike huidige lengte van elke meta-tag nie, en dit kan dus "
"meer probleme veroorsaak as wat dit werd is."

msgid ""
"Control the Metatag settings pages. Does not control access to the "
"Metatag field on content forms, etc, use the Field Permissions module "
"or hook_form_alter()."
msgstr ""
"Beheer die Metatag-instellingsblaaie. Beheer nie toegang tot die "
"Metatag-veld op inhoudsvorms, ens. nie—gebruik die **Field "
"Permissions**-module of **hook_form_alter()**."

msgid "End of the word trimming"
msgstr "Einde van die woord-afsnyding"

msgid "This module provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie module bied ondersteuning om pasgemaakte meta-etikette te "
"definieer en te bestuur."

msgid ""
"The module provides the option to create different <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Custom Tags\"</a> to use for different "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Die module bied die opsie om verskillende <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">“Pasgemaakte Tags”</a> te skep om vir "
"verskillende doeleindes te gebruik."

msgid "The best way of using Metatag: Custom Tags is as follows:"
msgstr "Die beste manier om Metatag: Custom Tags te gebruik, is soos volg:"

msgid ""
"Create the <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, "
"fill in the specific values that every page should have."
msgstr ""
"Skep die <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Pasgemaakte "
"Tag\"</a>, en vul die spesifieke waardes in wat elke bladsy moet hê."

msgid "Configure Custom tags below."
msgstr "Konfigureer pasgemaakte merkers hieronder."

msgid "Metatag: Custom Tags"
msgstr "Meta-etiket: Eie etikette"

msgid "Provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Bied ondersteuning om pasgemaakte meta-tags te definieer en te "
"bestuur."

msgid "Add Custom tag"
msgstr "Voeg pasgemaakte merker by"

msgid "Administer Custom tags"
msgstr "Administreer pasgemaakte tags"

msgid "Control the main settings pages and modify custom tags."
msgstr "Beheer die hoofinstellingsbladsye en wysig pasgemaakte merkers."

msgid "Delete Custom tag"
msgstr "Vee gepasmaakte merker uit"

msgid "Specify the name of the custom tag."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die naam van die pasgemaakte merker."

msgid "Specify the description of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die beskrywing van die pasgemaakte merker."

msgid "Select the HTML element of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Kies die HTML-element van die Gepasmaakte-etiket."

msgid "Value attribute"
msgstr "Waarde-attribuut"

msgid "Created %label Custom tag."
msgstr "Gepoog %label nuwe pasgemaakte merker geskep."

msgid "Updated %label Custom tag."
msgstr "Opgedateer %label pasgemaakte merker."

msgid "Edit Custom tag @label"
msgstr "Wysig persoonlike etiket @label"

msgid ""
"These custom tags are designed to use the custom purpose on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie pasgemaakte etikette is ontwerp om die pasgemaakte doel op die "
"webwerf te gebruik."

msgid "The entities routes metatags must be added by fields."
msgstr "Die entiteite se roetes-metatags moet deur velde bygevoeg word."

msgid "Trimming options"
msgstr "Snoeiopsies"

msgid ""
"A list of characters to trim at the end of all metatags. Provide a "
"single string without any separators, e.g. \"|,.\" (instead of \"| , "
".\"). Note that spaces, tabs, new lines, carriage returns and vertical "
"tabs (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") will be trimmed automatically and do not "
"need to be listed in this field. The trimming is applied at the very "
"end after the tag is trimmed for length, and after the trimming option "
"was executed."
msgstr ""
"’n Lys van karakters om aan die einde van alle metatags af te kap. "
"Verskaf ’n enkele string sonder enige skeidingstekens, bv. “|,.” "
"(in plaas van “| , .”). Let daarop dat spasies, oortjies, nuwe "
"reëls, karretjieterugkeer en vertikale oortjies (“ "
"\\n"
"\\r\\t\\v”) outomaties afgekap word en nie in hierdie veld gelys "
"hoef te word nie. Die afkap word heel aan die einde toegepas—nadat "
"die tag vir lengte afgekap is, en nadat die afkap-opsie uitgevoer is."

msgid "Configuration instance"
msgstr "Konfigurasie-instansie"

msgid ""
"Meta tag configuration, stored as either a serialized array or a "
"JSON-encoded string."
msgstr ""
"Meta-tag-konfigurasie, gestoor as óf ’n geserialiseerde skikking "
"óf ’n JSON-geënkodeerde string."

msgid "Expected an array but got null or other type for group: @group_name"
msgstr ""
"Verwag ’n skikking, maar het null of ’n ander tipe ontvang vir "
"groep: @group_name"

msgid "Optional suffix to add"
msgstr "Opsionele agtervoegsel om by te voeg"

msgid "Element of the HTML tag. e.g. meta, link, etc."
msgstr "Element van die HTML-tag. bv. meta, link, ens."

msgid ""
"The name of the html value attribute. e.g. content, href, charset, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"Die naam van die HTML `value`-kenmerk. bv. `content`, `href`, "
"`charset`, ens."

msgid ""
"Enter a unique identifier for this custom tag. This identifier can "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores. This is only used "
"internally, it is not used in the actual HTML output."
msgstr ""
"Voer ’n unieke identifiseerder vir hierdie pasgemaakte merker in. "
"Hierdie identifiseerder kan kleinletters, syfers en onderstrepings "
"bevat. Dit word slegs intern gebruik en word nie in die werklike "
"HTML-uitvoer gebruik nie."

msgid ""
"Select the Value attribute of the Custom tag. This determines which "
"HTML attribute will contain the user-provided content."
msgstr ""
"Kies die Value-attribuut van die Pasgemaakte (Custom) tag. Dit bepaal "
"watter HTML-attribuut die gebruiker se ingevoerde inhoud sal bevat."

msgid ""
"Define the HTML attributes for this custom meta tag. The first "
"attribute serves as the primary identifier and is required. Additional "
"attributes are optional and provide fixed values for all instances of "
"this tag."
msgstr ""
"Definieer die HTML-attribuutte vir hierdie pasgemaakte meta-tag. Die "
"eerste attribuut dien as die primêre identifiseerder en is "
"verpligtend. Bykomende attribuutte is opsioneel en voorsien "
"vasgestelde waardes vir alle instansies van hierdie tag."

msgid "Primary attribute (Required)"
msgstr "Primêre attribuut (Vereis)"

msgid "Additional attribute @num"
msgstr "Bykomende attribuut @num"

msgid "This attribute identifies the meta tag and is required."
msgstr "Hierdie kenmerk identifiseer die meta-tag en is verpligtend."

msgid "This attribute provides a fixed value for all instances of this tag."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie eienskap verskaf ’n vaste waarde vir alle instansies van "
"hierdie tag."

msgid "Common values: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."
msgstr "Algemene waardes: naam, eienskap, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."

msgid "Additional attribute name (e.g., type, sizes)."
msgstr "Bykomende attribuutnaam (bv. tipe, groottes)."

msgid ""
"For new tags, defaults to the machine name. For existing tags, this "
"identifies the specific meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Vir nuwe merkers gebruik dit die masjienaam as verstek. Vir bestaande "
"merkers identifiseer dit die spesifieke meta-merker."

msgid "Fixed value for this attribute."
msgstr "Vaste waarde vir hierdie eienskap."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h4>Common Examples:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Basic meta tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"description\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Open Graph tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Link with type:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Additional attribute: type "
"= \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" "
"type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        "
"</ul>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"<h4>Algemene Voorbeelde:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          <li><strong "
"Basiese meta-tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primêre attribuut: name "
"= \"description\"<br>\n"
"            Resultaat: &lt;meta "
"name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong Open Graph-tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primêre "
"attribuut: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Resultaat: "
"&lt;meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"  "
"        <li><strong Twitter-kaart:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primêre "
"attribuut: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Resultaat: "
"&lt;meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"  "
"        <li><strong Skakel met tipe:</strong><br>\n"
"            "
"Primêre attribuut: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Bykomende "
"attribuut: type = \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
