msgid ""
"The modules list page can become quite big when dealing with a fairly "
"large site or even just a dev site meant for testing new and various "
"modules being considered."
msgstr ""
"Die lys van modules-bladsy kan redelik groot word wanneer ’n mens "
"met ’n taamlik groot werf te doen het, of selfs net met ’n "
"ontwikkelingswerf wat bedoel is om nuwe en verskillende modules te "
"toets wat oorweeg word."

msgid ""
"What this module aims to accomplish is the ability to quickly find the "
"module you are looking for without having to rely on the browsers "
"search feature which more times than not shows you the module name in "
"the -Required by- or -Depends on- sections of the various modules or "
"even some other location on the page like a menu item."
msgstr ""
"Wat hierdie module beoog om te bereik, is die vermoë om vinnig die "
"module waarna jy soek te vind sonder om op die blaaier se soekfunksie "
"staat te maak—wat meer dikwels as nie die module se naam wys in die "
"gedeeltes **“Vereis deur”** of **“Afhang van”** van die "
"verskillende modules, of selfs op ’n ander plek op die bladsy, soos "
"’n kieslys-item."

