msgstr ""
"Bied integrasie van die Simple XML Sitemap-module met die "
"Views-module."

msgid ""
"No view displays are set to be indexed yet. <a href=\"@url\">Edit a "
"view.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Nog geen vertonings is opgestel om geïndekseer te word nie. <a "
"href=\"@url\">Wysig ’n vertoning.</a>"

msgid "The priority this display will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Die prioriteit wat hierdie vertoning sal hê in die oë van "
"soekenjinbots."

msgid "Maximum display variations"
msgstr "Maksimum vertoonvariasies"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of link variations to be indexed for this display. "
"If left blank, each argument will create link variations for this "
"display. Use with caution, as a large number of argument values​can "
"significantly increase the number of sitemap links."
msgstr ""
"Die maksimum aantal skakelkombinasies wat vir hierdie vertoning "
"geïndekseer moet word. As dit leeg gelaat word, sal elke argument "
"’n skakelkombinasie vir hierdie vertoning skep. Gebruik dit "
"versigtig, aangesien ’n groot aantal argumentwaardes die aantal "
"sitemap-skakels aansienlik kan verhoog."

msgid "Resume generation"
msgstr "Hervat-generering"

msgid "Add styling and sorting to sitemaps"
msgstr "Voeg stilering en sortering by sitemapse"

msgid ""
"If checked, sitemaps will be displayed as tables with sortable entries "
"and thus become much friendlier towards human visitors. Search engines "
"will not care."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal werfkaarte (sitemaps) as tabelle vertoon word "
"met inskrywings wat gesorteer kan word, en dit sal dus baie "
"vriendeliker wees vir menslike besoekers. Soekenjins sal nie omgee "
"nie."

msgid ""
"If checked, entity links are generated exclusively for languages the "
"entity has been translated to as long as the language is not excluded "
"below.<br>Otherwise entity links are generated for every language "
"installed on the site apart from languages excluded below.<br>Bear in "
"mind that non-entity paths like homepage will always be generated for "
"every non-excluded language."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, word entiteitskakels uitsluitlik vir tale gegenereer "
"waarvoor die entiteit vertaal is, solank die taal nie hieronder "
"uitgesluit is nie.<br>Anders word entiteitskakels vir elke taal wat op "
"die webwerf geïnstalleer is, gegenereer, behalwe vir tale wat "
"hieronder uitgesluit is.<br>Neem in ag dat nie-entiteitpaaie soos die "
"tuisblad altyd vir elke nie-uitgeslote taal gegenereer sal word."

msgid ""
"On some hosting providers it is impossible to pass parameters to cron "
"to tell Drupal which URL to bootstrap with. In this case the base URL "
"of sitemap links can be overridden here.<br>Example: <em>@url</em>"
msgstr ""
"Op sommige hostingverskaffers is dit onmoontlik om parameters aan cron "
"deur te gee om aan Drupal te sê watter URL om mee te bootstrap. In "
"hierdie geval kan die basis-URL van sitemap-skakels hier oorskryf "
"word.<br>Voorbeeld: <em>@url</em>"

msgid ""
"The maximum duration <strong>in seconds</strong> the generation task "
"can run during a single cron run or during one batch process "
"iteration.<br>The higher the number, the quicker the generation "
"process, but higher the risk of PHP timeout errors."
msgstr ""
"Die maksimum duur <strong>in sekondes</strong> wat die genereringstaak "
"kan loop tydens ’n enkele cron-onderbreking of tydens een iterasie "
"van ’n enkele bondelproses.<br>Hoe hoër die getal, hoe vinniger die "
"generasieproses, maar hoe hoër die risiko van PHP-time-outfoute."

msgid ""
"Administer Simple XML Sitemap settings, alter inclusion settings of "
"content and generate sitemaps on demand."
msgstr ""
"Beheer Simple XML Sitemap-instellings, verander insluitingsinstellings "
"vir inhoud en genereer sitemaps op aanvraag."

msgid "Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "Genereer alle werfmaps weer nadat jy op <em>Stoor</em> geklik het"

msgid "Otherwise the sitemaps will be regenerated during a future cron run."
msgstr ""
"Andersins sal die werkskaarte (sitemaps) tydens ’n toekomstige "
"cron-lopie weer gegenereer word."

msgid ""
"The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of "
"search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Die prioriteit wat hierdie <em>@bundle</em>-entiteit in die oë van "
"soekenjinbots sal hê."

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search "
"engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"Die frekwensie waarmee hierdie <em>@bundle</em>-entiteit verander. "
"Soekenjinbots kan dit beskou as ’n aanduiding van hoe gereeld dit "
"geïndekseer moet word."

msgid ""
"Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should "
"be included in the sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Bepaal of beelde wat deur hierdie <em>@bundle</em>-entiteit verwys "
"word, in die werfkaart ingesluit moet word."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Search engines)"
msgstr "Eenvoudige XML-sitemap (soekmotors)"

msgid "Search engine ID"
msgstr "Soekenjin-ID"

msgid "Last submitted"
msgstr "Laas ingedien"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission settings"
msgstr "Terreinkaartsoektog-enjinindieninginstellings"

msgid "Sitemap submission enabled"
msgstr "Sitemapa indiening geaktiveer"

msgid "Sitemap submission frequency"
msgstr "Sitemap indieningsfrekwensie"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission"
msgstr "Sitemap-oweringdienste vir soekenjin-indiening"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of links one sitemap can hold. If more links are "
"generated than set here, a sitemap index will be created and the links "
"split into several sub-sitemaps.<br>50 000 links is the maximum Google "
"will parse per sitemap, but choosing a lower value may be needed to "
"avoid PHP memory errors on huge sites.<br>If left blank, all links "
"will be shown on a single sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Die maksimum aantal skakels wat ’n sitemap kan bevat. As meer "
"skakels as hier ingestel gegenereer word, sal ’n sitemap-indeks "
"geskep word en die skakels in verskeie sub-sitemaps verdeel "
"word.<br>50 000 skakels is die maksimum wat Google per sitemap sal "
"ontleed, maar dit kan nodig wees om ’n laer waarde te kies om "
"PHP-geheuefoute op reuse-webwerwe te vermy.<br>As dit leeg gelaat "
"word, sal alle skakels op ’n enkele sitemap gewys word."

msgid "Configure, add content to and generate XML sitemaps."
msgstr "Stel op, voeg inhoud by en genereer XML-sitemapse."

msgid "Disable language hreflang"
msgstr "Skakel taal hreflang af"

msgid "Remove hreflang markup in HTML"
msgstr "Verwyder hreflang-opmaak in HTML"

msgid ""
"Google recommends displaying hreflang definitions either in the HTML "
"markup or in the sitemap, but not in both places.<br>If checked, "
"hreflang definitions created by the language module will be removed "
"from the markup reducing its size."
msgstr ""
"Google beveel aan om hreflang-definisies óf in die HTML-opmaak óf in "
"die sitemap te vertoon, maar nie op albei plekke nie.<br>As dit gemerk "
"is, sal hreflang-definisies wat deur die taalmodule geskep is, uit die "
"opmaak verwyder word en sodoende die grootte daarvan verminder."

msgid "published on @time"
msgstr "gepubliseer op @time"

msgid "published on @time, regenerating"
msgstr "gepubliseer op @time, besig om te hergenereer"

msgid ""
"The number of entities to process in each queue item.<br>Increasing "
"this number will use more memory but will result in less queries "
"improving generation speed."
msgstr ""
"Die aantal entiteite om in elke wachtryry-item te verwerk.<br>Om "
"hierdie getal te verhoog, sal meer geheue gebruik, maar sal minder "
"navrae tot gevolg hê en sodoende die genereringstempo verbeter."

msgid "@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed."
msgstr "@[indexed] is uit @[total] totale tou-items verwerk."

msgid ""
"All variants belonging to the built-in \"Default hreflang\" sitemap "
"type have been converted to entities. Custom sitemap types added via "
"plugins will have to be recreated manually. See "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. The sitemaps need to be "
"regenerated now."
msgstr ""
"Alle variante wat tot die ingeboude “Default "
"hreflang”-sitemap-tipe behoort, is na entiteite omgeskakel. "
"Pasgemaakte sitemap-tipes wat via inproppe bygevoeg is, sal handmatig "
"weer geskep moet word. Sien simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. "
"Die sitemaps moet nou weer gegenereer word."

