"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting this form."
msgstr ""
"Stuur ’n kennisgewing van wysiging aan IndexNow-versoenbare "
"soekenjins onmiddellik nadat hierdie vorm ingedien is."

msgid "Sitemap submission settings"
msgstr "Sitemap indieninginstellings"

msgid "Submit sitemaps to search engines"
msgstr "Dien werfkaarte by soekenjins in"

