msgstr "Voorkeur-IndeksNow-enjin"

msgid ""
"All IndexNow requests will be sent to the engine selected here. Only "
"one engine needs to be notified, as it will notify other IndexNow "
"compatible engines for you.<br/>For the sake of equality of "
"opportunity, <strong>consider leaving this at "
"<em>Random</em></strong>, so a random engine can be picked on each "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Alle IndexNow-versoeke sal na die enjin wat hier gekies is, gestuur "
"word. Slegs een enjin hoef in kennis gestel te word, aangesien dit "
"ander IndexNow-versoenbare enjins namens jou sal in kennis "
"stel.<br/>Ter wille van gelyke geleenthede, <strong>oorweeg dit om dit "
"op <em>Willekeurig</em></strong> te laat</em>, sodat ’n willekeurige "
"enjin op elke indiening gekies kan word."

msgid "Index on every entity save operation"
msgstr "Indekseer op elke entiteitstoorbewerking"

msgid ""
"If checked, all entity save operations for <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">included entities</a> will trigger "
"notification of IndexNow search engines.<br/>If unchecked, this will "
"only be possible by adding/altering/deleting an entity through a "
"form.<br/>This should be unchecked if there are mass operations "
"performed on entities that are irrelevant to indexing."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal alle entiteitstoevoegings- (save-)bedrywighede "
"vir <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">ingeslote entiteite</a> kennisgewing na "
"IndexNow-soekenjins veroorsaak.<br/>As dit nie gemerk is nie, sal dit "
"slegs moontlik wees deur ’n entiteit via ’n vorm by te voeg, te "
"wysig of te verwyder.<br/>Dit behoort nie gemerk te wees as daar "
"massabedrywighede op entiteite uitgevoer word wat irrelevant is vir "
"indeksering."

msgid ""
"The IndexNow verification key is saved in <em>Drupal state</em>. "
"Consider defining it in <em>settings.php</em> like so:<br/>@code"
msgstr ""
"Die IndexNow-verifikasiesleutel word in <em>Drupal state</em> gestoor. "
"Oorweeg dit om dit in <em>settings.php</em> te definieer soos "
"volg:<br/>@code"

msgid ""
"An IndexNow verification key needs to be generated and optionally "
"added to <em>settings.php</em> in order for IndexNow engines to get "
"notified about changes. This warning only applies to the production "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"’n IndexNow-verifikasiesleutel moet gegenereer word en, indien "
"nodig, by <em>settings.php</em> gevoeg word sodat IndexNow-enjins in "
"kennis gestel kan word van wysigings. Hierdie waarskuwing is slegs van "
"toepassing op die produksie-omgewing."

msgid ""
"Simple XML Sitemap settings will be added only to entity forms of "
"entity types enabled here. Settings for specific entity bundles (e.g. "
"<em>page</em>) can be adjusted here or on the bundle pages."
msgstr ""
"Eenvoudige XML-sitemap-instellings sal slegs by entiteitsvorms van "
"entiteitstipes wat hier geaktiveer is, bygevoeg word. Instellings vir "
"spesifieke entiteitsbundels (bv. <em>page</em>) kan hier of op die "
"bundelbladsye aangepas word."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap settings"
msgstr "Eenvoudige XML-sitemap-instellings"

msgid ""
"A sitemap index which lists all other sitemaps is now available and "
"can be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Daar is nou ’n sitemap-indeks beskikbaar wat al die ander sitemaps "
"lys, en dit kan geaktiveer word."

