msgstr ""
"Voeg pasgemaakte interne Drupal-paaie by spesifieke werfkaarte "
"(sitemaps)."

msgid ""
"Specify drupal internal (relative) paths, one per line. Do not forget "
"to prepend the paths with a '/'.<br>Optionally link priority <em>(0.0 "
"- 1.0)</em> can be added by appending it after a space.<br> Optionally "
"link change frequency <em>(always / hourly / daily / weekly / monthly "
"/ yearly / never)</em> can be added by appending it after a space."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer Drupal interne (relatiewe) paaie, een per reël. Moenie "
"vergeet om die paaie met ’n “/” vooraf te laat nie.<br>Opsioneel "
"kan ’n skakel-prioriteit <em>(0.0 - 1.0)</em> bygevoeg word deur dit "
"na ’n spasie agteraan te plaas.<br>Opsioneel kan die "
"skakel-wysigingfrekwensie <em>(always / hourly / daily / weekly / "
"monthly / yearly / never)</em> bygevoeg word deur dit na ’n spasie "
"agteraan te plaas."

msgid ""
"<strong>Examples:</strong><br><em>/ 1.0 daily</em> -> home page with "
"the highest priority and daily change frequency<br><em>/contact</em> "
"-> contact page with the default priority and no change frequency "
"information"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Voorbeelde:</strong><br><em>/ 1.0 daagliks</em> -> tuisblad "
"met die hoogste prioriteit en daaglikse "
"wysigingsfrekwensie<br><em>/contact</em> -> kontakblad met die "
"verstekprioriteit en geen wysigingsfrekwensie-inligting nie"

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The path <em>@path</em> does "
"not exist."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, lyn @line</strong>: Die pad <em>@path</em> bestaan "
"nie."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The path <em>@path</em> needs "
"to start with a '/'."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, lyn @line</strong>: Die pad <em>@path</em> moet met "
"’n ‘/’ begin."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The priority setting "
"<em>@priority</em> for path <em>@path</em> is incorrect. Set the "
"priority from 0.0 to 1.0."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, reël @line</strong>: Die prioriteitsinstelling "
"<em>@priority</em> vir pad <em>@path</em> is verkeerd. Stel die "
"prioriteit van 0,0 tot 1,0."

msgid ""
"<strong>@sitemap, line @line</strong>: The changefreq setting "
"<em>@changefreq</em> for path <em>@path</em> is incorrect. The "
"following are the correct values: <em>@changefreq_options</em>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>@sitemap, reël @line</strong>: Die changefreq-instelling "
"<em>@changefreq</em> vir pad <em>@path</em> is verkeerd. Die volgende "
"is die korrekte waardes: <em>@changefreq_options</em>."

