msgid ""
"Most legacy Upgrade Status data was cleaned up, however the "
"'queue_inspectable' table remains because it had values in it. This "
"will not cause issues with the module, but will linger around as old "
"unused data in the database. It may become a problem in the future if "
"another module chooses to use the same queue type name. Please remove "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Die meeste van die bestaande Upgrade Status-data is skoongemaak, maar "
"die tabel ‘queue_inspectable’ bly oor omdat dit waardes bevat het. "
"Dit sal nie probleme met die module veroorsaak nie, maar sal steeds in "
"die databasis agterbly as ou ongebruikte data. Dit kan in die toekoms "
"’n probleem word indien ’n ander module kies om dieselfde "
"koets-tipe naam te gebruik. Verwyder dit asseblief handmatig."

