msgstr "Verwerking van @name."

msgid "Drupal core and hosting environment"
msgstr "Drupal-kern en bedryfsomgewing van die webhosting"

msgid "Version cannot be detected, check manually."
msgstr "Weergawe kon nie opgespoor word nie; kontroleer handmatig."

msgid ""
"No deprecation scanning data available. <a href=\"@url\">Go to the "
"Upgrade Status form</a>."
msgstr ""
"Geen verouderingskanderingdata beskikbaar nie. <a href=\"@url\">Gaan "
"na die Opgraderingsstatusvorm</a>."

msgid "Fix now with automation"
msgstr "Maak nou reg deur outomatisering"

msgid "Fix now manually"
msgstr "Maak dit nou handmatig reg"

msgid ""
"It does not seem like these are covered by automation yet. <a "
"href=\"@drupal-rector\">Contribute to drupal-rector to provide "
"coverage</a>. Fix manually in the meantime."
msgstr ""
"Dit lyk nie of hierdie tans al deur outomatisering gedek word nie. <a "
"href=\"@drupal-rector\">Dra by tot drupal-rector om dekking te "
"verskaf</a>. Los dit intussen handmatig op."

msgid ""
"Errors without Drupal source version numbers including parse errors "
"and use of APIs from dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Foute sonder Drupal-bronweergawe-nommers, insluitend ontledingsfoute "
"en die gebruik van API’s vanaf afhanklikhede."

msgid ""
"Based on the Drupal deprecation version number of these, fixing them "
"may make the contributed project incompatible with supported Drupal "
"core versions."
msgstr ""
"Gebaseer op die Drupal-afkeuringsweergawegetal van dié, kan die "
"regmaak daarvan veroorsaak dat die bygedrae projek nie meer "
"versoenbaar is met ondersteunde Drupal-kernweergawes nie."

msgid ""
"Based on the Drupal deprecation version number of these, fixing them "
"will likely make them incompatible with your current Drupal version."
msgstr ""
"Gebaseer op die Drupal-afkeuringsweergawenommer van hierdie, sal die "
"regstelling daarvan waarskynlik veroorsaak dat dit nie met jou huidige "
"Drupal-weergawe versoenbaar is nie."

msgid ""
"Deprecated API use for APIs removed in future Drupal major versions is "
"not required to fix yet."
msgstr ""
"Afgemete API-gebruik vir API’s wat in toekomstige "
"Drupal-hoofweergawes verwyder word, is nog nie nodig om reg te stel "
"nie."

msgid "Fix with rector"
msgstr "Herstel met rector"

msgid ""
"Avoid some manual work by using drupal-rector for fixing issues "
"automatically or Upgrade Rector to generate patches."
msgstr ""
"Vermy sommige handmatige werk deur drupal-rector te gebruik om "
"probleme outomaties reg te stel, of Upgrade Rector om pleisters te "
"genereer."

msgid ""
"The project machine name @invalid_name is invalid. Is this a project "
"on this site? (For community projects, use the machine name of the "
"drupal.org project itself)."
msgstr ""
"Die projek se masjienaam @invalid_name is ongeldig. Is dit ’n projek "
"op hierdie webwerf? (Vir gemeenskapsprojekte, gebruik die masjienaam "
"van die drupal.org-projek self)."

msgid ""
"The project machine names @invalid_names are invalid. Are these "
"projects on this site? (For community projects, use the machine name "
"of the drupal.org project itself)."
msgstr ""
"Die projekmasjienname(s) @invalid_names is/ is ongeldig. Is hierdie "
"projekte op hierdie webwerf? (Vir gemeenskapsprojekte, gebruik die "
"masjiennaam van die drupal.org-projek self.)"

msgid "Using previous results for @name."
msgstr "Gebruik vorige resultate vir @name."

msgid "Version @current allows to upgrade but @new is available."
msgstr "Weergawe @current laat opgraderings toe, maar @new is beskikbaar."

msgid ""
"External dependencies for Upgrade Status are not available. Composer "
"must be used to download the module with dependencies. See <a "
"href=\"@url\">the Upgrade Status project page</a> for instructions."
msgstr ""
"Eksterne afhanklikhede vir Upgrade Status is nie beskikbaar nie. "
"Composer moet gebruik word om die module met afhanklikhede af te laai. "
"Sien <a href=\"@url\">die Upgrade Status-projekblad</a> vir "
"instruksies."

msgid "Export as text"
msgstr "Eksporteer as teks"

msgid "Export selected as HTML"
msgstr "Eksporteer geselekteer as HTML"

msgid "Export selected as text"
msgstr "Kiesbesonderhede as teks uitvoer"

msgid ""
"The likely best action is to remove projects that are uninstalled. Why "
"invest in updating them to be compatible if you are not using them?"
msgstr ""
"Die waarskynlik beste stap is om projekte te verwyder wat oninstalleer "
"is. Waarom sou jy tyd spandeer om hulle op datum te bring vir "
"versoenbaarheid as jy dit nie gebruik nie?"

msgid ""
"Status of this project cannot be determined without scanning the "
"source code here. Use this form to run a scan on these."
msgstr ""
"Die status van hierdie projek kan nie bepaal word sonder om die "
"bronkode hier te ondersoek nie. Gebruik hierdie vorm om ’n "
"skandering op dié uit te voer."

msgid "Collaborate with maintainers"
msgstr "Werk saam met instandhouers"

msgid ""
"Some or all problems found can be fixed automatically with <a "
"href=\":drupal-rector\">drupal-rector</a>. Make the machine do the "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Sommige of al die probleme wat gevind word, kan outomaties reggemaak "
"word met <a href=\":drupal-rector\">drupal-rector</a>. Laat die "
"masjien die werk doen."

msgid "Fix manually"
msgstr "Herstel handmatig"

msgid ""
"It looks like there is no automated fixes for either problems found. "
"Check the report for pointers on how to fix."
msgstr ""
"Dit lyk of daar geen outomatiese oplossings is vir enige van die "
"probleme wat gevind is nie. Gaan die verslag na vir leidrade oor hoe "
"om dit reg te stel."

msgid "Well done. Congrats! Let's get everything else here!"
msgstr "Goed gedaan. Baie geluk! Kom ons kry nou alles anders hier gedoen!"

msgid "Local scan result"
msgstr "Plaaslike skandeerresultaat"

msgid "Drupal.org version"
msgstr "Drupal.org-weergawe"

msgid "Drupal.org issues"
msgstr "Drupal.org-kwessies"

msgid "Never checked"
msgstr "Nooit nagegaan nie"

msgid "Last checked @time ago"
msgstr "Laatst nagegaan @time gelede"

msgid "Gather data"
msgstr "Versamel data"

msgid "Fix incompatibilities"
msgstr "Los onversoenbaarhede op"

msgid "Relax"
msgstr "Ontspan"

msgid ""
"Install <a href=\":composer_deploy\">Composer Deploy</a> or <a "
"href=\":git_deploy\">Git Deploy</a> as appropriate for accurate update "
"recommendations"
msgstr ""
"Installeer <a href=\":composer_deploy\">Composer Deploy</a> of <a "
"href=\":git_deploy\">Git Deploy</a> soos toepaslik vir akkurate "
"opdateringsaanbevelings"

msgid "Environment is incompatible"
msgstr "Omgewing is onversoenbaar"

msgid "Environment checks passed"
msgstr "Omgewingskontroles het geslaag"

msgid ""
"Starting Upgrade Status on @count projects without HTTP sandboxing "
"because the built-in PHP webserver does not allow for that."
msgstr ""
"Begin met opgraderingstatus op @count projekte sonder HTTP-sandboxing, "
"omdat die ingeboude PHP-webbediener nie daarvoor voorsiening maak nie."

msgid ""
"Starting Upgrade Status on @count projects without HTTP sandboxing. "
"@error"
msgstr ""
"Begin Opgraderingsstatus op @count projekte sonder HTTP-sandboxing. "
"@error"

msgid "Starting Upgrade Status on @count projects with HTTP sandboxing."
msgstr "Begin opgraderingsstatus op @count projekte met HTTP-sandboxing."

msgid "Finished Upgrade Status processing successfully."
msgstr "Opgraderingstatusverwerking suksesvol voltooi."

msgid "Finished Upgrade Status processing with errors."
msgstr "Opgraderingstatusverwerking voltooi met foute."

