msgstr "%phpstan_fail"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":prepare\">Read more about preparing your site for Drupal "
"9</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":prepare\">Lees meer oor hoe om jou webwerf vir Drupal 9 "
"voor te berei</a>."

msgid ""
"Review Drupal major upgrade readiness of the environment and "
"components of the site."
msgstr ""
"Evalueer die gereedheid van die omgewing en die webwerf se komponente "
"vir ’n groot opgradering van Drupal."

msgid ""
"There is an update available. Even if that is not fully compatible "
"with the next major Drupal core, it may be more compatible than what "
"you have, so best to start with updating first."
msgstr ""
"Daar is ’n opdatering beskikbaar. Selfs al is dit nie ten volle "
"versoenbaar met die volgende hoofweergawe van Drupal-kern nie, kan dit "
"dalk beter versoenbaar wees as wat jy tans het—so dit is die beste "
"om eers met opdateer te begin."

msgid ""
"There may be Drupal.org issues by contributors or even <a "
"href=\":drupal-bot\">the Project Update Bot</a>. Work with the "
"maintainer to get them committed, provide feedback if they worked."
msgstr ""
"Daar kan Drupal.org-kwessies wees deur bydraers, of selfs <a "
"href=\":drupal-bot\">die Projekopdateringsbot</a>. Werk saam met die "
"onderhoudhouer om dit laat inboek, en gee terugvoer as dit gewerk het."

msgid "Compatible with next major Drupal core version"
msgstr "Versoenbaar met die volgende groot Drupal-kernweergawe"

msgid ""
"Run the report to find out if there are detectable compatibility "
"errors with the modules and themes installed on your site."
msgstr ""
"Laat die verslag loop om uit te vind of daar opspoorbare "
"versoenbaarheidsfoute is met die modules en temas wat op jou werf "
"geïnstalleer is."

msgid "Drupal @version upgrade status"
msgstr "Drupal @version-opgraderingsstatus"

msgid "Supported."
msgstr "Ondersteun."

msgid "Not supported."
msgstr "Nie ondersteun nie."

msgid "Database JSON support required"
msgstr "Databasis JSON-ondersteuning word vereis"

msgid "None installed."
msgstr "Geen geïnstalleer nie."

msgid ""
"Deprecated or obsolete core extensions installed. These will be "
"removed in the next major version."
msgstr ""
"Afgekeurde of verouderde kernuitbreidings wat geïnstalleer is. Dit "
"sal in die volgende hoofweergawe verwyder word."

msgid ""
"When using PostgreSQL, minimum version is 12 <a href=\":trgm\">with "
"the pg_trgm extension</a> created."
msgstr ""
"By die gebruik van PostgreSQL is die minimum weergawe 12 met die <a "
"href=\":trgm\">pg_trgm-uitbreiding</a> wat geskep is."

msgid "Has pg_trgm extension."
msgstr "Het die **pg_trgm**-uitbreiding."

msgid "No pg_trgm extension."
msgstr "Geen pg_trgm-uitbreiding nie."

msgid "Custom profile"
msgstr "Aangepaste profiel"

msgid "Contributed module"
msgstr "Bygedraerde module"

msgid "Contributed theme"
msgstr "Bygedraende tema"

msgid "Contributed profile"
msgstr "Bygedra-laer profiel"

msgid "Permissions of user role: \"@role\":"
msgstr "Toestemmings van gebruikersrol: \"@role\":"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":url\">Invalid permissions will trigger runtime exceptions "
"in Drupal 10.</a> Permissions should be defined in a permissions.yml "
"file or a permission callback."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":url\">Ongeldige toestemmings sal tydens looptyd ’n "
"uitsondering in Drupal 10 veroorsaak.</a> Toestemmings behoort in ’n "
"permissions.yml-lêer gedefinieer te word, of via ’n permission "
"callback."

msgid ""
"Upgrades to Drupal 10 are supported from Drupal 9.4.x and Drupal "
"9.5.x. It is suggested to update to the latest Drupal 9 version "
"available. <a href=\":platform\">Several hosting platform requirements "
"have been raised for Drupal 10</a>."
msgstr ""
"Opgraderings na Drupal 10 word ondersteun vanaf Drupal 9.4.x en Drupal "
"9.5.x. Daar word voorgestel om op te dateer na die nuutste beskikbare "
"Drupal 9-weergawe. <a href=\":platform\">Verskeie vereistes vir "
"gasheerplatforms is vir Drupal 10 verhoog</a>."

msgid "Version @version."
msgstr "Weergawe @version."

msgid "Version @current does not allow to upgrade and @new is available."
msgstr ""
"Weergawe @current laat nie toe om op te gradeer nie en @new is "
"beskikbaar."

msgid "Drupal core should be at least 9.4.x"
msgstr "Driesels se kern (Drupal core) behoort ten minste 9.4.x te wees."

msgid "Language:"
msgstr "Taal:"

msgid "Table select"
msgstr "Tabel selekteer"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the %label @entity-type?"
msgstr "Is jy seker jy wil die %label @entity-type uitvee?"

msgid "viewed submission only"
msgstr "bekyk slegs indiening"

msgid "both form and viewed submission"
msgstr "beide vorm en bekykte insending"

msgid ""
"The next submission number was increased to @min to make it higher "
"than existing submissions."
msgstr ""
"Die volgende indieningsnommer is verhoog na @min om dit hoër te maak "
"as bestaande indienings."

msgid "Submitted to: Entity type"
msgstr "Ingedien by: Entiteittipe"

msgid "The entity type to which this submission was submitted from."
msgstr "Die entiteitstipe waarheen hierdie instansie ingedien is."

msgid ""
"Key-value pairs MUST be specified as \"safe_key: 'Some readable "
"option'\". Use of only alphanumeric characters and underscores is "
"recommended in keys. One option per line. Option groups can be created "
"by using just the group name followed by indented group options."
msgstr ""
"Sleutel-waarde-pare MOETEN gespesifiseer word as `\"safe_key: 'Sommige "
"leesbare opsie'\"`. Dit word aanbeveel om slegs alfanumeriese "
"karakters en onderstrepings in sleutels te gebruik. Een opsie per "
"reël. Opsiegroepe kan geskep word deur slegs die groepnaam te "
"gebruik, gevolg deur ingekeepte groepopsies."

msgid ""
"Export creation complete. Your download should begin now. If it does "
"not start, <a href=\":href\">download the file here</a>. This file may "
"only be downloaded once."
msgstr ""
"Uitvoer-skepping voltooi. Jou aflaai behoort nou te begin. As dit nie "
"begin nie, <a href=\":href\">laai die lêer hier af</a>. Hierdie lêer "
"kan slegs een keer afgelaai word."

msgid "The current wizard page."
msgstr "Die huidige towenaarbladsy."

msgid "Default form confidential message"
msgstr "Standaardvorm vir vertroulike boodskap"

msgid "This is used for the previous page button within a wizard."
msgstr ""
"Dit word gebruik vir die vorige bladsy-knoppie binne ’n towenaar "
"(wizard)."

msgid "This is used for the next page button within a wizard."
msgstr ""
"Dit word vir die volgende knoppie op ’n "
"towenaar/stap-vir-stap-assistent gebruik."

msgid "Checkboxes other"
msgstr "Merkblokkies ander"

msgid "Likert answers format"
msgstr "Likert-antwoordformaat"

msgid "Answer keys, the raw value stored in the database (key)"
msgstr ""
"Antwoordsleutels, die rou waarde wat in die databasis gestoor word "
"(sleutel)"

msgid "Wizard end label"
msgstr "Wysigingseinde-knoppielabel"

msgid "Default wizard end label"
msgstr "Standaard towenaar-eindetiket"

msgid "Address line 3"
msgstr "Adresreël 3"

msgid "Default elements"
msgstr "Standaardelemente"

msgid "The elements have been unexpectedly altered. Please try again"
msgstr "Die elemente is onverwags verander. Probeer asseblief weer."

msgid ""
"There has been error validating the elements. You may need to edit the "
"<a href=\":href\">YAML source</a> to resolve the issue."
msgstr ""
"Daar is ’n fout opgeteken tydens die validering van die elemente. Jy "
"moet dalk die <a href=\":href\">YAML-bron</a> wysig om die probleem op "
"te los."

msgid "Leaving blank will use the default maxlength."
msgstr "As jy dit leeg laat, sal die verstekmaksimumlengte gebruik word."

msgid "Leaving blank will use the default rows."
msgstr "As jy dit leeg laat, sal die verstekrye gebruik word."

msgid "Specifies the minimum value."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die minimum waarde."

msgid "Specifies the maximum value."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die maksimum waarde."

msgid ""
"The placeholder will be shown in the element until the user starts "
"entering a value."
msgstr ""
"Die plekhouer sal in die element vertoon word totdat die gebruiker "
"begin om ’n waarde in te voer."

msgid "Contents should be visible (open) to the user."
msgstr "Inhoud moet vir die gebruiker sigbaar wees (oop)."

msgid "Private elements are shown only to users with results access."
msgstr ""
"Privaat elemente word slegs aan gebruikers met toegang tot resultate "
"gewys."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the initial option denoting no selection in a "
"select element."
msgstr ""
"Die etiket om te wys vir die aanvanklike opsie wat geen keuse aandui "
"in ’n kieslys-element."

msgid ""
"The value for the initial option denoting no selection in a select "
"element, which is used to determine whether the user submitted a value "
"or not."
msgstr ""
"Die waarde vir die aanvanklike opsie wat aandui dat daar geen keuse "
"gemaak is in ’n kieslys-element, en wat gebruik word om te bepaal of "
"die gebruiker ’n waarde ingedien het of nie."

msgid "Other placeholder"
msgstr "Ander plekhouer"

msgid "These properties and callbacks are not allowed: @properties"
msgstr "Hierdie eiendomme en terugroepe word nie toegelaat nie: @properties"

msgid ""
"Option groups can be created by using just the group name followed by "
"indented group options."
msgstr ""
"Opsiegroepe kan geskep word deur net die groeplnaam te gebruik, gevolg "
"deur ingesprinkelde groeppopsies."

msgid "Completed @feedback submissions (@rate submissions/min)"
msgstr "Voltooide @feedback-inlewerings (@rate-inlewerings/min)"

msgid "Date part and order"
msgstr "Datumdeel en volgorde"

msgid "Date text parts"
msgstr "Datum-tekstdele"

msgid ""
"A description of the range of years to allow, like '1900:2050', "
"'-3:+3' or '2000:+3', where the first value describes the earliest "
"year and the second the latest year in the range."
msgstr ""
"’n Beskrywing van die reeks jare om toe te laat, soos byvoorbeeld "
"“1900:2050”, “-3:+3” of “2000:+3”, waar die eerste waarde "
"die vroegste jaar en die tweede die jongste jaar in die reeks aandui."

msgid "Date increment"
msgstr "Datumverhoging"

msgid "The increment to use for minutes and seconds"
msgstr "Die inkrement om vir minute en sekondes te gebruik"

msgid "Email confirm"
msgstr "E-pos bevestig"

msgid "Radios other"
msgstr "Radios ander"

msgid "Composite element item format"
msgstr "Samestellende element item-formaat"

msgid "Enter a part of the element name to filter by."
msgstr "Voer ’n deel van die elementnaam in om volgens te filter."

msgid ""
"The %title (@type) is a root element that can not be used as child to "
"another element"
msgstr ""
"Die %title (@type) is ’n wortelelement wat nie as ’n kindelement "
"vir ’n ander element gebruik kan word nie."

msgid "Total submissions limit message"
msgstr "Totale indieningsbeperkingsboodskap"

msgid "Per user submission limit message"
msgstr "Per gebruiker se indieningslimietboodskap"

msgid "Default total submissions limit message"
msgstr "Standaardboodskap vir die maksimum totale indieningsbeperkingslimiet"

msgid "Default per user submission limit message"
msgstr "Verstek per gebruiker indieningslimietboodskap"

msgid ""
"An <a href=\":href\">inputmask</a> helps the user with the element by "
"ensuring a predefined format."
msgstr ""
"’n <a href=\":href\">inputmask</a> help die gebruiker met die "
"element deur te verseker dat ’n voorafbepaalde formaat gebruik word."

msgid "Email multiple"
msgstr "E-pos verskeie"

msgid ""
"A <a href=\":href\">regular expression</a> that the element's value is "
"checked against."
msgstr ""
"’ n <a href=\":href\">gereelde uitdrukking</a> waarteen die element "
"se waarde getoets word."

msgid "The maximum number of matches to be displayed."
msgstr "Die maksimum aantal treffers wat vertoon moet word."

msgid ""
"The minimum number of characters a user must type before a search is "
"performed."
msgstr ""
"Die minimum aantal karakters wat ’n gebruiker moet tik voordat ’n "
"soektog uitgevoer word."

msgid "Limit entered value to a maximum number of characters or words."
msgstr ""
"Beperk die ingevoerde waarde tot ’n maksimum aantal karakters of "
"woorde."

msgid ""
"If checked, all <a href=\":details_href\">Details</a> element's "
"open/close state will be saved using <a "
"href=\":local_storage_href\">Local Storage</a>."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die oop-/toemaakstatus van alle <a "
"href=\":details_href\">Details</a>-elemente gestoor word met behulp "
"van <a href=\":local_storage_href\">Lokale Berging</a>."

msgid ""
"Please check the formats that are available for this element. Leave "
"blank to allow all available formats."
msgstr ""
"Kontroleer watter formate vir hierdie element beskikbaar is. Laat dit "
"leeg om alle beskikbare formate toe te laat."

msgid "If checked, the 'About text formats' link will be hidden."
msgstr "Indien gemerk, sal die skakel vir “Oor teksformate” versteek word."

msgid "@title placeholder"
msgstr "@title plekhouer"

msgid "Determines the placement of the description."
msgstr "Bepaal die plasing van die beskrywing."

msgid "Page (redirects to new page and displays the confirmation message)"
msgstr ""
"Bladsy (herlei na ’n nuwe bladsy en vertoon die "
"bevestigingsboodskap)"

msgid ""
"Key-value pairs MUST be specified as \"safe_key: 'Some readable "
"options'\". Use of only alphanumeric characters and underscores is "
"recommended in keys. One option per line."
msgstr ""
"Sleutel-waarde-pare MOET as `\"safe_key: 'Sommige leesbare opsies'\"` "
"gespesifiseer word. Word aanbeveel om slegs alfanumeriese karakters en "
"onderstreep in sleutels te gebruik. Een opsie per reël."

msgid "Options display"
msgstr "Opsies vertoon"

msgid "Other option label"
msgstr "Ander opsie-etiket"

msgid "Other maxlength"
msgstr "Ander maksimumlengte"

msgid "Email confirm settings"
msgstr "E-posbevestigingsinstellings"

msgid "Email confirm description"
msgstr "E-posbevestiging beskrywing"

msgid "Email confirm placeholder"
msgstr "E-posbevestiging-plaasmerker"

msgid "Show reset button"
msgstr "Wys terugstelknoppie"

msgid "If checked, a reset button will be placed before the rating element."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal ’n terugstelknoppie voor die "
"waarderingselement geplaas word."

msgid "Changing from %type"
msgstr "Verander van %type"

msgid "Specifies the minimum date."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die minimum datum."

msgid "Specifies the maximum date."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die maksimum datum."

msgid ""
"Datetime element is designed to have sane defaults so any or all can "
"be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Die datumtydelement is ontwerp met verstandige verstekwaardes sodat "
"enige of al die velde weggelaat kan word."

msgid ""
"Both the date and time components are configurable so they can be "
"output as HTML5 datetime elements or not, as desired."
msgstr ""
"Beide die datum- en tydkomponente is konfigureerbaar sodat dit, soos "
"verlang, as HTML5-datumelemente uitgestuur kan word of nie."

msgid "Date element"
msgstr "Datumelement"

msgid "HTML datetime - Use the HTML5 datetime element type."
msgstr "HTML datetime – Gebruik die HTML5 datetime-elementtipe."

msgid ""
"HTML datetime input (localized) - Use the HTML5 datetime-local element "
