msgstr "Tabelseleksie sorteer"

msgid ""
"'@title' is a '@type' element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered."
msgstr ""
"“@title” is ’n “@type”-element, wat gedeaktiveer is en nie "
"weergegee sal word nie."

