msgstr ""
"HTML5-datumtydelemente degradeer nie mooi in ouer blaaiers nie en sal "
"as ’n gewone teksveld vertoon word sonder ’n datum- of tydkieser."

msgid ""
"Time format is only applicable for browsers that do not have support "
"for the HTML5 time element. Browsers that support the HTML5 time "
"element will display the time using the user's preferred format."
msgstr ""
"Die tydformaat is slegs van toepassing op blaaiers wat nie "
"ondersteuning vir die HTML5-tydelement het nie. Blaaiers wat die "
"HTML5-tydelement ondersteun, sal die tyd vertoon volgens die gebruiker "
"se voorkeurformaat."

msgid ""
"Enter time format using <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/en/function.date.php\">Time Input "
"Format</a>."
msgstr ""
"Voer die tydformaat in met behulp van <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/en/function.date.php\">Tyd-invoerdformaat</a>."

msgid ""
"Private file system is not set. This must be changed in <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/file\">settings.php</a>. "
"For more information see: <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/psa-2016-003\">DRUPAL-PSA-2016-003</a>"
msgstr ""
"Privaat lêerstelsel is nie ingestel nie. Dit moet verander word in <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/documentation/modules/file\">settings.php</a>. "
"Vir meer inligting sien: <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/psa-2016-003\">DRUPAL-PSA-2016-003</a>"

msgid ""
"Specifies the legal number intervals. Leave blank to support any "
