"%title is a %type element, which has been disabled and will not be "
"rendered. Please contact a site administrator."
msgstr ""
"%title is ’n %type-element wat gedeaktiveer is en nie gerender sal "
"word nie. Kontak asseblief ’n werfadministrateur."

