msgstr "KRY (Pasgemaak)"

msgid ""
"Code Mirror is used to provide a text editor for YAML, HTML, CSS, and "
"JavaScript configuration settings and messages."
msgstr ""
"Code Mirror word gebruik om ’n teksredigeerder te verskaf vir YAML-, "
"HTML-, CSS- en JavaScript-konfigurasie-instellings en boodskappe."

msgid ""
"Input masks are used to ensure predefined and custom formats for text "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Invoer-maskers word gebruik om voorafbepaalde en pasgemaakte formate "
"vir teksvelde te verseker."

msgid ""
"Rating plugin for jQuery. Fast, progressive enhancement, touch "
"support, customizable (just swap out the images, or change some CSS), "
"unobtrusive JavaScript (using HTML5 data-* attributes), RTL support. "
"The Rating plugin supports as many stars as you'd like, and also any "
"step size."
msgstr ""
"Resensie-/graderingsinprop vir jQuery. Vinnig, progressiewe "
"verbetering, ondersteuning vir raakskerm, aanpasbaar (vervang net die "
"beelde, of verander ’n paar CSS), onopdringerige JavaScript (met "
"behulp van HTML5 data-* eienskappe), en ondersteuning vir RTL. Die "
"Rating-inprop ondersteun soveel sterre as wat jy wil, asook enige "
"stapgrootte."

msgid ""
"Select2 gives you a customizable select box with support for searching "
"and tagging."
msgstr ""
"Select2 gee jou ’n aanpasbare kieslys-boks met ondersteuning vir "
"soektog en etikettering."

msgid ""
"Signature Pad is a JavaScript library for drawing smooth signatures. "
"It is HTML5 canvas based and uses variable width Bézier curve "
"interpolation. It works in all modern desktop and mobile browsers and "
"doesn't depend on any external libraries."
msgstr ""
"Signature Pad is ’n JavaScript-biblioteek om gladde handtekeninge te "
"teken. Dit is gebaseer op ’n HTML5-doek (canvas) en gebruik "
"veranderlike-wydte Bézier-kromme-interpolasie. Dit werk in alle "
"moderne desktop- en mobiele blaaiers en is nie afhanklik van enige "
"eksterne biblioteke nie."

msgid "Signature Pad is used to provide a signature element."
msgstr ""
"Die handtekeningpaneel word gebruik om ’n handtekening-element te "
"verskaf."

msgid ""
"A lightweight, customizable javascript timepicker plugin for jQuery, "
"inspired by Google Calendar."
msgstr ""
"’n Ligte, aanpasbare JavaScript-tydskokker-inprop vir jQuery, "
"geïnspireer deur Google Calendar."

msgid "Timepicker is used to provide a polyfill for HTML 5 time elements."
msgstr ""
"Tydkieser word gebruik om ’n polyfill vir HTML 5-tydelemente te "
"verskaf."

msgid ""
"Word or character counting, with server-side validation, is available "
"for text fields and text areas."
msgstr ""
"Woorde- of karaktertelling, met serverkant-validasie, is beskikbaar "
"vir teksvelde en teksareas."

msgid "For multiple options, use commas to separate multiple defaults."
msgstr ""
"Vir veelvuldige opsies, gebruik kommas om verskeie verstekwaardes te "
"skei."

msgid "Other field prefix"
msgstr "Ander veldvoorvoegsel"

msgid "Other field suffix"
msgstr "Ander veldsuffix"

msgid ""
"Select where the final files should be stored. Private file storage "
"has more overhead than public files, but allows restricted access to "
"files within this element."
msgstr ""
"Kies waar die finale lêers gestoor moet word. Privaatlêeropberging "
"het meer oorhoof dan publieke lêers, maar dit laat beperkte toegang "
"tot lêers binne hierdie element toe."

msgid "Confirmation page URL alias"
msgstr "Bevestigingsbladsy-URL-alias"

msgid "Default confirmation back label"
msgstr "Standaardbevestiging-terugetiket"

