"The %title (@type) is a webform element that can not have any child "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"Die %title (@type) is ’n webvorm-element wat nie enige onderliggende "
"elemente kan hê nie."

msgid "Webform %label created."
msgstr "Webvorm %label geskep."

msgid "Webform %label elements saved."
msgstr "Webvorm %label-elemente gestoor."

msgid "Webform @label created."
msgstr "Webvorm @label geskep."

msgid "There are currently no handlers setup for this webform."
msgstr "Daar is tans geen hanteerders opgestel vir hierdie webvorm nie."

msgid "Webform %label handler saved."
msgstr "Webvorm %label-hanterer is gestoor."

msgid "Webform @label handler saved."
msgstr "Webvorm @label hanteerder gestoor."

msgid ""
"If checked, this webform will be available as a template to all users "
"who can create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal hierdie webvorm as ’n sjabloon beskikbaar wees "
"vir alle gebruikers wat nuwe webvorms kan skep."

msgid ""
"If checked, all warnings and log messages about 'This webform is "
"currently not saving any submitted data.' will be suppressed."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal alle waarskuwings en logboodskappe oor “Hierdie "
"webvorm stoor tans geen ingediende data nie.” onderdruk word."

msgid ""
"Optionally specify an alternative URL by which the webform "
"confirmation page can be accessed."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer opsioneel ’n alternatiewe URL waarlangs die "
"webvormbevestigingsbladsy verkry kan word."

msgid "A message to be displayed if the webform breaks."
msgstr "’n Boodskap wat vertoon moet word as die webvorm breek."

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be displayed a warning message when they "
"navigate away from a webform with unsaved changes."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal gebruikers ’n waarskuwingsboodskap wys wanneer "
"hulle wegbeweeg van ’n webvorm met ongestoorde veranderinge."

msgid ""
"If checked, an expand/collapse all (details) link will be added to "
"this webform when there are two or more details elements available on "
"the webform."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal ’n uitbrei/inklap alles (besonderhede)-skakel by "
"hierdie webvorm gevoeg word wanneer daar twee of meer "
"besonderhede-elemente op die webvorm beskikbaar is."

msgid ""
"The value of the next submission number. This is usually 1 when you "
"start and will go up with each webform submission."
msgstr ""
"Die waarde van die volgende indieningsnommer. Dit is gewoonlik 1 "
"wanneer jy begin, en dit sal styg met elke webvormindiening."

msgid "The username of the webform author/owner."
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam van die webvormskrywer/eienaar."

msgid ""
"Please make sure this webform's action URL or path is setup to handle "
"the webform's submission."
msgstr ""
"Maak asseblief seker dat hierdie webvorm se aksie-URL of pad opgestel "
"is om die webvorm se indiening te hanteer."

msgid "The URL or path to which the webform will be submitted."
msgstr "Die URL of pad waarheen die webvorm ingedien sal word."

msgid ""
"This webform is currently not saving any submitted data. Please enable "
"the <a href=\":settings_href\">saving of results</a> or add a <a "
"href=\":handlers_href\">submission handler</a> to the webform."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie webvorm stoor tans geen ingediende data nie. Aktiveer "
"asseblief die <a href=\":settings_href\">stoor van resultate</a>, of "
"voeg ’n <a href=\":handlers_href\">indieningshanterer</a> by die "
"webvorm."

msgid ""
"The below webform has been prepopulated with custom/random test data. "
"When submitted, this information <strong>will still be saved</strong> "
"and/or <strong>sent to designated recipients</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Die onderstaande webvorm is vooraf ingevul met "
"pasgemaakte/willekeurige toetsdata. Wanneer dit ingedien word, sal "
"hierdie inligting <strong>steeds gestoor</strong> en/of <strong>aan "
"aangewese ontvangers gestuur</strong> word."

msgid "Submissions to %webform for %user"
msgstr "Inskrywings vir %webform aan %user"

msgid ""
"There are no third party settings available. Please install a "
"contributed module that integrates with the Webform module."
msgstr ""
"Daar is geen derdeparty-instellings beskikbaar nie. Installeer "
"asseblief ’n bygedra module wat met die Webform-module integreer."

msgid "Webform info"
msgstr "Webvorm-inligting"

msgid ""
"No export file ready for download. The file may have already been "
"downloaded by your browser. Visit the <a href=\":href\">download "
"export webform</a> to create a new export."
msgstr ""
"Geen uitvoerlêer gereed vir aflaai nie. Die lêer is moontlik reeds "
"deur jou blaaier afgelaai. Besoek die <a href=\":href\">laai "
"uitvoer-webvorm af</a> om ’n nuwe uitvoer te skep."

msgid "Testing %title webform"
msgstr "Toetsing %title-webvorm"

msgid "The UUID of the webform submission entity."
msgstr "Die UUID van die webvorm-inskrywing-entiteit."

msgid "The URI the user submitted the webform."
msgstr "Die URI wat die gebruiker vir die webvorm ingedien het."

msgid ""
"The time that the webform submission was first saved as draft or "
"submitted."
msgstr ""
"Die tyd toe die webvorminskrywing vir die eerste keer as ’n konsep "
"gestoor is of ingedien is."

msgid ""
"The time that the webform submission was submitted as complete (not "
"draft)."
msgstr ""
"Die tyd wanneer die webvorminskrywing as voltooi (nie as konsep nie) "
"ingedien is."

msgid ""
"The time that the webform submission was last saved (complete or "
"draft)."
msgstr ""
"Die tyd toe die webvorminskrywing laas gestoor is (volledig of "
"konsep)."

msgid "Disable client-side validation for all webforms"
msgstr "Skakel kliënt-kant-validasie vir alle webvorms af"

