"If checked, the <a href=\":href\">novalidate</a> attribute, which "
"disables client-side validation, will be added to all webforms."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die <a href=\":href\">novalidate</a>-kenmerk, "
"wat kliëntkant-validasie deaktiveer, by alle webvorms gevoeg word."

msgid ""
"Determines the default placement of the description for all webform "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"Bepaal die verstekplasing van die beskrywing vir alle "
"webvorm-elemente."

msgid ""
"Public files upload destination is dangerous for webforms that are "
"available to anonymous and/or untrusted users."
msgstr ""
"Die verstekoplaaibestemming vir openbare lêers is gevaarlik vir "
"webvorms wat beskikbaar is vir anonieme en/of nie-vertroude "
"gebruikers."

msgid "Webform submissions cleared."
msgstr "Webvorm-inskrywings is skoongemaak."

msgid "Webform submissions purged."
msgstr "Webvorm-inlewerings verwyder."

msgid "Webform selection"
msgstr "Webvorm-keuse"

