msgstr "’n Webvorm wat verstekindieningswaardes bevat."

msgid "Webform PHP mailer"
msgstr "Webvorm PHP-posversender"

msgid ""
"A +/- value describes a dynamic value that is that many years earlier "
"or later than the current year at the time the webform is displayed."
msgstr ""
"’n +/--waarde beskryf ’n dinamiese waarde wat so baie jare vroeër "
"of later is as die huidige jaar op die tydstip wanneer die webvorm "
"vertoon word."

msgid ""
"Randomizes the order of the options when they are displayed in the "
"webform."
msgstr ""
"Verruil die volgorde van die opsies wanneer dit in die webvorm vertoon "
"word."

msgid ""
"If checked, all existing submission values will be visible to the "
"webform's users."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal alle bestaande indieningswaardes sigbaar wees "
"vir die webvorm se gebruikers."

msgid "The default value of the composite webform element as YAML."
msgstr "Die verstekwaarde van die saamgestelde webvormelement as YAML."

