"Randomizes the order of the questions when they are displayed in the "
"webform."
msgstr ""
"Willekeurig die volgorde van die vrae wanneer dit in die webvorm "
"vertoon word."

msgid "A basic contact webform template."
msgstr "’ n Basiese kontakkaartjie-webvormsjabloon."

msgid "An employee evaluation webform template."
msgstr "’n Werknemer-evaluering webvorm-sjabloon."

msgid "An issue webform template."
msgstr "’n Kwessie-webvormsjabloon."

