msgstr "Wys elemente in tabelkolomme"

msgid ""
"If checked, the <a href=\":href\">autocomplete</a> attribute will be "
"set to off, which disables autocompletion for all form elements."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal die <a href=\":href\">outovoltooiing</a>-eienskap "
"op af gestel word, wat outovoltooiing vir alle vormelemente "
"deaktiveer."

msgid "Disable off-canvas system tray"
msgstr "Deaktiveer die buite-die-skerm stelselbalk (off-canvas)"

