msgstr "Webvorm-demo: Aansoek-/Evaluasiestelsel"

msgid ""
"If set, this message will be used when an element's allowed number of "
"values is exceeded, instead of the default \"@message\" message."
msgstr ""
"As dit gestel is, sal hierdie boodskap gebruik word wanneer die "
"toegelate aantal waardes vir ’n element oorskry word, in plaas van "
"die verstekboodskap “@message”."

msgid ""
"If the close date/time is left blank, this webform will never be "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"As die sluitingsdatum/tyd leeg gelaat word, sal hierdie webvorm nooit "
"gesluit word nie."

msgid "Page title to be shown upon successful submission."
msgstr "Bladsytitel wat vertoon moet word ná suksesvolle indiening."

msgid ""
"A jQuery plugin for entering and validating international telephone "
"numbers. It adds a flag dropdown to any input, detects the user's "
"country, displays a relevant placeholder and provides "
"formatting/validation methods."
msgstr ""
"’n jQuery-inprop vir die invoer en validering van internasionale "
"telefoonnommers. Dit voeg ’n vlag-aftrekkieslys by enige invoerveld, "
"bepaal die gebruiker se land, wys ’n toepaslike plekhouer en bied "
"formatering- en valideringsmetodes."

msgid ""
"Select 'Webform from URL' to display this block, when the current "
"request's path contains the selected webform."
msgstr ""
"Kies ‘Webvorm vanaf URL’ om hierdie blok te vertoon wanneer die "
"huidige versoek se pad die geselekteerde webvorm bevat."

msgid ""
"Select 'Webform submission from URL' to display this block, when the "
"current request's path contains a webform submission that was created "
"from the selected webform."
msgstr ""
"Kies “Webvormindiening vanaf URL” om hierdie blok te vertoon, "
"wanneer die huidige versoek se pad ’n webvormindiening bevat wat uit "
"die geselekteerde webvorm geskep is."

msgid ""
"Select 'Node from URL' to display this block, when the current "
"request's path contains a node that references the selected webform "
"using a dedicated webform field or node."
msgstr ""
"Kies “Node vanaf URL” om hierdie blok te vertoon wanneer die "
"huidige versoek se pad ’n node bevat wat die geselekteerde webvorm "
"verwys via ’n toegewyde webvormveld of node."

msgid "Provides an element to render advanced HTML markup and processed text."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n element om gevorderde HTML-opmaak en verwerkte teks weer "
"te gee."

msgid "Tree delimiter"
msgstr "Boomskakelaar-skeier"

msgid ""
"Provides a form element to select a single or multiple terms displayed "
"as hierarchical tree or as breadcrumbs using a select menu."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n vormelement om ’n enkele of veelvuldige terme te kies "
"wat as ’n hiërargiese boom of as broodkrummels vertoon word deur "
"’n kieslys te gebruik."

msgid "Demo: Application Evaluation"
msgstr "Demo: Toepassing-evaluering"

msgid "Limit term depth"
msgstr "Beperk termdiepte"

msgid "Default submission logging"
msgstr "Vaikgestelde indieningslogboekregistrasie"

msgid "Form previous submissions notification"
msgstr "Kennisgewing oor vorige indienings"

msgid "Email to address options"
msgstr "E-pos na adresopsies"

msgid "Email from address options"
msgstr "E-pos vanafadres-opsies"

msgid "Return path email"
msgstr "Stuurpad-e-pos"

msgid ""
"To uninstall Webform node, delete all content that has the Webform "
"content type."
msgstr ""
"Om ’n Webform-node te verwyder, skrap alle inhoud wat die "
"Webform-inhoudtipe gebruik."

msgid ""
"There is data for this element in the database. This setting can no "
"longer be changed."
msgstr ""
"Daar is data vir hierdie element in die databasis. Hierdie instelling "
"kan nie meer verander word nie."

msgid ""
"If the open date/time is left blank, this form will immediately be "
"opened."
msgstr ""
"As die oopmaakdatum/tyd leeg gelaat word, sal hierdie vorm onmiddellik "
"oopgemaak word."

msgid ""
"A message to be displayed notifying the user that the webform is going "
"to be opening to submissions. The opening message will only be "
"displayed when a webform is scheduled to be opened."
msgstr ""
"’n Boodskap wat aan die gebruiker vertoon moet word om in kennis te "
"stel dat die webvorm gaan oopmaak vir indienings. Die openingsboodskap "
"sal slegs vertoon word wanneer ’n webvorm geskeduleer is om "
"oopgemaak te word."

msgid ""
"A message to be displayed notifying the user that the webform is "
"closed. The closed message will be displayed when a webform's status "
"is closed or a submission limit is reached."
msgstr ""
"’n Boodskap wat vertoon word om die gebruiker in kennis te stel dat "
"die webvorm gesluit is. Die geslote boodskap sal vertoon word wanneer "
"’n webvorm se status op gesluit gestel is of wanneer ’n "
"indieningslimiet bereik word."

msgid ""
"If checked, the submit button will be disabled immediately after it is "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die indienknoppie onmiddellik ná dit geklik is, "
"gedeaktiveer word."

msgid "Allow your users to save and finish the webform later"
msgstr "Laat jou gebruikers toe om die webvorm later te stoor en af te handel"

msgid "Authenticated and anonymous users"
msgstr "Geverifieerde en anonieme gebruikers"

msgid ""
"Please make sure to enable the <a href=\":href\">automatic purging of "
"draft submissions</a>, to ensure that your database is not filled with "
"abandoned anonymous submissions in draft."
msgstr ""
"Maak asseblief seker dat u die <a href=\":href\">outomatiese skoonmaak "
"van konsep-inskrywings</a> aktiveer, sodat u databasis nie gevul raak "
"met verlate anonieme konsep-inskrywings nie."

msgid "Submission behaviors"
msgstr "Indieninggedrag"

msgid ""
"If checked, drafts and submissions created by an anonymous user will "
"be reassigned to their user account when they login."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal konsepte en voorleggings wat deur ’n anonieme "
"gebruiker geskep is, weer aan hul gebruikersrekening toegewys word "
"wanneer hulle aanmeld."

msgid "Log submission events"
msgstr "Teken gebeurtenisinskrywings aan"

msgid "International Telephone Input is used by the Telephone element."
msgstr "International Telephone Input word deur die Telefoon-element gebruik."

msgid ""
"A simple jQuery plugin that transforms a select element into a more "
"user friendly graphical interface."
msgstr ""
"’n Eenvoudige jQuery-inprop wat ’n select-element omskep in ’n "
"meer gebruikersvriendelike grafiese koppelvlak."

msgid "The username of the user that submitted the webform."
msgstr "Die gebruikersnaam van die gebruiker wat die webvorm ingedien het."

msgid ""
"If checked, all submission events will be logged to dedicated "
"submission log available to all webforms and submissions."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal alle indieningsgebeurtenisse aangeteken word in "
"’n toegewyde indieningslog wat beskikbaar is vir alle webvorms en "
"indienings."

msgid "Default reply-to email"
msgstr "Standaard antwoord-op e-posadres"

msgid "Default return path (email)"
msgstr "Standaardterugkeerpad (e-pos)"

msgid "Set submission source entity: @source_entity"
msgstr "Stel indieningsbron-entiteit: @source_entity"

msgid ""
"Use this field's %entity_type entity as the webform submission's "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik hierdie veld se %entity_type-entiteit as die bronentiteit vir "
"die webvorminskrywing."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the current page's entity will be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity. For example, if this webform was displayed "
"on a node's page, the current node would be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity."
msgstr ""
"As dit nie gemerk is nie, sal die huidige bladsy se entiteit gebruik "
"word as die bronentiteit vir die webvorminskrywing. Byvoorbeeld, as "
"hierdie webvorm op ’n node se bladsy vertoon is, sal die huidige "
"node as die webvorminskrywing se bronentiteit gebruik word."

msgid "Open value"
msgstr "Maak waarde oop"

msgid "Close value"
msgstr "Sluit waarde"

msgid "Default submission data (YAML)"
msgstr "Standaard indieningsdata (YAML)"

msgid "The @title close date cannot be before the open date"
msgstr "Die @title-sluitingsdatum kan nie voor die openingsdatum wees nie."

msgid "Initial country"
msgstr "Aanvanklike land"

msgid "Image select"
msgstr "Beeld kies"

msgid "Provides a form element for selecting images."
msgstr "Verskaf ’n vormelement vir die keuse van beelde."

msgid "'@subject' sent to '@to_mail' from '@from_name' [@from_mail]'."
msgstr "'@subject' gestuur na '@to_mail' van '@from_name' [@from_mail]'."

msgid "Other (Used when 'other' value is entered)"
msgstr "Ander (Gebruik wanneer die waarde “ander” ingevoer word)"

msgid "Empty (Used when no option is selected)"
msgstr "Leeg (word gebruik wanneer geen opsie gekies is nie)"

msgid "Webform Demo: Event Registration System"
msgstr "Webform-demo: Gebeurtenisregistrasiestelsel"

msgid "Webform scheduled email commands"
msgstr "Webvorm-geplande e-posopdragte"

msgid "Allows webform emails to be scheduled."
msgstr "Laat toe dat e-posse van webvorms geskeduleer word."

msgid "Handler @id is not a scheduled email handler."
msgstr "Hanteerder @id is nie ’n geskeduleerde e-poshanteerder nie."

msgid "Webform Scheduled Email Handler"
msgstr "Webvorm Geskeduleerde E-poshanteraar"

msgid "scheduled"
msgstr "geskeduleer"

msgid "Scheduled email @action for @handler handler."
msgstr "Beplande e-pos @action vir @handler-hanteerder."

msgid "queued to be sent."
msgstr "wagry om gestuur te word."

msgid "Scheduled email status (@total)"
msgstr "Geplande e-posstatus (@total)"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended that <a href=\":href\">submission "
"logging</a> is enable to track scheduled emails."
msgstr ""
"Dit word sterk aanbeveel dat die <a "
"href=\":href\">inskrywingregistrasie</a> geaktiveer is om "
"geskeduleerde e-posse op te spoor."

msgid "Send email on"
msgstr "Stuur e-pos oor"

msgid "Check schedule emails after submissions have been processed."
msgstr "Gaan e-posse vir skedules na nadat indienings verwerk is."

msgid "Multiple handlers can be used to schedule multiple emails."
msgstr ""
"Verskeie hanteerders kan gebruik word om verskeie e-posse te "
"skeduleer."

msgid "Deleting this handler will unschedule all scheduled emails."
msgstr ""
"Deur hierdie hanteerder te verwyder, sal alle geskeduleerde e-posse "
"ontplan word."

msgid ""
"Scheduled emails are automatically sent starting at midnight using <a "
"href=\":href\">cron</a>, which is executed at predefined interval."
msgstr ""
"Geplande e-posse word outomaties vanaf middernag gestuur deur <a "
"href=\":href\">cron</a>, wat teen ’n voorafbepaalde interval "
"uitgevoer word."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>not sent</b> for %handler handler because a "
"<em>To</em>, <em>CC</em>, or <em>BCC</em> email was not provided."
msgstr ""
"%submission: E-pos <b>nie gestuur nie</b> vir %handler-behandelaar "
"omdat ’n <em>Na</em>-, <em>CC</em>- of <em>BCC</em>-e-pos nie "
"verskaf is nie."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>not scheduled</b> for %handler handler because "
"%send is not a valid date/token."
msgstr ""
"%submission: E-pos <b>nie geskeduleer</b> vir %handler-werkingsmiddel "
"omdat %send nie ’n geldige datum/-token is nie."

msgid ""
"%submission: Email <b>@action</b> by %handler handler to be sent on "
"%date."
msgstr ""
"%submission: E-pos <b>@action</b> deur %handler hanteerder om gestuur "
"te word op %date."

msgid "%submission: Email <b>unscheduled</b> for %handler handler."
msgstr "%submission: E-pos <b>onbeplan</b> vir %handler-ontvanger."

msgid "Unschedule:"
msgstr "Ontskeduleer:"

msgid "Show all webforms"
msgstr "Wys al die webvorms"

msgid "Select how multiple values are displayed."
msgstr "Kies hoe veelvuldige waardes vertoon word."

msgid "Contact Documentation"
msgstr "Kontaktdokumentasie"

msgid "Webform Cookbook"
msgstr "Webform-kookboek"

msgid "Signature related-projects"
msgstr "Handtekeningverwante projekte"

msgid "Form builder comparison"
msgstr "Skemabouer-vergelyking"

msgid ""
"Webform is much heavier; it has a great deal of functionality enabled "
"right within the one module, and that's on top of supplying all the "
"normal field elements (because it doesn't just use the Field API)"
msgstr ""
"Webform is baie swaarder; dit het ’n hele klomp funksionaliteit wat "
"reg binne een module geaktiveer is, en dit is benewens die verskaffing "
"van al die normale veld-elemente (aangesien dit nie net die Field API "
"gebruik nie)."

msgid ""
"Please post comments and feedback to this <a href=\":href\">Google "
"Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"Plaas asseblief kommentaar en terugvoer op hierdie <a "
"href=\":href\">Google-vel</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> library is <a "
"href=\":external_href\">externally hosted libraries</a> and loaded via "
"a Content Delivery Network (CDN)."
msgstr ""
"Die <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a>-biblioteek is <a "
"href=\":external_href\">ekstern-gasheerde biblioteke</a> en word "
"gelaai via ’n Content Delivery Network (CDN)."

msgid ""
"A jQuery plugin that makes long, unwieldy select boxes much more "
"user-friendly."
msgstr ""
"’n jQuery-inprop wat lang, omslagtige keuselyste baie meer "
"gebruikersvriendelik maak."

msgid "Leave blank to use %email as the '@title' email."
msgstr "Laat leeg om %email as die “@title”-e-pos te gebruik."

msgid "File upload limit"
msgstr "Lêeroplaailimiet"

msgid "Excluded submission handlers"
msgstr "Uitsluitende indieningshandlers"

msgid "Purging settings"
msgstr "Suiweringsinstellings"

msgid ""
"If checked, source entity can be populated using query string "
"parameters. For example, appending "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 to a webform's URL would "
"set a submission's 'Submitted to' value to 'node:1'."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, kan die bron-entiteit met behulp van "
"navraagstringparameters gevul word. Byvoorbeeld, om "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 aan ’n webvorm se URL "
"toe te voeg, sal ’n indiening se “Submitted to”-waarde op "
"“node:1” stel."

msgid ""
"Third party settings allow contrib and custom modules to define "
"webform specific customization settings."
msgstr ""
"Derdeparty-instellings stel bydrae- en pasgemaakte modules in staat om "
"webvorm-spesifieke aanpassingsinstellings te definieer."

msgid "Required by @type element."
msgid_plural "Required by @type elements."
msgstr[0] "Vereis deur die @type-element. Vereis deur die @type-elemente."

msgid "Duplicate '@label' options"
msgstr "Dupliseer die opsies vir '@label'"

msgid "%name: this element cannot hold more than @count value."
msgid_plural "%name: this element cannot hold more than @count values."
msgstr[0] "%name: hierdie element kan nie meer as @count waarde bevat nie."
msgstr[1] "%name: hierdie element kan nie meer as @count waardes bevat nie."

msgid ""
"Third party settings allow contrib and custom modules to define global "
"settings that are applied to all webforms and submissions."
msgstr ""
"Derdeparty-instellings stel bydrae- en pasgemaakte modules in staat om "
"globale instellings te definieer wat op alle webvorms en indienings "
"toegepas word."

msgid "File upload settings"
msgstr "Lêeroplaai-instellings"

msgid ""
"Uncheck the below optional external libraries that you do not want to "
"be used by any webforms."
msgstr ""
"Ontmerk die onderstaande opsionele eksterne biblioteke wat jy nie wil "
"hê dat enige webvorms moet gebruik nie."

msgid ""
"The default sender address for emailed webform results; often the "
"email address of the maintainer of your forms."
msgstr ""
"Die verstekafsenderadres vir e-posse met webvormresultate; dikwels die "
"e-posadres van die instandhouer van jou vorms."

msgid "Select available submission handlers"
msgstr "Kies beskikbare indieningshanteerders"

msgid "Wizard previous"
msgstr "W T tower vorige"

msgid "wizard previous"
msgstr "towenaar vorige"

msgid "Wizard next"
msgstr "Wenster volgende"

msgid "wizard next"
msgstr "tovenaarsvolgende"

msgid "Computed settings"
msgstr "Berekeningsinstellings"

msgid ""
"This computed element's value will only be available as a token or "
"exported value."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie berekende element se waarde sal slegs as ’n token of as ’n "
"uitgevoerde waarde beskikbaar wees."

msgid "Computed value/markup"
msgstr "Berekende waarde/markup"

msgid ""
"The value will be stored in the database. As a result, it will only be "
"recalculated when the submission is updated. This option is required "
"when accessing the computed element through Views."
msgstr ""
"Die waarde sal in die databasis gestoor word. Gevolglik sal dit slegs "
"herbereken word wanneer die inskrywing opgedateer word. Hierdie opsie "
"is nodig wanneer die berekende element via Views verkry word."

msgid ""
"Provides an item to display computed webform submission values using "
"tokens."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n item om berekende webvorm-inskrywingwaardes met tokens te "
"vertoon."

msgid ""
"Provides an item to display computed webform submission values using "
"Twig."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n item om berekende webvormindieningwaardes te vertoon deur "
"middel van Twig."

msgid ""
"Prevent SPAM webform submissions from being submitted without "
"JavaScript enabled using the <a href=\":href_antibot\">antibot</a> "
"method."
msgstr ""
"Voorkom dat SPAM-webvorminskrywings ingedien word sonder dat "
"JavaScript geaktiveer is deur die <a "
"href=\":href_antibot\">antibot</a>-metode te gebruik."

msgid "Default empty option required label"
msgstr "Standaardleë opsie vereiste etiket"

msgid "Default empty option optional label"
msgstr "Standaard leë opsie opsionele etiket"

msgid "Form prepopulate source entity required"
msgstr "Vormvoorafvulling vereis bron-entiteit"

msgid "Form prepopulate source entity type"
msgstr "Vormvoorlaaiingsbron-entiteitstipe"

msgid "Submission user columns"
msgstr "Indieningsgebruikerkolomme"

msgid "Always include private and restricted access elements."
msgstr "Sluit altyd elemente met privaat en beperkte toegang in."

msgid ""
"Below columns are displayed to users who can view previous submissions "
"and/or pending drafts."
msgstr ""
"Die volgende kolomme word aan gebruikers gewys wat vorige indienings "
"en/of hangende konsepte kan sien."

msgid "Select settings"
msgstr "Kies instellings"

msgid "Default empty option optional"
msgstr "Standaardleë opsie opsioneel"

msgid "The default recipient address for emailed webform results."
msgstr "Die verstekontvangeradres vir e-posse wat webvormresultate bevat."

msgid ""
"Webform and source entity are automatically detected based on the "
"current page request. You can use the below settings to hardcode the "
"submission limit block's webform and source entity."
msgstr ""
"Webvorm en bron-entiteit word outomaties opgespoor op grond van die "
"huidige bladsyeurversoek. Jy kan die onderstaande instellings gebruik "
"om die indieningslimietblok se webvorm en bron-entiteit hard te "
"kodeer."

msgid "An %label id is required."
msgstr "’n %label-ID word benodig."

msgid "A valid %label is required."
msgstr "Daar word ’n geldige %label vereis."

msgid "Date year range reverse"
msgstr "Datumjaarreeks omgekeerd"

msgid "If checked date year range will be listed from max to min."
msgstr ""
"As die vinkje aangeskakel is, sal die datumjaarreeks van maksimum tot "
"minimum gelys word."

msgid "Time picker input - Use jQuery time picker with custom time format"
msgstr ""
"Tydkieser-invoer – Gebruik ’n jQuery-tydkieser met ’n "
"pasgemaakte tydformaat"

msgid ""
"If character counter is enabled, maxlength will automatically be set "
"to the count maximum."
msgstr ""
"As die karaktertelleraanskakeling geaktiveer is, sal maxlength "
"outomaties op die maksimum telling gestel word."

msgid ""
"@name cannot be longer than %max @type but is currently %length @type "
"long."
msgstr ""
"@name kan nie langer as %max @type wees nie, maar is tans %length "
"@type lank."

msgid "If checked, access controls for included element will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal toegangbeheer vir ingeslote elemente geïgnoreer "
"word."

msgid ""
"This webform contains private and/or restricted access elements, which "
"will only be included if the user submitting the form has access to "
"these elements."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie webvorm bevat private en/of beperk-toegang elemente, wat slegs "
"ingesluit sal word indien die gebruiker wat die vorm indien toegang "
"tot hierdie elemente het."

msgid "Webform handler response tokens."
msgstr "Webvorm-kenmerkreaksie-token."

msgid "Empty element message/placeholder"
msgstr "Leë elementboodskap/plaashouer"

msgid "Tidy HTML markup"
msgstr "Netjiese HTML-opmaak"

msgid "Provides a webform element example."
msgstr "Verskaf ’n voorbeeld van ’n webvormelement."

msgid "Webform Element Example"
msgstr "Webvormelement-voorbeeld"

msgid "Provides an example that shows how to create a Webform element."
msgstr "Verskaf ’n voorbeeld wat wys hoe om ’n Webform-element te skep."

msgid "Provides an example of a webform submission posted to a remote server."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf ’n voorbeeld van ’n webvorm-indiening wat na ’n afgeleë "
"bediener gepos word."

msgid ""
"There are no nodes with webform entity references. Please create add a "
"Webform field to content type."
msgstr ""
"Daar is geen nodes met webvorm-entiteitsverwysings nie. Skep asseblief "
"’n Webvorm-veld in die inhoudstipe."

msgid "There are no webform node references."
msgstr "Daar is geen webvorm-noderigheidverwysings nie."

msgid "Provides starter templates that can be used to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Bied beginnersjablone aan wat gebruik kan word om nuwe webvorms te "
"skep."

msgid "Advanced HTML markup rendered using a text format."
msgstr ""
"Gevorderde HTML-opmaak wat met behulp van ’n teksformaat weergegee "
"word."

msgid ""
"Requires understanding <a href=\":href\">how to build tables using "
"render arrays</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vereis begrip van <a href=\":href\">hoe om tabelle te bou met behulp "
"van render arrays</a>."

msgid "Secure value (changeable via server-side code and tokens)."
msgstr "Veilige waarde (veranderbaar via kode aan die serverkant en tokens)."

msgid "Allows value to be computed using [tokens]."
msgstr "Laat toe dat ’n waarde bereken word met [tokens]."

msgid "Basic HTML markup."
msgstr "Basiese HTML-opmaak."

msgid ""
"If checked, dismissible promotion messages that appear when the "
"Webform module is updated will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal weglaatbare promosieberigte wat verskyn wanneer die "
"Webform-module opgedateer word, gedeaktiveer word."

msgid ""
"Note: Promotions are only visible to users who can <em>administer "
"modules</em>."
msgstr ""
"Let wel: Promosies is slegs sigbaar vir gebruikers wat <em>modules kan "
"administreer</em>."

msgid ""
"If checked, &lt;p&gt; tags, which can add top and bottom margins, will "
"be removed from all single line HTML markup."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal &lt;p&gt;-merkers—wat boonste en onderste marges "
"kan byvoeg—uit alle enkelreël HTML-opmaak verwyder word."

msgid ""
"The admin title will always be displayed when managing elements and "
"viewing & downloading submissions."
msgstr ""
"Die administrasie-titel sal altyd vertoon word wanneer elemente "
"bestuur word en wanneer indienings bekyk en afgelaai word."

msgid ""
"If an element's title is hidden, the element's admin title will be "
"displayed when viewing a submission."
msgstr ""
"As ’n element se titel versteek is, sal die element se "
"administratiewe titel vertoon word wanneer ’n indiening bekyk word."

msgid "Details (opened)"
msgstr "Besonderhede (oopgemaak)"

msgid "Details (closed)"
msgstr "Besonderhede (toegemaak)"

msgid "This is a @label value."
msgstr "Dit is ’n waarde van @label."

msgid "Computed Elements"
msgstr "Berekeningselemente"

msgid "These are the terms of service."
msgstr "Dit is die diensvoorwaardes."

msgid ""
"In order to create a link to your terms, wrap the words where you want "
"your link to be in curly brackets."
msgstr ""
"Om ’n skakel na jou terme te skep, draai die woorde waaar jy wil hê "
"jou skakel moet wees in krullerige hakies."

msgid "Terms of service settings"
msgstr "Diensvoorwaardes-instellings"

msgid "Provides a terms of service element."
msgstr "Verskaf ’n bepalings-van-diens-element."

msgid "@form webform remote @type post (@state) to @url failed. @message"
msgstr ""
"Die @form webform-afstandsfooi @type post (@state) na @url het misluk. "
"@message"

msgid "Handler instance ID"
msgstr "Hanteerder-instans-ID"

msgid "Webform example composite"
msgstr "Webvorm-voorbeeld saamgestelde komponent"

msgid "Schedule email"
msgstr "Skeduleer e-pos"

msgid "Trigger/Value"
msgstr "Sneller/Waarde"

msgid "Webform settings @label has been saved."
msgstr "Webvorm-instellings @label is gestoor."

msgid ""
"Form is being posted using a custom method. Confirmation page must be "
"handled by the <a href=\":href\">custom form action</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vorm word met behulp van ’n pasgemaakte metode gepos. "
"Bevestigingsbladsy moet hanteer word deur die <a "
"href=\":href\">pasgemaakte vormaksie</a>."

msgid ""
"Saving of submissions is disabled, submission settings, submission "
"limits, purging and the saving of drafts is disabled. Submissions must "
"be sent via an email or handled using a <a href=\":href\">custom "
"webform handler</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die stoor van indienings is gedeaktiveer; indieningsinstellings, "
"indieningsperke, skoonmaak (purging) en die stoor van konsepte is ook "
"gedeaktiveer. Indienings moet per e-pos gestuur word of hanteer word "
"deur ’n <a href=\":href\">pasgemaakte webvorm-ontvanger</a>."

msgid "Required message"
msgstr "Vereiste boodskap"

msgid ""
"Specifies the legal number intervals. Leave blank to support any "
"number interval. Decimals are supported."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die wettige getalintervalle. Laat leeg om enige "
"getalinterval te ondersteun. Desimale word ondersteun."

msgid ""
"You can set sub-element properties using a double underscore between "
"the sub-element's key and sub-element's property "
"(subelement__property). For example, you can add custom attributes or "
"states (conditional logic) to the title sub-element using "
"'title__attributes' and 'title__states'."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan sub-elementeienskappe instel deur ’n dubbele onderstreep "
"tussen die sub-element se sleutel en die sub-element se eienskap te "
"gebruik (subelement__property). Byvoorbeeld, jy kan pasgemaakte "
"eienskappe of state (voorwaardelike logika) by die titel-sub-element "
"voeg deur ’n gebruik te maak van ’n **'title__attributes'** en "
"**'title__states'**."

msgid ""
"Elements that collect multiple option values include multi-select, "
"checkboxes, and toggles."
msgstr ""
"Elemente wat verskeie opsiewaardes insamel, sluit meerkeuse "
"(multi-select), merkblokkies en skakelaars in."

msgid "Limit settings"
msgstr "Beperkingsinstellings"

msgid ""
"Descriptions, which are only applicable to radios and checkboxes, can "
"be delimited using ' -- '."
msgstr ""
"Beskrywings, wat slegs van toepassing is op radio- en merkblokkies, "
"kan met ' -- ' afgebaken word."

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Installed)"
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (Geïnstalleer)"

msgid ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"color-warning\"><strong>@title @version</strong> "
"(CDN).</span>"

msgid "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."
msgstr "<strong>@title @version</strong> (CDN)."

msgid "<a href=\":href\">Disable CDN warning</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":href\">Skakel CDN-waarskuwing af</a>"

msgid ""
"@total libraries (@installed installed; @excluded excluded; @missing "
"CDN)"
msgstr ""
"@total-biblioteke (@installed installed; @excluded uitgesluit; "
"@missing CDN ontbreek)"

msgid "Drupal Association"
msgstr "Drupal Vereniging"

msgid ""
"The below requirements are checked by the <a href=\":href\">Status "
"report</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die onderstaande vereistes word nagegaan deur die <a "
"href=\":href\">statusverslag</a>."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, all warnings about Webform SPAM protection will be "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"As dit nie gemerk is nie, sal alle waarskuwings oor "
"Webform-SPAM-beskerming gedeaktiveer word."

msgid "Check that all entered values for this element are unique."
msgstr "Kontroleer dat alle ingevoerde waardes vir hierdie element uniek is."

msgid ""
"Check that entered values for this element is unique for the current "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Maak seker dat die ingevoerde waardes vir hierdie element uniek is vir "
"die huidige bron-entiteit."

