msgid "Contact URL"
msgstr "Kontak-URL"

msgid "Webforms: Submissions log"
msgstr "Webvorms: Indieningslogboek"

msgid "Default wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "Standaard-wizardbevestigingsetiket"

msgid "Default more title"
msgstr "Standaard meer-opsie-titel"

msgid "Default section title tag"
msgstr "Standaard-afdelingtitel-tag"

msgid "Wizard confirmation label"
msgstr "Towenaarbevestigingsetiket"

msgid "Track wizard progress in the URL"
msgstr "Volg die vorderingslyn van die towenaar in die URL"

msgid "Schedule emails for all existing submissions"
msgstr "Skeduleer e-posse vir alle bestaande inskrywings"

msgid "Webforms: Templates"
msgstr "Webvorms: Sjablone"

msgid "Emailing & handling submissions"
msgstr "E-pos stuur en indienings hanteer"

msgid "Collecting webform submissions"
msgstr "Versameling van webvorm-inskrywings"

msgid "Understanding a webform submission"
msgstr "Om ’n webvorm-inskrywing te verstaan"

msgid "Attaching webforms to nodes"
msgstr "Koppel webvorms aan nodusse"

msgid "Placing webforms as blocks"
msgstr "Plaas webvorms as blokke"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Templates</strong> page lists reusable templates that can "
"be duplicated and customized to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Templates</strong> lys herbruikbare sjablone wat "
"gedupliseer en aangepas kan word om nuwe webvorms te skep."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Forms configuration</strong> page allows administrators to "
"manage form settings, behaviors, labels, messages and CSS classes."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy **<strong>Vormsopstelling</strong>** stel administrateurs "
"in staat om vorminstellings, gedrag, etikette, boodskappe en "
"CSS-klasname te bestuur."

msgid "Configuration: Elements"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Elemente"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable element types and manage element specific settings, "
"properties, behaviors and formatting."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy **<strong>Elemente-konfigurasie</strong>** stel "
"administrateurs in staat om elementsoorte in of uit te skakel en "
"elementspesifieke instellings, eienskappe, gedrag en formatering te "
"bestuur."

msgid "Configuration: Options"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Opsies"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Options configuration</strong> page lists reusable "
"predefined options/values available for select menus, radio buttons, "
"checkboxes and Likert elements."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Opsieskonfigurasie</strong> lys herbruikbare "
"voorafbepaalde opsies/waardes wat beskikbaar is vir keuselyste, "
"radioknoppies, merkblokkies en Likert-elemente."

msgid "Configuration: Submissions"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Inskrywings"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to manage submissions settings, behaviors and messages."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Inleweringskonfigurasie</strong> laat "
"administrateurs toe om inleweringsinstellings, gedrag en boodskappe te "
"bestuur."

msgid "Configuration: Handlers"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Hanteerders"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handlers configuration</strong> page allows administrators "
"to enable/disable handlers and configure default email settings and "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy **<strong>Handlers-konfigurasie</strong>** laat "
"administrateurs toe om hanteraars in/uit te skakel en om "
"verstek-e-posinstellings en boodskappe op te stel."

msgid ""
"<strong>Handlers</strong> are used to route submitted data to external "
"applications and send notifications & confirmations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hanteerders</strong> word gebruik om ingediende data na "
"eksterne toepassings te stuur en kennisgewings en bevestigings te "
"stuur."

msgid "Configuration: Exporters"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Eksporteerders"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporters configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable exporters and configure default "
"export settings."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy **<strong>Uitvoerderskonfigurasie</strong>** laat "
"administrateurs toe om uitvoerders aan/af te skakel en "
"verstekuitvoerinstellings te konfigureer."

msgid ""
"<strong>Exporters</strong> are used to export results into a "
"downloadable format that can be used by MS Excel, Google Sheets and "
"other spreadsheet applications."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Uitvoerders</strong> word gebruik om resultate na ’n "
"aflaaibare formaat uit te voer wat gebruik kan word deur MS Excel, "
"Google Sheets en ander sigbladtoepassings."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Biblioteke"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Libraries configuration</strong> page allows "
"administrators to enable/disable libraries and define global custom "
"CSS/JavaScript used by all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Biblioteke-konfigurasie</strong> stel "
"administrateurs in staat om biblioteke in of uit te skakel en globale "
"pasgemaakte CSS/JavaScript te definieer wat deur alle webvorms gebruik "
"word."

msgid "Configuration: Libraries: Help"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Biblioteke: Hulp"

msgid "Configuration: Advanced"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Gevorderd"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Advanced configuration</strong> page allows an "
"administrator to enable/disable UI behaviors, manage requirements and "
"define data used for testing webforms."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Gevorderde konfigurasie</strong> stel ’n "
"administrateur in staat om UI-gedrag in of uit te skakel, vereistes te "
"bestuur en data te definieer wat vir toetsing van webvorms gebruik "
"word."

msgid "Configuration: Translate"
msgstr "Konfigurasie: Vertaal"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate configuration</strong> page allows webform "
"messages and labels to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Vertaalopstelling</strong> laat toe dat "
"webvormboodskappe en -etikette in verskeie tale vertaal word."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Element plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform element plugins."
msgstr ""
"Die oorsigbladsy van <strong>Element-inproppe</strong> lys al die "
"beskikbare webvorm-element-inproppe."

msgid ""
"<strong>Webform Element</strong> plugins are used to enhance existing "
"render/form elements. Webform element plugins provide default "
"properties, data normalization, custom validation, element "
"configuration form and customizable display formats."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Webvorm-element</strong>-inproppe word gebruik om bestaande "
"weergawe-/vormelemente te verbeter. Webvorm-elementinproppe verskaf "
"verstekeienskappe, data-normalisering, pasgemaakte "
"geldigheidskontrole, elementkonfigurasievorms en aanpasbare "
"vertoonformate."

msgid "Plugins: Emails/Handlers"
msgstr "Inproppe: E-posse/Handlers"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Handler plugins</strong> overview page lists all available "
"webform handler plugins."
msgstr ""
"Die oorsigbladsy vir <strong>Handler-inproppe</strong> lys al die "
"beskikbare webvorm-Handler-inproppe."

msgid "Plugins: Exporters"
msgstr "Inproppe: Uitvoerders"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Exporter plugins</strong> overview page lists all "
"available results exporter plugins."
msgstr ""
"Die oorsigbladsy van die <strong>uitvoer-plugins</strong> lys al die "
"beskikbare uitvoerder-plugins."

msgid ""
"The (View) <strong>Source</strong> page allows developers to edit a "
"webform's render array using YAML markup."
msgstr ""
"Die (Aansig)-<strong>Bron</strong>-blad laat ontwikkelaars toe om ’n "
"webvorm se weergawe-ryk (render array) te wysig deur YAML-merkering te "
"gebruik."

msgid ""
"Developers can use the (View) <strong>Source</strong> page to alter a "
"webform's labels quickly, cut-n-paste multiple elements, reorder "
"elements, as well as  add custom properties and markup to elements."
msgstr ""
"Ontwikkelaars kan die (View) <strong>Source</strong>-blad gebruik om "
"’n webvorm se etikette vinnig te verander, veelvuldige elemente te "
"kopieer en te plak, elemente te herorden, asook om pasgemaakte "
"eienskappe en opmaak by elemente te voeg."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Test</strong> form allows a webform to be tested using a "
"customizable test dataset."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Toets</strong>-vorm laat jou toe om ’n webvorm te toets "
"deur gebruik te maak van ’n aanpasbare toetsspesifieke datastel."

msgid ""
"The <strong>API</strong> form allows developers to test a webform's "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>API</strong>-vorm stel ontwikkelaars in staat om ’n "
"webvorm se API te toets."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Translate</strong> page allows a webform's configuration "
"and elements to be translated into multiple languages."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Vertaal</strong>-bladsy laat jou toe om die konfigurasie "
"en elemente van ’n webvorm na verskeie tale te vertaal."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Elements</strong>  page allows users to add, update, "
"duplicate and delete elements and wizard pages."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Elemente</strong> stel gebruikers in staat om "
"elemente en toorkykblaaie (wizard pages) by te voeg, op te dateer, te "
"dupliseer en uit te vee."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Emails/Handlers</strong> page allows additional actions "
"and behaviors to be processed when a webform or submission is created, "
"updated, or deleted."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>E-posse/Behandelaars</strong> laat bykomende aksies "
"en gedrag toe om verwerk te word wanneer ’n webvorm of inskrywing "
"geskep, bygewerk of uitgevee word."

msgid "Settings: General"
msgstr "Instellings: Algemeen"

msgid ""
"The <strong>General</strong> settings page allows a webform's "
"administrative information, paths, behaviors and third-party settings "
"to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy vir die <strong>Algemene</strong>-instellings laat jou toe "
"om ’n webvorm se administratiewe inligting, paaie, gedrag en "
"derdeparty-instellings aan te pas."

msgid "Settings: Form"
msgstr "Instellings: Vorm"

msgid "Settings: Submissions"
msgstr "Instellings: Inskrywings"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> settings page allows a submission's "
"labels, behaviors, limits and draft settings to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Indienings</strong>-instellingsbladsy laat jou toe om ’n "
"indiening se etikette, gedrag, perke en konsepinstellings aan te pas."

msgid "Settings: Confirmation"
msgstr "Instellings: Bevestiging"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Confirmation</strong> settings page allows the submission "
"confirmation type, message and URL to be customized."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy vir <strong Bevestiging</strong>-instellings laat jou toe "
"om die indieningsbevestigingstipe, boodskap en URL aan te pas."

msgid "Settings: Assets"
msgstr "Instellings: Bates"

msgid ""
"The <strong>CSS/JS</strong> settings page allows site builders to "
"attach custom CSS and JavaScript to a webform."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy met die <strong>CSS/JS</strong>-instellings stel werfbouers "
"in staat om persoonlike CSS en JavaScript aan ’n webvorm te koppel."

msgid "Settings: Access"
msgstr "Instellings: Toegang"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions</strong> page lists all incoming submissions "
"for all webforms."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy <strong>Inskrywings</strong> lys alle inkomende inskrywings "
"vir alle webvorms."

msgid "Submissions: Log"
msgstr "Inskrywings: Teken aan"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Submissions log</strong> page tracks all submission events "
"for all webforms that have submission logging enabled. Submission "
"logging can be enabled globally or on a per webform basis."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Indieningslog</strong>-blad spoor alle indieningsgebeure "
"op vir alle webvorms waarvoor indieningslogboekopname geaktiveer is. "
"Indieningslogboekopname kan wêreldwyd geaktiveer word, of op ’n "
"per-webvorm-grondslag."

msgid "Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Resultate: Insendings"

msgid "Results: Log"
msgstr "Resultate: Tekenlog"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Results Log</strong> lists all webform submission events "
"for the current webform."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Resultate-log</strong> lys al die "
"webvormindiengebeurtenisse vir die huidige webvorm."

msgid "Results: Download"
msgstr "Resultate: Laai af"

msgid "Submission: View"
msgstr "Indiening: Bekyk"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Data (YAML)</strong> page displays a submission's raw data "
"as YAML."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Data (YAML)</strong>-bladsy wys die indiening se rou data "
"as YAML."

msgid "Submission: Log"
msgstr "Indiening: Logboek"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Log</strong> page shows all events and transactions for a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Log</strong>-bladsy wys alle gebeure en transaksies vir "
"’n indiening."

msgid "Submission: Edit"
msgstr "Inskrywing: Wysig"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit</strong> form allows the administrator to update a "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Wysig</strong>-vorm stel die administrateur in staat om "
"’n indiening op te dateer."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Edit all</strong> form allows administrator to update all "
"values for submission create from a multi-step form."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Wysig alles</strong>-vorm stel administrateurs in staat om "
"al die waardes op te dateer vir indiening wat uit ’n meerstapvorm "
"geskep word."

msgid "Submission: Resend"
msgstr "Inskrywing: Hertoetsend"

msgid "Submission: Notes"
msgstr "Inskrywing: Notas"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Notes</strong> form allows administrator to flag and "
"annotate a submission."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Notas</strong>-vorm laat administrateurs toe om ’n "
"indiening te merk en van aantekeninge te voorsien."

msgid "Devel: Export"
msgstr "Devel: Eksporteer"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Schema</strong> page displays an overview of a webform's "
"elements and specified data types, which can be used to map webform "
"submissions to an external API."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Skema</strong>-bladsy toon ’n oorsig van ’n webvorm se "
"elemente en gespesifiseerde datatipes, wat gebruik kan word om "
"webvorm-inssendings aan ’n eksterne API toe te wys."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Node</strong> allows webforms to be fully integrated "
"into a website as nodes."
msgstr ""
"’n <strong>Webform-nodus</strong> stel webvorms in staat om ten "
"volle in ’n webwerf as nodusse geïntegreer te word."

msgid "Webform Node: References"
msgstr "Webvormnodus: Verwysings"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Reference</strong> pages displays an overview of a "
"webform's references and allows you to quickly create new references "
"(a.k.a Webform nodes)."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Verwysings</strong>-bladsye wys ’n oorsig van ’n "
"webvorm se verwysings en stel jou in staat om vinnig nuwe verwysings "
"te skep (oftewel Webform-nodusse)."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Submissions"
msgstr "Webvormknoop: Resultate: Inskrywings"

msgid "Submissions can be reviewed, updated, flagged and annotated."
msgstr "Inskrywings kan hersien, opgedateer, gemerk en geannoteer word."

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Log"
msgstr "Webvormknooppunt: Resultate: Log"

msgid "Webform Node: Results: Download"
msgstr "Webvormnodus: Resultate: Aflaai"

msgid ""
"The <strong>Download</strong> page allows a webform node's submissions "
"to be exported into a customizable CSV (Comma Separated Values) file "
"and other common data formats."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Download</strong>-bladsy laat toe dat indienings van ’n "
"webvorm-node na ’n pasmaakbare CSV-lêer (Komma-geskeide waardes) en "
"ander algemene dataformate uitgevoer word."

msgid ""
"A <strong>Webform Block</strong> allows a webform to be placed "
"anywhere on a website."
msgstr ""
"’n <strong>Webvorm-blok</strong> stel jou in staat om ’n webvorm "
"nêrens op ’n webwerf te plaas nie."

msgid "Message: Webform UI Disabled"
msgstr "Boodskap: Webvorm UI gedeaktiveer"

msgid ""
"Please enable the <strong>Webform UI</strong> module if you would like "
"to add easily add and manage elements using a drag-n-drop user "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer asseblief die <strong>Webform UI</strong>-module as jy maklik "
"elemente wil byvoeg en bestuur met behulp van ’n sleep-en-los "
"(drag-n-drop) gebruikerskoppelvlak."

msgid "Star/flag the status of this submission"
msgstr "Merk/merk die status van hierdie indiening as (ster/vlag)"

msgid ""
"Inline (reloads the current page and replaces the webform with the "
"confirmation message)"
msgstr ""
"Inlyn (herlaai die huidige bladsy en vervang die webvorm met die "
"bevestigingsboodskap)"

msgid ""
"Modal (reloads the current page/form and displays the confirmation "
"message in a modal dialog)"
msgstr ""
"Modale venster (laai die huidige bladsy/vorm weer en vertoon die "
"bevestigingsboodskap in ’n modale dialoogvenster)"

msgid ""
"If checked, users will not be allowed to navigate back to the form "
"using the browser's back button."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal gebruikers nie toegelaat word om terug te gaan "
"na die vorm deur die blaaier se terug-knoppie te gebruik nie."

msgid "Track wizard progress in the URL by"
msgstr "Volg die vorderingsassistent se status in die URL deur"

msgid "Page name (?page=contact)"
msgstr "Bladsynaam (?page=contact)"

msgid "Page index (?page=2)"
msgstr "Bladsy-indeks (?page=2)"

msgid ""
"Properties do not have to prepended with a hash (#) character, the "
"hash character will be automatically added to the custom properties."
msgstr ""
"Eienskappe hoef nie met ’n hash (#)-karakter voorafgegaan te word "
"nie; die hash-karakter sal outomaties by die pasgemaakte eienskappe "
"gevoeg word."

msgid ""
"If saving of submissions is disabled, submission settings, submission "
"limits, purging and the saving of drafts will be disabled. Submissions "
"must be sent via an email or processed using a custom <a "
"href=\":href\">webform handler</a>."
msgstr ""
"As die stoor van indienings gedeaktiveer is, sal "
"indieningsinstellings, indieningslimiete, opruiming en die stoor van "
"konsepte gedeaktiveer word. Indienings moet via ’n e-pos gestuur "
"word of verwerk word deur ’n pasgemaakte <a "
"href=\":href\">webvormbehandelaar</a>."

msgid "Convert anonymous user drafts and submissions to authenticated user"
msgstr ""
"Skakel anonieme gebruiker-ontwerpe en indienings om na ’n "
"geverifieerde gebruiker"

msgid ""
"If checked users will be able to update a submission using the "
"webform's URL appended with the submission's (secure) token."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, kan gebruikers ’n indiening opdateer deur die "
"webvorm se URL te gebruik, waaraan die indiening se (veilige) token "
"aangeheg is."

msgid ""
"Only webforms that are open to new submissions can be updated using "
"the secure token."
msgstr ""
"Slegs webvorms wat oop is vir nuwe indienings, kan met die veilige "
"token opgedateer word."

msgid "All submission event are being logged for all webforms"
msgstr "Alle indieninggebeurtenisse word vir alle webvorms aangeteken."

msgid ""
"Submissions accessed using the (secure) token will by-pass all webform "
"submission access rules."
msgstr ""
"Indien voorleggings verkry word met behulp van die (veilige) token, "
"word alle webvorm-voorleggings-toegangsreëls omseil."

msgid ""
"Limit the number of submissions per user. A user is identified by "
"their user id if logged-in, or by their Cookie if anonymous."
msgstr ""
"Beperk die aantal indienings per gebruiker. ’n Gebruiker word "
"geïdentifiseer deur hul gebruikers-ID as hulle aangemeld is, of deur "
"hul Koekie as hulle anoniem is."

msgid "Above test data is keyed by element #type."
msgstr "Bostaande toetsdata word gesorteer volgens element #type."

msgid ""
"Batch email size is used by any handler that sends out bulk emails. "
"This include the scheduled email handler."
msgstr ""
"Die groottelimiet van groepspos word gebruik deur enige bewerker wat "
"grootmaat-e-posse stuur. Dit sluit die geskeduleerde e-posbewerk in."

msgid ""
"Allowed tags are applied to any element property that may contain HTML "
"markup. Element properties which can contain HTML markup include "
"#title, #description, #field_prefix, and #field_suffix."
msgstr ""
"Toegelate merkers word toegepas op enige element-eienskap wat "
"HTML-opmaak kan bevat. Element-eienskap wat HTML-opmaak kan bevat, "
"sluit #title, #description, #field_prefix en #field_suffix in."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the first default option for a required select "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Die etiket om vir die eerste verstekopsie van ’n vereiste kieslys te "
"wys."

msgid ""
"The label to show for the first default option for an optional select "
"menus."
msgstr ""
"Die etiket om te wys vir die eerste verstekopsie vir ’n opsionele "
"kieslys."

msgid ""
"Redirect anonymous users to login when attempting to access private "
"file uploads"
msgstr ""
"Lei anonieme gebruikers om na die aanmeldbladsy wanneer hulle probeer "
"om toegang tot private lêeroplaaie te kry."

msgid ""
"If checked, anonymous users will be redirected to the user login page "
"when attempting to access private file uploads."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal anonieme gebruikers na die "
"gebruikersaanmeldbladsy herlei word wanneer hulle probeer om toegang "
"tot private lêer-oplaaie te kry."

msgid "Display collapse/expand all details link on all webforms"
msgstr "Vertoon die ineenstort/uitbrei alles-skakel vir alle webvorms"

msgid ""
"If checked, an expand/collapse all details link will be added to all "
"webforms which contain two or more details elements."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal ’n uitbrei-/ineenklap-alle besonderhede-skakel "
"bygevoeg word aan alle webvorms wat twee of meer besonderhede-elemente "
"bevat."

msgid ""
"The default email address that a recipient will see when they are "
"replying to an email. Leave blank to automatically use the 'From "
"email' address. Setting the 'Reply-to' to the 'From email' prevent "
"emails from being flagged as spam."
msgstr ""
"Die verstek-e-posadres wat ’n ontvanger sal sien wanneer hulle op "
"’n e-pos reageer. Laat leeg om outomaties die «Van-e-pos»-adres te "
"gebruik. As die «Antwoord-aan» op die «Van-e-pos»-adres gestel "
"word, voorkom dit dat e-posse as strooipos gemerk word."

msgid ""
"The default email address to which bounce messages are delivered. "
"Leave blank to automatically use the 'From email' address."
msgstr ""
"Die verstek-e-posadres waarheen terugstuurkennisgewings afgelewer "
"word. Laat leeg om outomaties die ‘Van’-e-posadres te gebruik."

msgid ""
"The default sender name which is used along with the default sender "
"email address."
msgstr ""
"Die verstek-afsendernaam wat saam met die verstek-afsender e-posadres "
"gebruik word."

msgid ""
"Enter the amount of submissions to be purged during single cron run. "
"You may want to lower this number if you are facing memory or timeout "
"issues when purging via cron."
msgstr ""
"Voer die hoeveelheid inskrywings in wat tydens een cron-interval "
"gesuiwer moet word. Jy sal dalk hierdie getal wil verlaag as jy "
