msgstr "Webvorm-toeganklikheid"

msgid "Drupal 8 Accessibility"
msgstr "Drupal 8 Toeganklikheid"

msgid ""
"Progress tracking allows analytic software to capture a multi-step "
"form's progress."
msgstr ""
"Voortgangnasporing stel analitiese sagteware in staat om die vordering "
"van ’n meerstappige vorm vas te lê."

msgid ""
"If checked, users will be able to reset a form and restart multi-step "
"wizards. Current drafts will be deleted when the form is reset."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal gebruikers ’n vorm kan terugstel en "
"meerstap-owerhede weer begin. Huidige konsepte sal uitgevee word "
"wanneer die vorm teruggestel word."

msgid ""
"A local file system path where temporary export files will be stored. "
"This directory should be persistent between requests and should not be "
"accessible over the web."
msgstr ""
"’ n Plaaslike lêerstelselpad waar tydelike uitvoer-lêers gestoor "
"sal word. Hierdie gids moet tussen versoeke volhard en nie oor die web "
"toeganklik wees nie."

msgid "Dependent_locality"
msgstr "Afhanklike plaaslikheid"

msgid "(Display purposes only)"
msgstr "(Slegs vir uitstallingsdoeleindes)"

msgid ""
"If checked, any element used within the computed value/markup will "
"trigger any automatic update."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal enige element wat binne die berekende waarde/merker "
"gebruik word, enige outomatiese opdatering aktiveer."

msgid "Validation error message"
msgstr "Valideringsfoutboodskap"

msgid ""
"Tokens related to user roles that can receive email. <em>This token is "
"only available to a Webform email handler's 'To', 'CC', and 'BCC' "
"email recipients.</em>"
msgstr ""
"Tokens wat verband hou met gebruikersrolle wat e-pos kan ontvang. "
"<em>Hierdie token is slegs beskikbaar vir die Webform-posafhandelaar "
"se 'Aan', 'CC' en 'BCC' e-posontvangers.</em>"

msgid "Purge any submissions"
msgstr "Vee enige indienings uit."

msgid "Element text format"
msgstr "Element teksformaat"

msgid "Mail text format"
msgstr "Posformaat vir e-pos"

msgid ""
"Input masks ensures a predefined format is entered. This can be useful "
"for dates, numerics, phone numbers, etc…"
msgstr ""
"Invoer-maskers verseker dat ’n voorafbepaalde formaat ingevoer word. "
"Dit kan nuttig wees vir datums, numeriese waardes, telefoonnommers, "
"ens…"

msgid ""
"Apply classes to the @type. Select 'custom…' to enter custom "
"classes."
msgstr ""
"Wend klasse toe aan die @type. Kies ‘custom…’ om pasgemaakte "
"klasse in te voer."

msgid "Enter key…"
msgstr "Voer sleutel in…"

msgid "Enter placeholder…"
msgstr "Voer aanduiding in…"

msgid "Enter other…"
msgstr "Voer ander in…"

msgid ""
"If checked, the confirmation page will be included in the progress "
"bar."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal die bevestigingsbladsy by die vorderingsbalk "
"ingesluit word."

msgid ""
"The first page label in the progress bar. Subsequent pages are titled "
"by their wizard page title."
msgstr ""
"Die eerste bladsy-etiket in die vorderingsbalk. Volgende bladsye word "
"getiteld volgens hul towenaarbladsy-titel."

msgid "The confirmation page label's in the progress bar."
msgstr "Die bevestigingsbladsy se etiket in die vorderingsbalk."

msgid ""
"Allow (dialog) source entity to be populated using query string "
"parameters"
msgstr ""
"Laat toe dat (dialoog)bronentiteite gevul word met behulp van "
"navraagreeksparameters"

msgid ""
"Weight is used when multiple webforms are associated to the same "
"webform node."
msgstr ""
"Gewig word gebruik wanneer verskeie webvorms met dieselfde "
"webvorm-node geassosieer word."

msgid "Please note: Drafts will always be linked to submission form."
msgstr ""
"Neem asseblief kennis: Konsepte sal altyd aan die indieningsvorm "
"gekoppel word."

msgid "Enter submitted to…"
msgstr "Dien in by…"

msgid "Filter by submitted to"
msgstr "Filter op ingedien deur"

msgid ""
"Batch export size is used when submissions are being "
"exported/downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Die groottes van bondige uitvoer word gebruik wanneer voorleggings "
"uitgevoer/afgelaai word."

msgid "Batch update size is used when submissions are being bulk updated."
msgstr ""
"Die bondelopdateringsgrootte word gebruik wanneer indienings in "
"grootmaat opgedateer word."

msgid "Batch delete size is used when submissions are being cleared."
msgstr "Die bondelskrapgrootte word gebruik wanneer indienings uitgevee word."

msgid ""
"The (read) more label used to hide/show more information about an "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Die (lees) meer-etiket wat gebruik word om meer inligting oor ’n "
"element te wys/versteek."

msgid ""
"If checked, the webform dialog library will be added to every page on "
"your website, this allows any webform to be opened in a modal dialog."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die webvorm-dialoogbiblioteek by elke bladsy op "
"jou webwerf gevoeg word. Dit stel jou in staat om enige webvorm in "
"’n modale dialoog te open."

msgid ""
"Webform specific dialog links will be included on all webform settings "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Spesifieke Webform-dialoogskakels sal op alle Webform-opstellingsvorms "
"ingesluit word."

msgid "Help title"
msgstr "Hulp-tytel"

msgid "Defaults to the element's title"
msgstr "Standaard na die element se titel"

msgid "Displays a read more hide/show widget below the element's description."
msgstr ""
"Vertoon ’n lees-meer-vertoon/wegsteek-widget onder die element se "
"beskrywing."

msgid "More title"
msgstr "Meer titel"

msgid ""
"Apply classes to the element's wrapper around both the field and its "
"label. Select 'custom…' to enter custom classes."
msgstr ""
"Dien klasse toe aan die element se omhulsel rondom beide die veld en "
"die etiket. Kies ‘custom…’ om pasgemaakte klasse in te voer."

msgid "Create submission"
msgstr "Skep indiening"

msgid "Enter 'name': 'value' pairs…"
msgstr "Voer 'naam': 'waarde'-pare in…"

msgid ""
"You should consider using a dedicated Time element, instead of this "
"Date/time element, which will prepend the current date to the "
"submitted time."
msgstr ""
"Oorweeg dit om ’n toegewyde **Time**-element te gebruik, in plaas "
"van hierdie **Date/time**-element, wat die huidige datum by die "
"ingediende tyd sal voorvoeg."

msgid "Please select predefined options."
msgstr "Kies asseblief voorafbepaalde opsies."

msgid "@title visible"
msgstr "@title sigbaar"

msgid "@title title display"
msgstr "@title titel vertoon"

msgid "Remove whitespace around the"
msgstr "Verwyder witspasie rondom die"

