msgstr "Skep ’n modaalvenster in Drupal 8 | Befused"

msgid "Display forms in a modal dialog with Drupal 8 | Agaric"
msgstr "Wys vorms in ’n modale dialoog met Drupal 8 | Agaric"

msgid "Webform views integration"
msgstr "Webvorm-aansigintegrasie"

msgid "D8 Webform and Webform Views Integration @ Drupalcamp Colorado"
msgstr "D8 Webform- en Webform Views-integrasie by Drupalcamp Colorado"

msgid "RateIt is used to provide a customizable rating element."
msgstr "RateIt word gebruik om ’n aanpasbare graderingselement te verskaf."

msgid "more submission views"
msgstr "meer insendingsaansigte"

msgid ""
"A webform submission embed display. The selected view should also "
"include contextual filters. "
"{webform_id}/{source_entity_type}/{source_entity_id}/{account_id}/{in_draft}"
msgstr ""
"’n Webvorminskrywing-inbeddingsvertoning. Die geselekteerde aansig "
"moet ook kontekstuele filters insluit. "
"{webform_id}/{source_entity_type}/{source_entity_id}/{account_id}/{in_draft}"

msgid ""
"The name to be displayed in the URL when there are multiple submission "
"views available."
msgstr ""
"Die naam wat in die URL vertoon word wanneer daar verskeie "
"indieningsuitsigte beskikbaar is."

msgid ""
"The title to be display in the dropdown menu when there are multiple "
"submission views available."
msgstr ""
"Die titel wat vertoon moet word in die aftreklys wanneer daar "
"veelvuldige indieningsaansigte beskikbaar is."

msgid "Replace the global results with submission views"
msgstr "Vervang die globale resultate met indieningsaansigte"

msgid "Replace the webform results with submission views"
msgstr "Vervang die webvormuitslae met indieningsaansigte"

msgid "Replace the node results with submission views"
msgstr "Vervang die nodusresultate met indieningsaansigte."

msgid ""
"Only 'Inline', 'Message', 'Modal', and 'None' confirmation types are "
"fully supported by Ajax."
msgstr ""
"Slegs die bevestigingstipes ’**Inline**, **Message**, **Modal** en "
"**None** word ten volle deur Ajax ondersteun."

msgid "When a user is denied access to this webform"
msgstr "Wanneer ’n gebruiker toegang tot hierdie webvorm geweier word"

msgid "Login (Redirects to user login form and displays message)"
msgstr "Meld aan (herlei na die gebruikersaanmeldvorm en wys ’n boodskap)"

msgid ""
"Will be displayed either in-line or as a status message depending on "
"the setting above."
msgstr ""
"Sal óf inlyn vertoon word óf as ’n statusboodskap, afhangende van "
"die instelling hierbo."

msgid "Access denied message attributes"
msgstr "Toegang geweierde boodskapkenmerke"

msgid ""
"For example, appending "
"<code>?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1</code> to a "
"webform's URL would set a submission's 'Submitted to' value to "
"'node:1'."
msgstr ""
"Byvoorbeeld, om "
"<code>?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1</code> aan ’n "
"webvorm se URL toe te voeg, sal ’n indiening se “Ingedien "
"aan”-waarde op “node:1” stel."

msgid ""
"You can also append "
"<code>?source_entity_type=ENTITY_TYPE&amp;source_entity_id=ENTITY_ID</code> "
"and the <code>ENTITY_TYPE</code> and <code>ENTITY_ID</code> parameters "
"will automatically be replaced based on the current page's source "
"entity."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan ook "
"<code>?source_entity_type=ENTITY_TYPE&amp;source_entity_id=ENTITY_ID</code> "
"byvoeg, en die <code>ENTITY_TYPE</code>- en "
"<code>ENTITY_ID</code>-parameters sal outomaties vervang word op grond "
"van die huidige bladsy se bron-entiteit."

msgid "When a user is denied access to a submission"
msgstr "Wanneer ’n gebruiker toegang tot ’n indiening geweier word"

msgid "Page (Displays message when access is denied to a submission)"
msgstr "Bladsy (Wys boodskap wanneer toegang tot ’n indiening geweier word)"

msgid ""
"To expose your webform elements to your webform submission views. "
"Please install the <a href=\":href\">Webform Views Integration</a> "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Om jou webvormelemente aan jou webvormindienings-aansigte bloot te "
"stel. Installeer asseblief die <a href=\":href\">Webform Views "
"Integration</a>-module."

msgid "Create new submission view"
msgstr "Skep nuwe inskrywingsaansig"

msgid ""
"If checked, help text will be removed from every webform page and "
"form."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal kontouteks uit elke webvormbladsy en -vorm "
"verwyder word."

msgid ""
"Files uploaded via the CKEditor file dialog to webform elements, "
"settings, and configuration will not be exportable."
msgstr ""
"Lêers wat via die CKEditor-lêer-dialoog na webvorm-elemente, "
"instellings en konfigurasie opgelaai word, sal nie uitvoerbaar wees "
"nie."

msgid ""
"It is recommended to use the <a href=\":href\">IMCE module</a> to "
"manage webform elements, settings, and configuration files."
msgstr ""
"Dit word aanbeveel om die <a href=\":href\">IMCE-module</a> te gebruik "
"om webvorm-elemente, instellings en konfigurasielêers te bestuur."

msgid "Randomize elements"
msgstr "Randomiseer elemente"

