msgstr "Voorleggingsgebruikerinstellings"

msgid "Submission access denied settings"
msgstr "Indieningtoegang geweier-instellings"

msgid "Submission limit settings"
msgstr "Inskrywingslimiet-instellings"

msgid "Submission draft settings"
msgstr "Indieningsontwerpsinstellings"

msgid "Submission autofill settings"
msgstr "Invoervoorvulling-instellings"

msgid "Submission views settings"
msgstr "Indieningsaansig-instellings"

msgid "Form confirmation settings"
msgstr "Vormbevestiginginstellings"

msgid "Form dialog settings"
msgstr "Vormdialooginstellings"

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for a single element value. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Die HTML om te vertoon vir ’n enkele elementwaarde. Jy kan HTML "
"insluit of <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Jy kan data vanaf die indiening "
"invoer soos per die “veranderlikes” hieronder."

msgid ""
"The text to display for a single element value. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Die teks om te vertoon vir ’n enkele elementwaarde. Jy kan <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a> insluit. Jy kan data vanaf die indiening "
"invoer soos per die “veranderlikes” hieronder."

msgid ""
"The HTML to display for multiple element values. You may include HTML "
"or <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission "
"as per the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Die HTML om te vertoon vir veelvuldige elementwaardes. Jy kan HTML "
"insluit of <a href=\":href\">Twig</a>. Jy kan data vanaf die indiening "
"invoer soos per die “variables” hieronder."

msgid ""
"The text to display for multiple element values. You may include <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a>. You may enter data from the submission as per "
"the \"variables\" below."
msgstr ""
"Die teks om te vertoon vir veelvuldige elementwaardes. Jy kan <a "
"href=\":href\">Twig</a> insluit. Jy kan data vanaf die indiening "
"invoer soos hieronder onder “variables” uiteengesit."

msgid ""
"Editing webform source code allows users to alter and possibly break a "
"webform's render array."
msgstr ""
"Om die bronkode van ’n webvorm te wysig, stel gebruikers in staat om "
"die weergawe-ry (render array) van ’n webvorm aan te pas en moontlik "
"selfs te laat breek."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Upload</strong> page allows a CSV (comma separated values) "
"file or URL to be uploaded, converted, and imported into webform "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"Die <strong>Upload</strong>-bladsy laat jou toe om ’n CSV-lêer "
"(komma-geskeide waardes) of ’n URL op te laai, dit om te skakel en "
"in webvorm-invoere in te voer."

msgid "Provides the ability to export and import submissions."
msgstr "Bied die vermoë om indienings uit te voer en in te voer."

msgid "Unable to locate source entity (@entity_type:@entity_id)"
msgstr "Kon nie die bron-entiteit (@entity_type:@entity_id) opspoor nie"

msgid ""
"The upload directory %directory for the file element %name could not "
"be created or is not accessible. A newly uploaded file could not be "
"saved in this directory as a consequence, and the upload was canceled."
msgstr ""
"Die oplaai-gids %directory vir die lêerelement %name kon nie geskep "
"word nie of is nie beskikbaar nie. ’n Nuwe opgelaaide lêer kon "
"gevolglik nie in hierdie gids gestoor word nie, en die oplaai is "
"gekanselleer."

msgid "Importing submissions is a new and experimental feature."
msgstr "Om indienings in te voer is ’n nuwe en eksperimentele funksie."

msgid ""
"Please test and review your imported submissions using a "
"development/test server."
msgstr ""
"Toets en hersien asseblief jou ingevoerde indienings met behulp van "
"’n ontwikkelings-/toetsbediener."

msgid "All submission properties and data is optional."
msgstr "Alle indienings-eienskappe en data is opsioneel."

msgid "If UUIDs are included, existing submissions will always be updated."
msgstr ""
"As UUID’s ingesluit is, sal bestaande inskrywings altyd bygewerk "
"word."

msgid ""
"If UUIDs are not included, already imported and unchanged records will "
"not create duplication submissions."
msgstr ""
"As UUID’s nie ingesluit word nie, sal rekords wat reeds ingevoer is "
"en ongewysig bly, nie duplikaatstuurings skep nie."

msgid ""
"File uploads must use publicly access URLs which begin with http:// or "
"https://."
msgstr ""
"Lêeroplaaie moet publieke toegangs-URL’s gebruik wat met http:// of "
"https:// begin."

msgid "Entity references can use UUIDs or entity IDs."
msgstr "Entiteitsverwysings kan UUID’s of entiteits-ID’s gebruik."

msgid ""
"Composite (single) values are annotated using double underscores. "
"(e.g. ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"
msgstr ""
"Samestellende (enkel) waardes word met dubbel onderstrepings "
"geannoteer. (bv. ELEMENT_KEY__SUB_ELEMENT_KEY)"

msgid ""
"Multiple composite values are formatted using <a href=\":href\">inline "
"YAML</a>."
msgstr ""
"Verskeie saamgestelde waardes word geformateer deur gebruik te maak "
"van <a href=\":href\">lyn-vir-lyn YAML</a>."

msgid "Import maximum execution time limit is @time."
msgstr "Invoer maksimum uitvoeringstydlimiet is @time."

msgid ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">View</a> or <a "
"href=\":href_download\">download</a> an example submission CSV."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":href_view\">Bekyk</a> of <a "
"href=\":href_download\">laai</a> ’n voorbeeld-CSV indiening af."

msgid "Import data source"
msgstr "Importeer databron"

msgid "Upload Submission CSV file"
msgstr "Laai Indienings-CSV-lêer op"

msgid "Enter Submission CSV remote URL"
msgstr "Voer die CSV-aanhegbare afgeleë URL vir indiening in"

msgid "Remote URL could be a <a href=\":href\">published Google Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"Afstand-URL kan ’n <a href=\":href\">gepubliseerde Google-blad</a> "
"wees."

msgid "Submission CSV (Comma Separated Values) file"
msgstr "Inskrywing CSV (Komma-geskeide waardes) lêer"

msgid "Are you sure you want to import @submissions?"
msgstr "Is jy seker jy wil @submissions invoer?"

msgid ""
"No UUID or token was found in the source (CSV). A unique hash will be "
"generated for the each CSV record. Any changes to already an imported "
"record in the source (CSV) will create a new submission."
msgstr ""
"Geen UUID of token is in die bron (CSV) gevind nie. ’n Unieke hash "
"sal vir elke CSV-inskrywing gegenereer word. Enige wysigings aan ’n "
"reeds geïmporteerde inskrywing in die bron (CSV) sal ’n nuwe "
"indiening skep."

msgid "Import mapping"
msgstr "Voer karterings in"

msgid "Importing submissions"
msgstr "Invoer van indienings"

msgid "Imported @count of @total submissions…"
msgstr "Geïmporteer @count van @total insendings…"

msgid ""
"Submission import completed. (total: @total; created: @created; "
"updated: @updated; skipped: @skipped)"
msgstr ""
"Indiening-invoer voltooi. (totaal: @total; geskep: @created; "
"opgedateer: @updated; oorgeslaan: @skipped)"

msgid "Webform module now supports importing submissions | Drupal.org"
msgstr "Webform-module ondersteun nou die invoer van indienings | Drupal.org"

msgid ""
"Batch import size is used when submissions are being "
"imported/uploaded."
msgstr ""
"Die bondel-invoergrootte word gebruik wanneer indienings "
"ingevoer/opgelaai word."

msgid "If checked, users will be able search/filter images by their labels."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal gebruikers prente op grond van hul etikette kan "
"soek en filter."

msgid "Filter placeholder label"
msgstr "Filter-aanduidingslabel"

msgid "Filter single item label"
msgstr "Filter enkellopende itemetiket"

msgid "Filter plural items label"
msgstr "Filter meervouditems-etiket"

msgid "Filter no results label"
msgstr "Filter geen resultate-etiket"

msgid ""
"CSV data that can't be converted to submission data will display a "
"warning. If checked, these warnings will be treated as errors and "
"prevent the submission from being created."
msgstr ""
"CSV-data wat nie na indieningsdata omgeskakel kan word nie, sal ’n "
"waarskuwing vertoon. As dit gemerk is, sal hierdie waarskuwings as "
"foute behandel word en sal dit verhoed dat die indiening geskep word."

msgid "Webforms for Healthcare"
msgstr "Webvorms vir Gesondheidsorg"

msgid ""
"This presentation discusses how healthcare organizations can leverage "
"the Webform module for Drupal 8."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie aanbieding bespreek hoe gesondheidsorgorganisasies die "
"Webform-module vir Drupal 8 kan benut."

