msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die volgende nommer outomaties ingestel word op "
"die interne indienings-ID."

msgid ""
"If checked, all submission properties and values  will be included in "
"the displayed debug information. This includes sid, created, updated, "
"completed, and more."
msgstr ""
"Indien gemerk, sal alle indienings-eienskappe en waardes in die "
"vertoonde ontfoutingsinligting ingesluit word. Dit sluit in sid, "
"created, updated, completed en meer."

