msgstr ""
"Die URL of pad waarheen die gebruiker herlei moet word na suksesvolle "
"indiening."

msgid ""
"Paths beginning with a forward slash (/) will redirect be treated as "
"root-relative. Paths without a forward slash (/) will redirect be "
"treated as Drupal relative path."
msgstr ""
"Paaie wat met ’n skuinsstreep vorentoe (/) begin, sal as "
"root-verwant behandel word vir herleiding. Paaie sonder ’n "
"skuinsstreep vorentoe (/) sal as ’n Drupal-verwante pad behandel "
