msgid ""
"Here is a detailed feature-comparison of Webform and Contact Storage "
"8.x-1.x.&nbsp;It's worth noting that Contact Storage relies on the "
"Contact module which in turn relies on the Field UI; Contact Storage "
"out of the box is a minimalistic solution with limited (but useful!) "
"functionality. This means it can be extended with core mechanisms such "
"as CRUD entity hooks and overriding services; also there's a greater "
"chance that a general purpose module will play nicely with it (eg. the "
"Conditional Fields module is for entity form displays in general, not "
"the Contact module)."
msgstr ""
"Hier is ’n gedetailleerde funksie-vergelyking tussen Webform en "
"Contact Storage 8.x-1.x.&nbsp;Dit is die moeite werd om te noem dat "
"Contact Storage staatmaak op die Contact-module, wat weer staatmaak op "
"Field UI. Contact Storage is van die boks af ’n minimalistiese "
"oplossing met beperkte (maar nuttige!) funksionaliteit. Dit beteken "
"dit kan uitgebrei word met kernmeganismes soos CRUD-entity-enkapsies "
"(hooks) en die oorskryf van dienste; daar is ook ’n groter kans dat "
"’n algemene doeleindes-module goed daarmee sal saamwerk (bv. die "
"Conditional Fields-module is vir entiteitsvormvertonings in die "
"algemeen, nie vir die Contact-module nie)."

