"href=\":href\">Webform outo-stoor-module</a> te gebruik."

msgid ""
"The <strong>Forms</strong> management page lists all available "
"webforms, which can be filtered by the following: keyword (including "
"title, description, elements, user name, or role), category, and "
"status."
msgstr ""
"Die bladsy **<strong>Skjema’s</strong>-bestuur** lys al die "
"beskikbare webvorms, wat gefiltreer kan word op grond van die "
"volgende: sleutelwoord (insluitend titel, beskrywing, elemente, "
"gebruikersnaam of rol), kategorie en status."

msgid ""
"Hiding the %label button can cause unexpected issues. If checked, make "
"sure there is another 'Submit button(s)' element in your form."
msgstr ""
"Om die %label-knoppie te versteek, kan tot onverwagte probleme lei. "
"Indien dit gemerk is, maak seker daar is ’n ander element vir ’n "
"“Stuur-knoppie(s)” in jou vorm."

msgctxt "form"
msgid "Webform"
msgstr "Webvorm"

msgid "Default confirmation noindex"
msgstr "Standaardbevestiging noindex"

msgid "Example textarea"
msgstr "Voorbeeld teksarea"

msgid "Please enter some text."
msgstr "Voer asseblief ’n bietjie teks in."

msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> Opening %type files with spreadsheet "
"applications may expose you to <a href=\":injection_href\">formula "
"injection</a> or other security vulnerabilities. When the submissions "
"contain data from untrusted users and the downloaded file will be used "
"with Microsoft Excel, use the <a href=\":excel_href\">Webform XLSX "
"export</a> module."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Waarskuwing:</strong> Om %type-lêers met sigbladtoepassings "
"oop te maak, kan jou blootstel aan <a "
"href=\":injection_href\">formule-inspuiting</a> of ander "
"sekuriteitskwesbaarhede. Wanneer die indienings data bevat van "
"nie-vertroude gebruikers en die afgelaaide lêer met Microsoft Excel "
"gebruik gaan word, gebruik die <a href=\":excel_href\">Webform "
"XLSX-uitvoer</a>-module."

msgctxt "module"
msgid "Webform"
msgstr "Webvorm"

msgid "Default confirmation robots noindex"
msgstr "Standaardbevestiging-robots noindex"

msgid ""
"If checked, a meta tag robots noindex directive  will be added to the "
"confirmation page of all webforms."
msgstr ""
"As dit gekies is, sal ’n meta-tag met die robots-nodindex-riglyn op "
"die bevestigingsblad van alle webvorms bygevoeg word."

msgid "Webform submissions can only be unlocked programmatically."
msgstr "Webvorm-indienings kan slegs programmaties ontsluit word."

msgid ""
"An error occurred while trying to validate the submission. Please save "
"your work and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"Daar is ’n fout opgetree terwyl daar gepoog is om die indiening te "
"valideer. Stoor asseblief jou werk en laai hierdie bladsy weer."

msgid "@label (Users, custom email addresses, Administrators)"
msgstr "@label (Gebruikers, pasgemaakte e-posadresse, Administrateurs)"

msgid ""
"If you enjoy and value Drupal and the Webform module consider <a "
"href=\":href_involved\">getting involved in the Drupal community</a>, "
"<a href=\":href_join\">joining the Drupal Association</a>, and <a "
"href=\":href_opencollective\">contributing funds to the Webform "
"module's Open Collective</a>."
msgstr ""
"As jy Drupal en die Webform-module geniet en waardeer, oorweeg dit om "
"<a href=\":href_involved\">betrokke te raak by die "
"Drupal-gemeenskap</a>, <a href=\":href_join\">by die Drupal-vereniging "
"aan te sluit</a>, en <a href=\":href_opencollective\">fondse by te dra "
"tot die Webform-module se Open Collective</a>."

msgid "This behavior is not supported when Ajax is enabled."
msgstr "Hierdie gedrag word nie ondersteun wanneer Ajax geaktiveer is nie."

msgid ""
"If checked, the browser back button will submit the previous page and "
"navigate back emulating the behavior of user clicking a wizard or "
"preview page's back button."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal die blaaier se terug-knoppie die vorige bladsy "
"indien en terugnavigasie uitvoer, wat die gedrag naboots van ’n "
"gebruiker wat op die terug-knoppie van ’n towenaar of voorskoubladsy "
"klik."

msgid "@name must be %max @type but is currently %length @type long."
msgstr "`@name` moet %max `@type` wees, maar tans is dit %length `@type` lank."

msgid "@name must be at least %min @type but is currently %length @type long."
msgstr ""
"@name moet ten minste %min @type wees, maar dit is tans %length @type "
"lank."

msgid "Decimal (-)"
msgstr "Desimaal (-)"

msgid "Decimal (+/-)"
msgstr "Desimaal (+/-)"

msgid "If checked, variants will be available using query string parameters."
msgstr ""
"As dit gemerk is, sal variante beskikbaar wees met behulp van "
"navraagreeksparameters."

msgid ""
"This is used for the Previous Page button on the page before this page "
"break."
msgstr ""
"Dit word gebruik vir die Vorige bladsy-knoppie op die bladsy voor "
"hierdie bladsybreuk."

msgid ""
"This is used for the Next Page button on the page after this page "
"break."
msgstr ""
"Dit word gebruik vir die Volgende bladsy-knoppie op die bladsy ná "
"hierdie bladsybreuk."

msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> Opening %type files with spreadsheet "
"applications may expose you to <a href=\":injection_href\">formula "
"injection</a> or other security vulnerabilities. When the submissions "
"contain data from untrusted users and the downloaded file will be used "
"with Microsoft Excel, use the <strong>XLSX</strong> export format."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Waarskuwing:</strong> Om %type-lêers met sigbladtoepassings "
"oop te maak, kan jou blootstel aan <a "
"href=\":injection_href\">formule-inspuiting</a> of ander "
"sekuriteitskwesbaarhede. Wanneer die inskrywings data bevat van "
"onbetroubare gebruikers en die afgelaaide lêer met Microsoft Excel "
"gebruik gaan word, gebruik die <strong>XLSX</strong>-uitvoerformaat."

msgid ""
"The Drupal Association is an educational non-profit organization that "
"tasks itself with fostering and supporting the Drupal software "
"project, the community and its growth."
msgstr ""
"Die Drupal Vereniging is ’n opvoedkundige nie-winsgewende "
"organisasie wat hom daaraan toewy om die Drupal-sagtewareprojek, die "
"gemeenskap en die groei daarvan te bevorder en te ondersteun."

