msgid ""
"The Webform module may not update properly using this administrative "
"interface. It is strongly recommended that you update the Webform "
"module <a href=\":href_manual\">manually</a> or by using <a "
"href=\":href_composer\">Composer</a>."
msgstr ""
"Die Webform-module mag dalk nie behoorlik opdateer via hierdie "
"administratiewe koppelvlak nie. Dit word sterk aanbeveel dat jy die "
"Webform-module <a href=\":href_manual\">handmatig</a> opdateer, of "
"deur <a href=\":href_composer\">Composer</a> te gebruik."

