"voordat die vorm ingedien word nie."

msgid ""
"The <em>Context</em> module lets users define conditions for when "
"certain reactions should take place."
msgstr ""
"Die <em>Context</em>-module laat gebruikers toe om voorwaardes te "
"definieer wanneer sekere reaksies moet plaasvind."

msgid ""
"An example of a condition could be when viewing a certain node type "
"and blocks should be placed as a reaction when viewing a page with "
"this node type."
msgstr ""
"’n Voorbeeld van ’n voorwaarde kan wees wanneer daar na ’n "
"sekere nodustipe gekyk word, en blokke as ’n reaksie geplaas moet "
"word wanneer ’n bladsy met hierdie nodustipe bekyk word."

msgid "Managing Context"
msgstr "Bestuur van konteks"

msgid ""
"Users with <em>Administer contexts</em> permission can add contextual "
"conditions and reactions for different portions of their site. For "
"each context, they can choose the conditions that trigger this context "
"to be active and choose different aspects of their site that should "
"react to this active context."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikers met die <em>Administreer kontekste</em>-toestemming kan "
"kontekstuele voorwaardes en reaksies vir verskillende dele van hul "
"werf byvoeg. Vir elke konteks kan hulle kies watter voorwaardes "
"hierdie konteks laat aktiveer, en watter aspekte van hul werf moet "
"reageer op hierdie aktiewe konteks."

msgid "Adding new custom reactions"
msgstr "Om nuwe pasgemaakte reaksies by te voeg"

msgid ""
"Reactions for the context module are defined trough the new <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/developing/api/8/plugins\">Drupal 8 "
"Plugin API</a>."
msgstr ""
"Reaksies vir die konteksmodule word gedefinieer deur die nuwe <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/developing/api/8/plugins\">Drupal 8 "
"Plugin API</a>."

msgid ""
"The Context module defines a plugin type named ContextReaction that "
"users can extend when creating their own plugins."
msgstr ""
"Die Context-module definieer ’n inprop-tipe genaamd "
"**ContextReaction** wat gebruikers kan uitbrei wanneer hulle hul eie "
"inproppe skep."

msgid ""
"A context reaction requires a configuration form and execute method. "
"The execution of the plugin is also something that will have to be "
"handled by the author of the reaction."
msgstr ""
"’n Konteksreaksie vereis ’n konfigurasievorm en ’n "
"uitvoermetode. Die uitvoering van die inprop sal ook iets wees wat "
"deur die skrywer van die reaksie hanteer moet word."

