msgid ""
"Exclude individual content that has the Robots meta tag with "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Sluit individuele inhoud uit wat die Robots-meta-tag bevat met "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."

msgid ""
"The minimum amount of time that will elapse before the sitemaps are "
"regenerated. The sitemaps will also only be regenerated on cron if any "
"links have been added, updated, or deleted.<br />Recommended value: "
"<em>1 day</em>."
msgstr ""
"Die minimum hoeveelheid tyd wat moet verstryk voordat die werfkaarte "
"(sitemaps) weer gegenereer word. Die werfkaarte sal ook slegs op cron "
"hergegenereer word as enige skakels bygevoeg, opgedateer of uitgevee "
"is.<br />Aanbevole waarde: <em>1 dag</em>."

msgid ""
"Exclude individual items that has the Robots meta tag set to "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Sluit individuele items uit wat die Robots-metaanmerk gestel het op "
"<em>Voorkom dat soekenjins hierdie bladsy indekseer</em>."

msgid ""
"Note this will ignore default metatags, only when items have "
"overridden the Robots meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Neem kennis: dit sal standaardmetadata ignoreer, slegs wanneer items "
"die Robots-meta-tag oorskryf het."

msgid ""
"This can be disabled if other methods are being used to generate the "
"sitemap files, i.e. the <code>drush xmlsitemap:regenerate</code> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Dit kan gedeaktiveer word as ander metodes gebruik word om die "
"sitemap-lêers te genereer, bv. die <code>drush "
"xmlsitemap:regenerate</code>-opdrag."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap automatically creates a sitemap that conforms to the "
"sitemaps.org specification. This helps search engines keep their "
"search results up to date."
msgstr ""
"XML-werfmaps skep outomaties ’n werfkaart wat aan die "
"sitemaps.org-spesifikasie voldoen. Dit help soekenjins om hul "
"soekresultate op datum te hou."

msgid ""
"You can adjust the settings for your site's sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Your can view your site's sitemap at "
"http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan die instellings vir jou webwerf se sitemap aanpas by "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Jy kan jou webwerf se sitemap bekyk by "
"http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml."

msgid ""
"When is necessary you can rebuild your sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer dit nodig is, kan jy jou werkskaart (sitemap) herbou by "
"**admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild**."

msgid ""
"You can configure all Custom Entities Settings at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings"
msgstr ""
"Jy kan al die instellings vir Pasgemaakte Entiteite by "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings opstel."

msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that you have clean URLs enabled for this "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Dit word sterk aanbeveel dat jy skoon URL’s vir hierdie projek "
"geaktiveer het."

msgid ""
"This action rebuilds your site's XML Sitemap and regenerates the "
"cached files, and may be a lengthy process. If you just installed XML "
"Sitemap, this can be helpful to import all your site's content into "
"the sitemap. Otherwise, this should only be used in emergencies."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie aksie bou jou werf se XML-sitemap weer op en genereer die "
"gekasste lêers weer, en dit kan ’n lang proses wees. As jy XML "
"Sitemap net pas geïnstalleer het, kan dit help om al jou werf se "
"inhoud in die sitemap in te voer. Andersins behoort dit slegs in "
"noodgevalle gebruik te word."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap settings have been modified and the files should be "
"regenerated. You can <a href=\"@run-cron\">run cron manually</a> to "
"regenerate the cached files."
msgstr ""
"XML-terreinkaart-instellings is gewysig en die lêers behoort weer "
"gegenereer te word. Jy kan <a href=\"@run-cron\">cron handmatig laat "
"loop</a> om die kaslêers weer te genereer."

msgid ""
"One or more problems were detected with your XML Sitemap "
"configuration: @messages"
msgstr ""
"Een of meer probleme is opgespoor met jou XML-sitemap-konfigurasie: "
"@messages"

msgid ""
"Creates an XML Sitemap conforming to the <a "
"href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">sitemaps.org protocol</a>."
msgstr ""
"Skep ’n XML-sitemap wat ooreenstem met die <a "
"href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">sitemaps.org-protokol</a>."

msgid ""
"Configure XML Sitemap settings, select which links are included in "
"sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Konfigureer die XML-sitemap-instellings en kies watter skakels in die "
"sitemap ingesluit word."

msgid "XML Sitemap entity bundle settings"
msgstr "XML-sitemap-entiteitbundelinstellings"

msgid "Starting XML Sitemap generation. Memory usage: @memory-peak."
msgstr ""
"Begin met die generering van die XML-terreinkaart. Geheuegebruik: "
"@memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Finished XML Sitemap generation in @elapsed. Memory usage: "
"@memory-peak."
msgstr ""
"Voltooi XML-werkskema-generering in @elapsed. Geheuegebruik: "
"@memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Generated by the <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML Sitemap "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Gegenereer deur die <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML "
"Sitemap-module</a>."

msgid "Label for the XML Sitemap."
msgstr "Etiket vir die XML-sitemap."

msgid "There are currently no XML Sitemap contexts available."
msgstr "Daar is tans geen XML-terreinkaartkontekste beskikbaar nie."

msgid "@bundle XML Sitemap settings"
msgstr "@bundle XML Sitemaps-instellings"

msgid "XML Sitemap settings for the %bundle have been saved."
msgstr "XML-webwerfkaartinstellings vir die %bundle is gestoor."

msgid ""
"A rebuild is not necessary. If you are just wanting to regenerate the "
"XML Sitemap files, you can <a href=\"@link-cron\">run cron "
"manually</a>."
msgstr ""
"’N heropbou is nie nodig nie. As jy net die XML-sitemaplêers wil "
"hergenereer, kan jy <a href=\"@link-cron\">cron handmatig laat "
"loop</a>."

msgid ""
"When enabled, this will add formatting and tables with sorting to make "
"it easier to view the XML Sitemap data instead of viewing raw XML "
"output. Search engines will ignore this."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer dit geaktiveer is, sal dit formatering en tabelle met "
"sortering byvoeg om dit makliker te maak om die XML-terreinkaartdata "
"te sien, eerder as om na die rou XML-uitvoer te kyk. Soekenjins sal "
"dit ignoreer."

msgid ""
"Subdirectory where the sitemap data will be stored. This folder "
"<strong>must not be shared</strong> with any other Drupal site or "
"install using XML Sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Submap waar die sitemap-data gestoor sal word. Hierdie vouer "
"<strong>moet nie</strong> met enige ander Drupal-terrein of "
"installasie gedeel word wat XML Sitemap gebruik nie."

msgid "Override XML sitemap link settings"
msgstr "Oorskryf XML-sitemap-skakelinstellings"

msgid "Override XML sitemap settings for individual links/entities."
msgstr "Oorskryf XML-sitemap-instellings vir individuele skakels/entiteite."

